site',''),(84570,20905,'_leisure_official_website','https://heritageireland.ie/places-to-visit/annes-grove-gardens/'),(84571,20905,'_leisure_discover_ireland',''),(84572,20905,'_leisure_map_url',''),(84573,20905,'_leisure_feature',''),(84574,20905,'_leisure_free','Pago'),(84575,20905,'_leisure_family','1'),(84576,20905,'_leisure_accessibility',''),(84577,20905,'_leisure_pet_friendly',''),(84578,20905,'_leisure_indoor',''),(84579,20905,'_leisure_outdoor','1'),(84580,20905,'_leisure_parking','1'),(84581,20905,'_leisure_booking',''),(84582,20905,'_leisure_duration',''),(84583,20905,'_leisure_best_time',''),(84584,20905,'_leisure_practical_notes','Abertura sazonal de 20 de março a 27 de setembro de 2026, de quinta a segunda-feira (fechado à terça e à quarta). Entrada paga: adulto 5 EUR, sénior/grupo 4 EUR, criança/estudante 3 EUR, família 13 EUR; menores de 12 anos não pagam. Não há cafetaria — leve o seu piquenique. Não são permitidos cães (exceto cães de assistência), bicicletas, trotinetes nem drones.'),(84585,20905,'_leisure_practical_source_url','https://heritageireland.ie/places-to-visit/annes-grove-gardens/'),(84586,20905,'_leisure_practical_last_checked','2026-09-14'),(84587,20906,'_leisure_county','Cork'),(84588,20906,'_leisure_town','Carrigtwohill'),(84589,20906,'_leisure_address','Barryscourt Castle, Carrigtwohill, Co. Cork, T45 Y290'),(84590,20906,'_leisure_website',''),(84591,20906,'_leisure_official_website','https://heritageireland.ie/places-to-visit/barryscourt-castle/'),(84592,20906,'_leisure_discover_ireland',''),(84593,20906,'_leisure_map_url',''),(84594,20906,'_leisure_feature',''),(84595,20906,'_leisure_free','Pago'),(84596,20906,'_leisure_family',''),(84597,20906,'_leisure_accessibility',''),(84598,20906,'_leisure_pet_friendly',''),(84599,20906,'_leisure_indoor','1'),(84600,20906,'_leisure_outdoor','1'),(84601,20906,'_leisure_parking','1'),(84602,20906,'_leisure_booking',''),(84603,20906,'_leisure_duration',''),(84604,20906,'_leisure_best_time',''),(84605,20906,'_leisure_practical_notes','Abertura sazonal de 23 de abril a 24 de setembro de 2026, diariamente das 10:00 às 18:00 (sujeito a alterações). Visitas guiadas pagas: adulto 5 EUR, sénior/grupo 4 EUR, criança/estudante 3 EUR, família 13 EUR; jardins e zona exterior sem guia e sem custo. O acesso aos pisos superiores é apenas por visita guiada (máximo 13 pessoas) e é exigente para pessoas com mobilidade reduzida. Grupos de 10 ou mais pessoas devem reservar com antecedência.'),(84606,20906,'_leisure_practical_source_url','https://heritageireland.ie/places-to-visit/barryscourt-castle/'),(84607,20906,'_leisure_practical_last_checked','2026-09-14'),(84608,20907,'_leisure_county','Cork'),(84609,20907,'_leisure_town','Kinsale'),(84610,20907,'_leisure_address','Cork Street, Kinsale, Co. Cork, P17 TY09'),(84611,20907,'_leisure_website',''),(84612,20907,'_leisure_official_website','https://heritageireland.ie/places-to-visit/desmond-castle-kinsale/'),(84613,20907,'_leisure_discover_ireland',''),(84614,20907,'_leisure_map_url',''),(84615,20907,'_leisure_feature',''),(84616,20907,'_leisure_free','Pago'),(84617,20907,'_leisure_family',''),(84618,20907,'_leisure_accessibility',''),(84619,20907,'_leisure_pet_friendly',''),(84620,20907,'_leisure_indoor',''),(84621,20907,'_leisure_outdoor','1'),(84622,20907,'_leisure_parking',''),(84623,20907,'_leisure_booking',''),(84624,20907,'_leisure_duration',''),(84625,20907,'_leisure_best_time',''),(84626,20907,'_leisure_practical_notes','Atenção: o interior está fechado ao público devido a obras de conservação (apenas vista exterior). Quando aberto, a entrada é paga: adulto 5 EUR, sénior/grupo 4 EUR, criança/estudante 3 EUR, família 13 EUR. É um sítio sem visita guiada, com escadas íngremes e irregulares e acesso limitado. Confirme o estado de reabertura no site oficial antes de viajar até Kinsale.'),(84627,20907,'_leisure_practical_source_url','https://heritageireland.ie/places-to-visit/desmond-castle-kinsale/'),(84628,20907,'_leisure_practical_last_checked','2026-09-14'),(84629,20908,'_leisure_county','Cork'),(84630,20908,'_leisure_town','Fota Island'),(84631,20908,'_leisure_address','Fota Estate, Carrigtwohill, Co. Cork, T45 K656'),(84632,20908,'_leisure_website',''),(84633,20908,'_leisure_official_website','https://heritageireland.ie/places-to-visit/fota-arboretum-and-gardens/'),(84634,20908,'_leisure_discover_ireland',''),(84635,20908,'_leisure_map_url',''),(84636,20908,'_leisure_feature',''),(84637,20908,'_leisure_free','Gratuito'),(84638,20908,'_leisure_family','1'),(84639,20908,'_leisure_accessibility',''),(84640,20908,'_leisure_pet_friendly',''),(84641,20908,'_leisure_indoor',''),(84642,20908,'_leisure_outdoor','1'),(84643,20908,'_leisure_parking','1'),(84644,20908,'_leisure_booking',''),(84645,20908,'_leisure_duration',''),(84646,20908,'_leisure_best_time',''),(84647,20908,'_leisure_practical_notes','Entrada nos jardins gratuita, com taxa de estacionamento de 3 EUR. Aberto todo o ano: arboreto de abril a outubro das 09:00 às 18:00 e de novembro a março das 09:00 às 17:00. Visitas guiadas por marcação prévia, de segunda a sexta-feira. O Heritage Card do OPW não dá acesso à Fota House. Fechado no período natalício.'),(84648,20908,'_leisure_practical_source_url','https://heritageireland.ie/places-to-visit/fota-arboretum-and-gardens/'),(84649,20908,'_leisure_practical_last_checked','2026-09-14'),(84650,20909,'_leisure_county','Dublin'),(84651,20909,'_leisure_town','Dublin'),(84652,20909,'_leisure_address','Arbour Hill, Dublin 7, D07 YRR2'),(84653,20909,'_leisure_website',''),(84654,20909,'_leisure_official_website','https://heritageireland.ie/places-to-visit/arbour-hill-cemetery/'),(84655,20909,'_leisure_discover_ireland',''),(84656,20909,'_leisure_map_url',''),(84657,20909,'_leisure_feature',''),(84658,20909,'_leisure_free','Gratuito'),(84659,20909,'_leisure_family',''),(84660,20909,'_leisure_accessibility',''),(84661,20909,'_leisure_pet_friendly',''),(84662,20909,'_leisure_indoor',''),(84663,20909,'_leisure_outdoor','1'),(84664,20909,'_leisure_parking',''),(84665,20909,'_leisure_booking',''),(84666,20909,'_leisure_duration',''),(84667,20909,'_leisure_best_time',''),(84668,20909,'_leisure_practical_notes','Entrada gratuita. Cemitério aberto todo o ano: segunda a sexta 08:00-16:00, sábado 11:00-16:00 e domingo 09:30-16:00. Visitas guiadas às sextas-feiras às 14:00, de abril a outubro (contacte o Phoenix Park Visitor Centre). Não são permitidos cães junto ao túmulo de 1916.'),(84669,20909,'_leisure_practical_source_url','https://heritageireland.ie/places-to-visit/arbour-hill-cemetery/'),(84670,20909,'_leisure_practical_last_checked','2026-09-14'),(84671,20910,'_leisure_county','Dublin'),(84672,20910,'_leisure_town','Marino'),(84673,20910,'_leisure_address','Cherrymount Crescent, off Malahide Road, Marino, Dublin 3, D03 HH70'),(84674,20910,'_leisure_website',''),(84675,20910,'_leisure_official_website','https://heritageireland.ie/places-to-visit/casino-marino/'),(84676,20910,'_leisure_discover_ireland',''),(84677,20910,'_leisure_map_url',''),(84678,20910,'_leisure_feature',''),(84679,20910,'_leisure_free','Pago'),(84680,20910,'_leisure_family',''),(84681,20910,'_leisure_accessibility',''),(84682,20910,'_leisure_pet_friendly',''),(84683,20910,'_leisure_indoor','1'),(84684,20910,'_leisure_outdoor',''),(84685,20910,'_leisure_parking','1'),(84686,20910,'_leisure_booking',''),(84687,20910,'_leisure_duration',''),(84688,20910,'_leisure_best_time',''),(84689,20910,'_leisure_practical_notes','Entrada apenas por visita guiada: adulto 5 EUR, grupo/sénior 4 EUR, criança/estudante 3 EUR, família 13 EUR. Aberto de quinta a segunda-feira, das 09:30 às 17:30 (última entrada às 16:00); as visitas guiadas são às 10:00, 12:00, 14:00 e 16:00 (escolas e grupos às 11:00, 13:00 e 15:00). Acesso exigente, com degraus irregulares — é necessário cuidado.'),(84690,20910,'_leisure_practical_source_url','https://heritageireland.ie/places-to-visit/casino-marino/'),(84691,20910,'_leisure_practical_last_checked','2026-09-14'),(84692,20911,'_leisure_county','Dublin'),(84693,20911,'_leisure_town','Dublin'),(84694,20911,'_leisure_address','Custom House Quay, Dublin 1, D01 W6X0'),(84695,20911,'_leisure_website',''),(84696,20911,'_leisure_official_website','https://heritageireland.ie/places-to-visit/custom-house-visitor-centre/'),(84697,20911,'_leisure_discover_ireland',''),(84698,20911,'_leisure_map_url',''),(84699,20911,'_leisure_feature',''),(84700,20911,'_leisure_free','Pago'),(84701,20911,'_leisure_family',''),(84702,20911,'_leisure_accessibility',''),(84703,20911,'_leisure_pet_friendly',''),(84704,20911,'_leisure_indoor','1'),(84705,20911,'_leisure_outdoor',''),(84706,20911,'_leisure_parking',''),(84707,20911,'_leisure_booking','1'),(84708,20911,'_leisure_duration',''),(84709,20911,'_leisure_best_time',''),(84710,20911,'_leisure_practical_notes','Aberto todo o ano, diariamente das 09:30 às 17:30 (última entrada às 16:45). Entrada paga — visita guiada/autónoma: adulto 8/6 EUR, sénior 6/5 EUR, criança/estudante 4/3 EUR, família 20/15 EUR. Recomenda-se reserva online. Para acesso de mobilidade condicionada, contacte o centro com pelo menos 3 dias de antecedência.'),(84711,20911,'_leisure_practical_source_url','https://heritageireland.ie/places-to-visit/custom-house-visitor-centre/'),(84712,20911,'_leisure_practical_last_checked','2026-09-14'),(84713,20912,'_leisure_county','Dublin'),(84714,20912,'_leisure_town','Phoenix Park'),(84715,20912,'_leisure_address','Phoenix Park, Dublin 15, D15 TD50'),(84716,20912,'_leisure_website',''),(84717,20912,'_leisure_official_website','https://heritageireland.ie/places-to-visit/farmleigh-house-and-estate/'),(84718,20912,'_leisure_discover_ireland',''),(84719,20912,'_leisure_map_url',''),(84720,20912,'_leisure_feature',''),(84721,20912,'_leisure_free','Gratuito em determinadas condições'),(84722,20912,'_leisure_family','1'),(84723,20912,'_leisure_accessibility',''),(84724,20912,'_leisure_pet_friendly',''),(84725,20912,'_leisure_indoor','1'),(84726,20912,'_leisure_outdoor','1'),(84727,20912,'_leisure_parking','1'),(84728,20912,'_leisure_booking',''),(84729,20912,'_leisure_duration',''),(84730,20912,'_leisure_best_time',''),(84731,20912,'_leisure_practical_notes','Acesso aos terrenos, jardins e galeria gratuito; visita guiada à casa paga (adulto 8 EUR, sénior 6 EUR, estudante/criança 4 EUR, família 20 EUR). Terrenos abertos diariamente das 10:00 às 18:00 (última entrada às 17:00). Visitas guiadas exteriores gratuitas às 11:30 e 14:30, se o tempo permitir. Nota: a casa está fechada durante o resto de 2026 devido à Presidência do Conselho da UE.'),(84732,20912,'_leisure_practical_source_url','https://heritageireland.ie/places-to-visit/farmleigh-house-and-estate/'),(84733,20912,'_leisure_practical_last_checked','2026-09-14'),(84734,20913,'_leisure_county','Dublin'),(84735,20913,'_leisure_town','Dublin'),(84736,20913,'_leisure_address','Parnell Square East, Dublin 1, D01 AOF8'),(84737,20913,'_leisure_website',''),(84738,20913,'_leisure_official_website','https://heritageireland.ie/places-to-visit/garden-of-remembrance/'),(84739,20913,'_leisure_discover_ireland',''),(84740,20913,'_leisure_map_url',''),(84741,20913,'_leisure_feature',''),(84742,20913,'_leisure_free','Gratuito'),(84743,20913,'_leisure_family',''),(84744,20913,'_leisure_accessibility',''),(84745,20913,'_leisure_pet_friendly',''),(84746,20913,'_leisure_indoor',''),(84747,20913,'_leisure_outdoor','1'),(84748,20913,'_leisure_parking',''),(84749,20913,'_leisure_booking',''),(84750,20913,'_leisure_duration',''),(84751,20913,'_leisure_best_time',''),(84752,20913,'_leisure_practical_notes','Entrada gratuita. Aberto todo o ano: de abril a setembro das 08:30 às 18:00 e de outubro a março das 09:30 às 16:00. Duração média da visita: 1 hora. Recomenda-se calçado adequado.'),(84753,20913,'_leisure_practical_source_url','https://heritageireland.ie/places-to-visit/garden-of-remembrance/'),(84754,20913,'_leisure_practical_last_checked','2026-09-14'),(84755,20914,'_leisure_county','Dublin'),(84756,20914,'_leisure_town','Dublin'),(84757,20914,'_leisure_address','Upper Merrion Street, Dublin 2, D02 R583'),(84758,20914,'_leisure_website',''),(84759,20914,'_leisure_official_website','https://heritageireland.ie/places-to-visit/government-buildings/'),(84760,20914,'_leisure_discover_ireland',''),(84761,20914,'_leisure_map_url',''),(84762,20914,'_leisure_feature',''),(84763,20914,'_leisure_free','Gratuito'),(84764,20914,'_leisure_family',''),(84765,20914,'_leisure_accessibility',''),(84766,20914,'_leisure_pet_friendly',''),(84767,20914,'_leisure_indoor','1'),(84768,20914,'_leisure_outdoor',''),(84769,20914,'_leisure_parking',''),(84770,20914,'_leisure_booking',''),(84771,20914,'_leisure_duration',''),(84772,20914,'_leisure_best_time',''),(84773,20914,'_leisure_practical_notes','Entrada gratuita, com visitas guiadas aos sábados das 10:30 às 13:30 (partidas a cada hora e meia hora); bilhetes gratuitos recolhidos no próprio dia na National Gallery of Ireland, Clare Street, Dublin 2, a partir das 10:00. Duração média: 40 minutos. O edifício pode fechar com aviso prévio reduzido por razões de serviço do Governo — recomenda-se telefonar antes.'),(84774,20914,'_leisure_practical_source_url','https://heritageireland.ie/places-to-visit/government-buildings/'),(84775,20914,'_leisure_practical_last_checked','2026-09-14'),(84776,20915,'_leisure_county','Dublin'),(84777,20915,'_leisure_town','Dublin'),(84778,20915,'_leisure_address','Blackhorse Avenue, Dublin 7, D07 PK13'),(84779,20915,'_leisure_website',''),(84780,20915,'_leisure_official_website','https://heritageireland.ie/places-to-visit/grangegorman-military-cemetery/'),(84781,20915,'_leisure_discover_ireland',''),(84782,20915,'_leisure_map_url',''),(84783,20915,'_leisure_feature',''),(84784,20915,'_leisure_free','Gratuito'),(84785,20915,'_leisure_family',''),(84786,20915,'_leisure_accessibility',''),(84787,20915,'_leisure_pet_friendly',''),(84788,20915,'_leisure_indoor',''),(84789,20915,'_leisure_outdoor','1'),(84790,20915,'_leisure_parking',''),(84791,20915,'_leisure_booking',''),(84792,20915,'_leisure_duration',''),(84793,20915,'_leisure_best_time',''),(84794,20915,'_leisure_practical_notes','Entrada gratuita. Cemitério aberto todo o ano, todos os dias das 10:00 às 16:00. Visitas guiadas às quintas-feiras às 14:00, de abril a outubro (contacte o Phoenix Park Visitor Centre). Cães devem usar trela e recomenda-se calçado adequado.'),(84795,20915,'_leisure_practical_source_url','https://heritageireland.ie/places-to-visit/grangegorman-military-cemetery/'),(84796,20915,'_leisure_practical_last_checked','2026-09-14'),(84797,20916,'_leisure_county','Dublin'),(84798,20916,'_leisure_town','Islandbridge'),(84799,20916,'_leisure_address','Islandbridge, Dublin 8, D08 T20W'),(84800,20916,'_leisure_website',''),(84801,20916,'_leisure_official_website','https://heritageireland.ie/places-to-visit/irish-national-war-memorial-gardens/'),(84802,20916,'_leisure_discover_ireland',''),(84803,20916,'_leisure_map_url',''),(84804,20916,'_leisure_feature',''),(84805,20916,'_leisure_free','Gratuito'),(84806,20916,'_leisure_family',''),(84807,20916,'_leisure_accessibility',''),(84808,20916,'_leisure_pet_friendly',''),(84809,20916,'_leisure_indoor',''),(84810,20916,'_leisure_outdoor','1'),(84811,20916,'_leisure_parking','1'),(84812,20916,'_leisure_booking',''),(84813,20916,'_leisure_duration',''),(84814,20916,'_leisure_best_time',''),(84815,20916,'_leisure_practical_notes','Entrada gratuita. Jardins abertos todo o ano: segunda a sexta a partir das 08:00, sábado e domingo a partir das 10:00; o fecho acompanha as horas de luz. Acesso às casas dos livros por combinação com a gestão local. Visitas guiadas às quartas-feiras às 14:00, de abril a outubro (contacte o Phoenix Park Visitor Centre).'),(84816,20916,'_leisure_practical_source_url','https://heritageireland.ie/places-to-visit/irish-national-war-memorial-gardens/'),(84817,20916,'_leisure_practical_last_checked','2026-09-14'),(84818,20917,'_leisure_county','Dublin'),(84819,20917,'_leisure_town','Dublin'),(84820,20917,'_leisure_address','Clonmel Street / Hatch Street, Dublin 2'),(84821,20917,'_leisure_website',''),(84822,20917,'_leisure_official_website','https://www.iveaghgardens.ie/'),(84823,20917,'_leisure_discover_ireland',''),(84824,20917,'_leisure_map_url',''),(84825,20917,'_leisure_feature',''),(84826,20917,'_leisure_free','Gratuito'),(84827,20917,'_leisure_family','1'),(84828,20917,'_leisure_accessibility',''),(84829,20917,'_leisure_pet_friendly',''),(84830,20917,'_leisure_indoor',''),(84831,20917,'_leisure_outdoor','1'),(84832,20917,'_leisure_parking',''),(84833,20917,'_leisure_booking',''),(84834,20917,'_leisure_duration',''),(84835,20917,'_leisure_best_time',''),(84836,20917,'_leisure_practical_notes','Entrada gratuita (sítio gerido pelo OPW). Aberto ao público diariamente; os horários variam ao longo do ano — consulte a página oficial (Plan a Visit) antes da visita. Não é permitido o uso de drones nos jardins e o acesso pode ser limitado em dias de eventos ou filmagens.'),(84837,20917,'_leisure_practical_source_url','https://www.iveaghgardens.ie/'),(84838,20917,'_leisure_practical_last_checked','2026-09-14'),(84839,20918,'_leisure_county','Dublin'),(84840,20918,'_leisure_town','Rathfarnham'),(84841,20918,'_leisure_address','St. Enda\'s Park, Grange Road, Rathfarnham, Dublin 16, D16 Y7Y5'),(84842,20918,'_leisure_website',''),(84843,20918,'_leisure_official_website','https://heritageireland.ie/places-to-visit/pearse-museum-st-endas-park/'),(84844,20918,'_leisure_discover_ireland',''),(84845,20918,'_leisure_map_url',''),(84846,20918,'_leisure_feature',''),(84847,20918,'_leisure_free','Gratuito'),(84848,20918,'_leisure_family','1'),(84849,20918,'_leisure_accessibility',''),(84850,20918,'_leisure_pet_friendly',''),(84851,20918,'_leisure_indoor','1'),(84852,20918,'_leisure_outdoor','1'),(84853,20918,'_leisure_parking','1'),(84854,20918,'_leisure_booking',''),(84855,20918,'_leisure_duration',''),(84856,20918,'_leisure_best_time',''),(84857,20918,'_leisure_practical_notes','Entrada gratuita. Museu e parque abertos todo o ano, com horários sazonais: o museu abre das 09:30 às 16:00 de novembro a janeiro, às 17:00 em fevereiro e às 17:30 de março a outubro; o parque tem horários próprios, mais extensos no verão. Visitas guiadas disponíveis; grupos devem reservar com antecedência (pearsemuseum@opw.ie).'),(84858,20918,'_leisure_practical_source_url','https://heritageireland.ie/places-to-visit/pearse-museum-st-endas-park/'),(84859,20918,'_leisure_practical_last_checked','2026-09-14'),(84860,20919,'_leisure_county','Dublin'),(84861,20919,'_leisure_town','Phoenix Park'),(84862,20919,'_leisure_address','Phoenix Park, Dublin 8, D08 Y304'),(84863,20919,'_leisure_website',''),(84864,20919,'_leisure_official_website','https://heritageireland.ie/places-to-visit/phoenix-park-visitor-centre-ashtown-castle/'),(84865,20919,'_leisure_discover_ireland',''),(84866,20919,'_leisure_map_url',''),(84867,20919,'_leisure_feature',''),(84868,20919,'_leisure_free','Gratuito'),(84869,20919,'_leisure_family','1'),(84870,20919,'_leisure_accessibility',''),(84871,20919,'_leisure_pet_friendly',''),(84872,20919,'_leisure_indoor','1'),(84873,20919,'_leisure_outdoor','1'),(84874,20919,'_leisure_parking','1'),(84875,20919,'_leisure_booking',''),(84876,20919,'_leisure_duration',''),(84877,20919,'_leisure_best_time',''),(84878,20919,'_leisure_practical_notes','Entrada gratuita. Aberto todo o ano, diariamente das 09:30 às 18:00 (última entrada às 17:00). O jardim hortícola murado está aberto diariamente das 10:00 às 16:00 e o centro de biodiversidade às quartas e domingos. Fechado a 25, 26, 30 e 31 de dezembro. O centro pode fechar com aviso prévio reduzido.'),(84879,20919,'_leisure_practical_source_url','https://heritageireland.ie/places-to-visit/phoenix-park-visitor-centre-ashtown-castle/'),(84880,20919,'_leisure_practical_last_checked','2026-09-14'),(84881,20920,'_leisure_county','Dublin'),(84882,20920,'_leisure_town','Phoenix Park'),(84883,20920,'_leisure_address','Phoenix Park, Dublin 8, D08 E5RK'),(84884,20920,'_leisure_website',''),(84885,20920,'_leisure_official_website','https://heritageireland.ie/places-to-visit/phoenix-park-peoples-flower-gardens/'),(84886,20920,'_leisure_discover_ireland',''),(84887,20920,'_leisure_map_url',''),(84888,20920,'_leisure_feature',''),(84889,20920,'_leisure_free','Gratuito'),(84890,20920,'_leisure_family','1'),(84891,20920,'_leisure_accessibility',''),(84892,20920,'_leisure_pet_friendly',''),(84893,20920,'_leisure_indoor',''),(84894,20920,'_leisure_outdoor','1'),(84895,20920,'_leisure_parking',''),(84896,20920,'_leisure_booking',''),(84897,20920,'_leisure_duration',''),(84898,20920,'_leisure_best_time',''),(84899,20920,'_leisure_practical_notes','Entrada gratuita. Aberto todo o ano, com horários sazonais (de cerca das 08:00 às 16:00 no inverno, até às 21:30 no verão; sábados a partir das 10:30 e domingos a partir das 10:00). Cães devem usar trela.'),(84900,20920,'_leisure_practical_source_url','https://heritageireland.ie/places-to-visit/phoenix-park-peoples-flower-gardens/'),(84901,20920,'_leisure_practical_last_checked','2026-09-14'),(84902,20921,'_leisure_county','Dublin'),(84903,20921,'_leisure_town','Rathfarnham'),(84904,20921,'_leisure_address','Rathfarnham, Dublin 14, D14 K3T6'),(84905,20921,'_leisure_website',''),(84906,20921,'_leisure_official_website','https://heritageireland.ie/places-to-visit/rathfarnham-castle/'),(84907,20921,'_leisure_discover_ireland',''),(84908,20921,'_leisure_map_url',''),(84909,20921,'_leisure_feature',''),(84910,20921,'_leisure_free','Pago'),(84911,20921,'_leisure_family','1'),(84912,20921,'_leisure_accessibility',''),(84913,20921,'_leisure_pet_friendly',''),(84914,20921,'_leisure_indoor','1'),(84915,20921,'_leisure_outdoor','1'),(84916,20921,'_leisure_parking','1'),(84917,20921,'_leisure_booking',''),(84918,20921,'_leisure_duration',''),(84919,20921,'_leisure_best_time',''),(84920,20921,'_leisure_practical_notes','Entrada paga: adulto 5 EUR, sénior/grupo 4 EUR, criança/estudante 3 EUR, família 13 EUR. De maio a setembro, aberto diariamente das 09:30 às 17:30; de outubro a abril, de quarta a domingo e segundas-feiras de feriado, das 10:30 às 17:00. Fechado de 23 a 27 de dezembro. Visitas guiadas disponíveis; grupos devem reservar com antecedência. Nota: pode não haver ligação telefónica/internet no local.'),(84921,20921,'_leisure_practical_source_url','https://heritageireland.ie/places-to-visit/rathfarnham-castle/'),(84922,20921,'_leisure_practical_last_checked','2026-09-14'),(84923,20922,'_leisure_county','Dublin'),(84924,20922,'_leisure_town','Kilmainham'),(84925,20922,'_leisure_address','Military Road, Kilmainham, Dublin 8, D08 FW31'),(84926,20922,'_leisure_website',''),(84927,20922,'_leisure_official_website','https://heritageireland.ie/places-to-visit/royal-hospital-kilmainham/'),(84928,20922,'_leisure_discover_ireland',''),(84929,20922,'_leisure_map_url',''),(84930,20922,'_leisure_feature',''),(84931,20922,'_leisure_free','Gratuito em determinadas condições'),(84932,20922,'_leisure_family',''),(84933,20922,'_leisure_accessibility',''),(84934,20922,'_leisure_pet_friendly',''),(84935,20922,'_leisure_indoor','1'),(84936,20922,'_leisure_outdoor','1'),(84937,20922,'_leisure_parking','1'),(84938,20922,'_leisure_booking',''),(84939,20922,'_leisure_duration',''),(84940,20922,'_leisure_best_time',''),(84941,20922,'_leisure_practical_notes','Entrada gratuita, exceto em exposições especiais ocasionais. Guias no local de 12 de março a novembro de 2026; Old Man\'s House: segunda a sábado das 10:00 às 17:00 e domingo das 11:00 às 17:00, com visitas às 11:00, 13:00 e 15:00. Fora de época (novembro a março) fecha às segundas (exceto feriados). Os portões fecham às 18:30. A entrada pedonal pelo portão leste (Military Road) é íngreme.'),(84942,20922,'_leisure_practical_source_url','https://heritageireland.ie/places-to-visit/royal-hospital-kilmainham/'),(84943,20922,'_leisure_practical_last_checked','2026-09-14'),(84944,20923,'_leisure_county','Dublin'),(84945,20923,'_leisure_town','Dublin'),(84946,20923,'_leisure_address','4 Meetinghouse Lane, Smithfield, Dublin 7, D07 VY06'),(84947,20923,'_leisure_website',''),(84948,20923,'_leisure_official_website','https://heritageireland.ie/places-to-visit/st-marys-abbey-chapter-house/'),(84949,20923,'_leisure_discover_ireland',''),(84950,20923,'_leisure_map_url',''),(84951,20923,'_leisure_feature',''),(84952,20923,'_leisure_free','Gratuito'),(84953,20923,'_leisure_family',''),(84954,20923,'_leisure_accessibility',''),(84955,20923,'_leisure_pet_friendly',''),(84956,20923,'_leisure_indoor','1'),(84957,20923,'_leisure_outdoor',''),(84958,20923,'_leisure_parking',''),(84959,20923,'_leisure_booking','1'),(84960,20923,'_leisure_duration',''),(84961,20923,'_leisure_best_time',''),(84962,20923,'_leisure_practical_notes','Entrada gratuita, mas o acesso é apenas por visita guiada e com abertura sazonal (reserva online). Acesso limitado. Confirme disponibilidade e horários no site oficial antes da visita.'),(84963,20923,'_leisure_practical_source_url','https://heritageireland.ie/places-to-visit/st-marys-abbey-chapter-house/'),(84964,20923,'_leisure_practical_last_checked','2026-09-14'),(84965,20924,'_leisure_county','Dublin'),(84966,20924,'_leisure_town','Dublin'),(84967,20924,'_leisure_address','Corn Market (near High Street), Dublin 8, D08 W99H'),(84968,20924,'_leisure_website',''),(84969,20924,'_leisure_official_website','https://heritageireland.ie/places-to-visit/st-audoens-church/'),(84970,20924,'_leisure_discover_ireland',''),(84971,20924,'_leisure_map_url',''),(84972,20924,'_leisure_feature',''),(84973,20924,'_leisure_free','Gratuito'),(84974,20924,'_leisure_family',''),(84975,20924,'_leisure_accessibility',''),(84976,20924,'_leisure_pet_friendly',''),(84977,20924,'_leisure_indoor','1'),(84978,20924,'_leisure_outdoor',''),(84979,20924,'_leisure_parking',''),(84980,20924,'_leisure_booking',''),(84981,20924,'_leisure_duration',''),(84982,20924,'_leisure_best_time',''),(84983,20924,'_leisure_practical_notes','Entrada gratuita. Abertura sazonal: 27 de março a 5 de novembro de 2026, diariamente das 09:30 às 17:30 (última entrada às 16:45). Acesso parcial para visitantes com deficiência; apenas cães de assistência.'),(84984,20924,'_leisure_practical_source_url','https://heritageireland.ie/places-to-visit/st-audoens-church/'),(84985,20924,'_leisure_practical_last_checked','2026-09-14'),(84986,20925,'_leisure_county','Dublin'),(84987,20925,'_leisure_town','Dublin'),(84988,20925,'_leisure_address','St. Stephen\'s Green, Dublin 2, D02 DX88'),(84989,20925,'_leisure_website',''),(84990,20925,'_leisure_official_website','https://heritageireland.ie/places-to-visit/st-stephens-green/'),(84991,20925,'_leisure_discover_ireland',''),(84992,20925,'_leisure_map_url',''),(84993,20925,'_leisure_feature',''),(84994,20925,'_leisure_free','Gratuito'),(84995,20925,'_leisure_family','1'),(84996,20925,'_leisure_accessibility',''),(84997,20925,'_leisure_pet_friendly',''),(84998,20925,'_leisure_indoor',''),(84999,20925,'_leisure_outdoor','1'),(85000,20925,'_leisure_parking',''),(85001,20925,'_leisure_booking',''),(85002,20925,'_leisure_duration',''),(85003,20925,'_leisure_best_time',''),(85004,20925,'_leisure_practical_notes','Entrada gratuita. Aberto todo o ano: segunda a sábado a partir das 07:30 e domingos e feriados a partir das 09:30 (no dia de Natal, das 09:30 às 12:30). Duração média: 1 a 2 horas. Não são permitidos cães no parque infantil nem junto ao lago e às fontes.'),(85005,20925,'_leisure_practical_source_url','https://heritageireland.ie/places-to-visit/st-stephens-green/'),(85006,20925,'_leisure_practical_last_checked','2026-09-14'),(85007,20926,'_leisure_county','Dublin'),(85008,20926,'_leisure_town','Phoenix Park'),(85009,20926,'_leisure_address','Phoenix Park, Dublin 8, D08 E1W3'),(85010,20926,'_leisure_website',''),(85011,20926,'_leisure_official_website','https://heritageireland.ie/places-to-visit/aras-an-uachtarain/'),(85012,20926,'_leisure_discover_ireland',''),(85013,20926,'_leisure_map_url',''),(85014,20926,'_leisure_feature',''),(85015,20926,'_leisure_free','Gratuito'),(85016,20926,'_leisure_family',''),(85017,20926,'_leisure_accessibility',''),(85018,20926,'_leisure_pet_friendly',''),(85019,20926,'_leisure_indoor','1'),(85020,20926,'_leisure_outdoor',''),(85021,20926,'_leisure_parking',''),(85022,20926,'_leisure_booking',''),(85023,20926,'_leisure_duration',''),(85024,20926,'_leisure_best_time',''),(85025,20926,'_leisure_practical_notes','Entrada gratuita, mas as visitas guiadas decorrem apenas aos sábados, às 10:00, 11:15, 12:30, 13:45 e 15:00. Os bilhetes gratuitos são distribuídos no próprio dia, por ordem de chegada, apenas no Phoenix Park Visitor Centre; não há reservas antecipadas nem visitas de grupo. As visitas podem ser canceladas com aviso prévio reduzido por razões de Estado. Não é permitido fotografar.'),(85026,20926,'_leisure_practical_source_url','https://heritageireland.ie/places-to-visit/aras-an-uachtarain/'),(85027,20926,'_leisure_practical_last_checked','2026-09-14'),(85028,20927,'_leisure_county','Kerry'),(85029,20927,'_leisure_town','Ardfert'),(85030,20927,'_leisure_address','Ardfert, Tralee, Co. Kerry, V92 KR7P'),(85031,20927,'_leisure_website',''),(85032,20927,'_leisure_official_website','https://heritageireland.ie/places-to-visit/ardfert-cathedral/'),(85033,20927,'_leisure_discover_ireland',''),(85034,20927,'_leisure_map_url',''),(85035,20927,'_leisure_feature',''),(85036,20927,'_leisure_free','Pago'),(85037,20927,'_leisure_family',''),(85038,20927,'_leisure_accessibility',''),(85039,20927,'_leisure_pet_friendly',''),(85040,20927,'_leisure_indoor','1'),(85041,20927,'_leisure_outdoor','1'),(85042,20927,'_leisure_parking','1'),(85043,20927,'_leisure_booking',''),(85044,20927,'_leisure_duration',''),(85045,20927,'_leisure_best_time',''),(85046,20927,'_leisure_practical_notes','Abertura sazonal: 12 de março a 30 de setembro de 2026, diariamente das 10:00 às 18:00 (última entrada às 17:15); os horários podem variar — confirme junto do local. Entrada paga: adulto 5 EUR, grupo/sénior 4 EUR, criança/estudante 3 EUR, família 13 EUR. Cães devem usar trela e há caminhos irregulares.'),(85047,20927,'_leisure_practical_source_url','https://heritageireland.ie/places-to-visit/ardfert-cathedral/'),(85048,20927,'_leisure_practical_last_checked','2026-09-14'),(85049,20928,'_leisure_county','Kerry'),(85050,20928,'_leisure_town','Listowel'),(85051,20928,'_leisure_address','The Square, Listowel, Co. Kerry, V31 RD93'),(85052,20928,'_leisure_website',''),(85053,20928,'_leisure_official_website','https://heritageireland.ie/places-to-visit/listowel-castle/'),(85054,20928,'_leisure_discover_ireland',''),(85055,20928,'_leisure_map_url',''),(85056,20928,'_leisure_feature',''),(85057,20928,'_leisure_free','Gratuito'),(85058,20928,'_leisure_family',''),(85059,20928,'_leisure_accessibility',''),(85060,20928,'_leisure_pet_friendly',''),(85061,20928,'_leisure_indoor',''),(85062,20928,'_leisure_outdoor','1'),(85063,20928,'_leisure_parking',''),(85064,20928,'_leisure_booking',''),(85065,20928,'_leisure_duration',''),(85066,20928,'_leisure_best_time',''),(85067,20928,'_leisure_practical_notes','Entrada gratuita. Abertura sazonal: 30 de abril a 23 de setembro de 2026, diariamente das 10:00 às 17:00 (última entrada às 16:15). O acesso é apenas por visita guiada e os pisos superiores têm escadas em caracol íngremes, pelo que o acesso para cadeira de rodas é muito limitado. Fora de época, pode abrir para grupos de visita por acordo prévio.'),(85068,20928,'_leisure_practical_source_url','https://heritageireland.ie/places-to-visit/listowel-castle/'),(85069,20928,'_leisure_practical_last_checked','2026-09-14'),(85070,20929,'_leisure_county','Kerry'),(85071,20929,'_leisure_town','Dún Chaoin'),(85072,20929,'_leisure_address','Dún Chaoin, Din