te','https://heritageireland.ie/places-to-visit/kells-priory/'),(85327,20941,'_leisure_discover_ireland',''),(85328,20941,'_leisure_map_url',''),(85329,20941,'_leisure_feature',''),(85330,20941,'_leisure_free','Gratuito'),(85331,20941,'_leisure_family',''),(85332,20941,'_leisure_accessibility',''),(85333,20941,'_leisure_pet_friendly',''),(85334,20941,'_leisure_indoor',''),(85335,20941,'_leisure_outdoor','1'),(85336,20941,'_leisure_parking',''),(85337,20941,'_leisure_booking',''),(85338,20941,'_leisure_duration',''),(85339,20941,'_leisure_best_time',''),(85340,20941,'_leisure_practical_notes','Entrada gratuita. O sítio está acessível todo o ano. Em 2026, o serviço de guias no local funcionou até 30 de agosto (quarta a domingo), passando a visitas autónomas a partir de 31 de agosto. O acesso é atualmente feito pelo parque de estacionamento na estrada L1023. Cães devem usar trela e há caminhos irregulares.'),(85341,20941,'_leisure_practical_source_url','https://heritageireland.ie/places-to-visit/kells-priory/'),(85342,20941,'_leisure_practical_last_checked','2026-09-14'),(85343,20942,'_leisure_county','Kilkenny'),(85344,20942,'_leisure_town','Gowran'),(85345,20942,'_leisure_address','Gowran, Co. Kilkenny, R95 CV0Y'),(85346,20942,'_leisure_website',''),(85347,20942,'_leisure_official_website','https://heritageireland.ie/places-to-visit/st-marys-church-gowran/'),(85348,20942,'_leisure_discover_ireland',''),(85349,20942,'_leisure_map_url',''),(85350,20942,'_leisure_feature',''),(85351,20942,'_leisure_free','Gratuito'),(85352,20942,'_leisure_family',''),(85353,20942,'_leisure_accessibility',''),(85354,20942,'_leisure_pet_friendly',''),(85355,20942,'_leisure_indoor','1'),(85356,20942,'_leisure_outdoor',''),(85357,20942,'_leisure_parking',''),(85358,20942,'_leisure_booking',''),(85359,20942,'_leisure_duration',''),(85360,20942,'_leisure_best_time',''),(85361,20942,'_leisure_practical_notes','Entrada gratuita, com visitas guiadas gratuitas. Atenção: em 2026 o sítio abre apenas em datas específicas, das 12:00 às 16:00 (por exemplo, 26 de junho, 20 e 24 de julho, 7, 15 e 22 de agosto). Acesso restrito para visitantes com deficiência; recomenda-se calçado adequado e não é permitido subir às ruínas.'),(85362,20942,'_leisure_practical_source_url','https://heritageireland.ie/places-to-visit/st-marys-church-gowran/'),(85363,20942,'_leisure_practical_last_checked','2026-09-14'),(85364,20943,'_leisure_county','Tipperary'),(85365,20943,'_leisure_town','Ballingarry'),(85366,20943,'_leisure_address','Ballingarry, Co. Tipperary, E41 XK23'),(85367,20943,'_leisure_website',''),(85368,20943,'_leisure_official_website','https://heritageireland.ie/places-to-visit/famine-warhouse-1848/'),(85369,20943,'_leisure_discover_ireland',''),(85370,20943,'_leisure_map_url',''),(85371,20943,'_leisure_feature',''),(85372,20943,'_leisure_free','Gratuito'),(85373,20943,'_leisure_family',''),(85374,20943,'_leisure_accessibility',''),(85375,20943,'_leisure_pet_friendly',''),(85376,20943,'_leisure_indoor','1'),(85377,20943,'_leisure_outdoor',''),(85378,20943,'_leisure_parking','1'),(85379,20943,'_leisure_booking','1'),(85380,20943,'_leisure_duration',''),(85381,20943,'_leisure_best_time',''),(85382,20943,'_leisure_practical_notes','Entrada gratuita, mas a reserva com antecedência é essencial (mínimo 2 dias). Aberto todo o ano a tempo parcial: de abril a setembro, de quarta a domingo das 14:30 às 17:30; de outubro a março, apenas sábado e domingo das 14:00 às 16:00. Acesso ao piso térreo para visitantes com deficiência. Duração média: 40 minutos.'),(85383,20943,'_leisure_practical_source_url','https://heritageireland.ie/places-to-visit/famine-warhouse-1848/'),(85384,20943,'_leisure_practical_last_checked','2026-09-14'),(85385,20944,'_leisure_county','Tipperary'),(85386,20944,'_leisure_town','Clonmel'),(85387,20944,'_leisure_address','Sarsfield Street, Clonmel, Co. Tipperary, E91 P7Y8'),(85388,20944,'_leisure_website',''),(85389,20944,'_leisure_official_website','https://heritageireland.ie/places-to-visit/the-main-guard/'),(85390,20944,'_leisure_discover_ireland',''),(85391,20944,'_leisure_map_url',''),(85392,20944,'_leisure_feature',''),(85393,20944,'_leisure_free','Gratuito'),(85394,20944,'_leisure_family',''),(85395,20944,'_leisure_accessibility',''),(85396,20944,'_leisure_pet_friendly',''),(85397,20944,'_leisure_indoor','1'),(85398,20944,'_leisure_outdoor',''),(85399,20944,'_leisure_parking',''),(85400,20944,'_leisure_booking',''),(85401,20944,'_leisure_duration',''),(85402,20944,'_leisure_best_time',''),(85403,20944,'_leisure_practical_notes','Entrada gratuita. Abertura sazonal: 12 de março a 23 de setembro de 2026, das 09:00 às 17:00 (última entrada às 16:30). O sítio pode fechar com aviso prévio reduzido — recomenda-se verificar antes da visita. Acesso para cadeira de rodas e casa de banho acessível.'),(85404,20944,'_leisure_practical_source_url','https://heritageireland.ie/places-to-visit/the-main-guard/'),(85405,20944,'_leisure_practical_last_checked','2026-09-14'),(85406,20945,'_leisure_county','Tipperary'),(85407,20945,'_leisure_town','Roscrea'),(85408,20945,'_leisure_address','Castle Street, Roscrea, Co. Tipperary, E53 F652'),(85409,20945,'_leisure_website',''),(85410,20945,'_leisure_official_website','https://heritageireland.ie/places-to-visit/roscrea-heritage-centre-roscrea-castle-and-damer-house/'),(85411,20945,'_leisure_discover_ireland',''),(85412,20945,'_leisure_map_url',''),(85413,20945,'_leisure_feature',''),(85414,20945,'_leisure_free','Pago'),(85415,20945,'_leisure_family','1'),(85416,20945,'_leisure_accessibility',''),(85417,20945,'_leisure_pet_friendly',''),(85418,20945,'_leisure_indoor','1'),(85419,20945,'_leisure_outdoor','1'),(85420,20945,'_leisure_parking','1'),(85421,20945,'_leisure_booking',''),(85422,20945,'_leisure_duration',''),(85423,20945,'_leisure_best_time',''),(85424,20945,'_leisure_practical_notes','Entrada: 3 EUR (visitas ao castelo e ao Blackmills, de quarta a domingo). Abertura sazonal: 19 de março a novembro de 2026. Atenção: a Damer House está fechada durante todo o ano de 2026 por obras. Confirme os horários e o estado de abertura no site oficial antes da visita.'),(85425,20945,'_leisure_practical_source_url','https://heritageireland.ie/places-to-visit/roscrea-heritage-centre-roscrea-castle-and-damer-house/'),(85426,20945,'_leisure_practical_last_checked','2026-09-14'),(85427,20946,'_leisure_county','Westmeath'),(85428,20946,'_leisure_town','Fore'),(85429,20946,'_leisure_address','Fore, Co. Westmeath, N91 TN92'),(85430,20946,'_leisure_website',''),(85431,20946,'_leisure_official_website','https://heritageireland.ie/places-to-visit/fore-abbey/'),(85432,20946,'_leisure_discover_ireland',''),(85433,20946,'_leisure_map_url',''),(85434,20946,'_leisure_feature',''),(85435,20946,'_leisure_free',''),(85436,20946,'_leisure_family',''),(85437,20946,'_leisure_accessibility',''),(85438,20946,'_leisure_pet_friendly',''),(85439,20946,'_leisure_indoor',''),(85440,20946,'_leisure_outdoor','1'),(85441,20946,'_leisure_parking','1'),(85442,20946,'_leisure_booking',''),(85443,20946,'_leisure_duration',''),(85444,20946,'_leisure_best_time',''),(85445,20946,'_leisure_practical_notes','Aberto todo o ano. Os visitantes devem usar roupa e calçado adequados ao clima e ao terreno irregular. Acesso restrito para visitantes com deficiência. Não há informação de admissão publicada na página oficial — confirme no site da Heritage Ireland antes de visitar.'),(85446,20946,'_leisure_practical_source_url','https://heritageireland.ie/places-to-visit/fore-abbey/'),(85447,20946,'_leisure_practical_last_checked','2026-09-14'),(85448,20947,'_leisure_county','Wicklow'),(85449,20947,'_leisure_town','Kilbride'),(85450,20947,'_leisure_address','Kilbride, Co. Wicklow, A67 YR12'),(85451,20947,'_leisure_website',''),(85452,20947,'_leisure_official_website','https://heritageireland.ie/places-to-visit/national-botanic-gardens-kilmacurragh/'),(85453,20947,'_leisure_discover_ireland',''),(85454,20947,'_leisure_map_url',''),(85455,20947,'_leisure_feature',''),(85456,20947,'_leisure_free','Gratuito'),(85457,20947,'_leisure_family','1'),(85458,20947,'_leisure_accessibility',''),(85459,20947,'_leisure_pet_friendly',''),(85460,20947,'_leisure_indoor',''),(85461,20947,'_leisure_outdoor','1'),(85462,20947,'_leisure_parking',''),(85463,20947,'_leisure_booking',''),(85464,20947,'_leisure_duration',''),(85465,20947,'_leisure_best_time',''),(85466,20947,'_leisure_practical_notes','Entrada gratuita. Aberto todo o ano, diariamente das 09:00 às 16:30 (última entrada às 16:00); fechado a 25 de dezembro. Visitas guiadas gratuitas diárias às 12:00 e às 15:00, de meados de março a meados de outubro; visitas escolares gratuitas por marcação. Não há estacionamento fora dos jardins e o acesso pode ser limitado quando o local atinge a lotação máxima, sobretudo aos fins de semana. Cães bem-vindos, com trela.'),(85467,20947,'_leisure_practical_source_url','https://heritageireland.ie/places-to-visit/national-botanic-gardens-kilmacurragh/'),(85468,20947,'_leisure_practical_last_checked','2026-09-14'),(85469,20948,'_leisure_county','Wicklow'),(85470,20948,'_leisure_town','Donard'),(85471,20948,'_leisure_address','Derrynamuck, Knockanarrigan, Co. Wicklow, W91 D273'),(85472,20948,'_leisure_website',''),(85473,20948,'_leisure_official_website','https://heritageireland.ie/places-to-visit/dwyer-mcallister-cottage/'),(85474,20948,'_leisure_discover_ireland',''),(85475,20948,'_leisure_map_url',''),(85476,20948,'_leisure_feature',''),(85477,20948,'_leisure_free','Gratuito'),(85478,20948,'_leisure_family',''),(85479,20948,'_leisure_accessibility',''),(85480,20948,'_leisure_pet_friendly',''),(85481,20948,'_leisure_indoor','1'),(85482,20948,'_leisure_outdoor',''),(85483,20948,'_leisure_parking','1'),(85484,20948,'_leisure_booking','1'),(85485,20948,'_leisure_duration',''),(85486,20948,'_leisure_best_time',''),(85487,20948,'_leisure_practical_notes','Entrada gratuita. Abertura sazonal: de junho a setembro, diariamente das 14:00 às 18:00 (última entrada 45 minutos antes do fecho). É necessário contactar (056) 772 1668 com antecedência para combinar o acesso. Acesso restrito para visitantes com deficiência; caminhos irregulares.'),(85488,20948,'_leisure_practical_source_url','https://heritageireland.ie/places-to-visit/dwyer-mcallister-cottage/'),(85489,20948,'_leisure_practical_last_checked','2026-09-14'),(85490,20905,'_leisure_export_uuid','6578eef6-e9b5-4305-9771-e0353c8bf17d'),(85491,20906,'_leisure_export_uuid','25ade0ed-b26e-41ae-896a-d4bf3d572f04'),(85492,20907,'_leisure_export_uuid','e3cc2e57-b223-4cb3-8e6b-8931dd7f7894'),(85493,20908,'_leisure_export_uuid','070a5962-c0f9-4c18-bb3e-42ef97a2da63'),(85494,20909,'_leisure_export_uuid','b4c67db8-7ad1-4fc6-a7da-d9d41f4dc7d5'),(85495,20910,'_leisure_export_uuid','4281cd7b-5810-487d-8e2d-cd71a0d4af1a'),(85496,20911,'_leisure_export_uuid','400c911f-1adf-47c3-b790-66f66db2bced'),(85497,20912,'_leisure_export_uuid','165b5fb9-77fa-4aa7-81b8-beada1e535ba'),(85498,20913,'_leisure_export_uuid','d0ac9919-8670-4183-936f-1a858c98faac'),(85499,20914,'_leisure_export_uuid','65f7e258-db2b-4563-8ac5-2824970e79a4'),(85500,20915,'_leisure_export_uuid','81afcda5-1068-4a9c-81ec-30bc68016abf'),(85501,20916,'_leisure_export_uuid','ce97b54a-7b59-491e-bebe-8ccf05b6aa99'),(85502,20917,'_leisure_export_uuid','96930e89-fddc-436d-aedc-54652551b8c6'),(85503,20918,'_leisure_export_uuid','b3f990d2-5632-401f-bd45-c4c127613774'),(85504,20919,'_leisure_export_uuid','3d3c9cdf-d957-4b03-a971-e7b7d7f08d40'),(85505,20920,'_leisure_export_uuid','5c3faa0c-ecc1-4fe4-8bc4-744a2e6babe5'),(85506,20921,'_leisure_export_uuid','1192daa6-7f67-4054-bd69-13443faeee6c'),(85507,20922,'_leisure_export_uuid','2895d9b9-55be-4947-add6-5d481dfe3a5c'),(85508,20923,'_leisure_export_uuid','38cdd1b5-233a-4eaa-9130-a40aa32438db'),(85509,20924,'_leisure_export_uuid','f7f5d649-b207-473b-aea9-9286431ec169'),(85510,20925,'_leisure_export_uuid','8489d271-6f18-4a04-823f-05eff3d