ove performing, creating, making friends, trying new things, or simply want to have some fun and build your confidence? Laois Youth Theatre is the place for you. Explore creativity and new ideas, meet new people and make friends. Grow in confidence and develop performance and theatre-making skills.','Laois Youth Theatre Expression of Interest','Calling all young people aged 12–18.Do you love performing, creating, making friends, trying new things, or simply want to have some fun and build your confidence? Laois Youth Theatre is...','publish','closed','closed','','laois-youth-theatre-expression-of-interest','','','2026-08-26 08:17:17','2026-08-26 07:17:17','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/eventos/laois-youth-theatre-expression-of-interest/',0,'event','',0),(10533,283039558,'2026-08-24 10:17:32','2026-08-24 09:17:32','','Laois Youth Theatre Expression of Interest','','inherit','open','closed','','laois-youth-theatre-expression-of-interest-2','','','2026-08-24 10:17:32','2026-08-24 09:17:32','',10532,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/eventos/laois-youth-theatre-expression-of-interest/laois-youth-theatre-expression-of-interest-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10534,283039558,'2026-08-24 09:05:16','2026-08-24 08:05:16','Rugby player Jace (Adam Lunnon-Collery) meets aspiring filmmaker Charlie (Liath Hannon) at a college party. Both attend Trinity College, but their worlds couldn’t be more different; Charlie is trans, her circle full of queer artists and creatives, while Jace is more comfortable with the locker-room banter of his rugby teammates. When the party is suddenly shut down by the Guards, the two find themselves alone in the streets of night-time Dublin.','Laois Pride Presents Girls & Boys','Rugby player Jace (Adam Lunnon-Collery) meets aspiring filmmaker Charlie (Liath Hannon) at a college party. Both attend Trinity College, but their worlds couldn’t be more different; Charlie is trans, her...','publish','closed','closed','','laois-pride-presents-girls-boys','','','2026-08-26 08:17:17','2026-08-26 07:17:17','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/eventos/laois-pride-presents-girls-boys/',0,'event','',0),(10535,283039558,'2026-08-24 09:15:49','2026-08-24 08:15:49','Join us for the K26 5K &amp; Family Fun Day! ‍20th Sept, 12 noon, Killenard. Run, games, prizes &amp; pickleball!','K26 5K Run &amp; Family Fun Day','Join us for the K26 5K &amp; Family Fun Day! ‍20th Sept, 12 noon, Killenard. Run, games, prizes &amp; pickleball!','publish','closed','closed','','k26-5k-run-family-fun-day','','','2026-09-12 15:17:25','2026-09-12 14:17:25','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/eventos/k26-5k-run-family-fun-day/',0,'event','',0),(10536,283039558,'2026-08-24 10:17:33','2026-08-24 09:17:33','','K26 5K Run & Family Fun Day','','inherit','open','closed','','k26-5k-run-family-fun-day-2','','','2026-08-24 10:17:33','2026-08-24 09:17:33','',10535,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/eventos/k26-5k-run-family-fun-day/k26-5k-run-family-fun-day-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10539,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:43','2026-08-21 20:48:43','<p>O Museu Nacional de Arqueologia, na Kildare Street, guarda a maior coleção de artefatos irlandeses do país: ourivesaria céltica, tesouros vikings e os famosos \"corpos de pântano\". Entrada gratuita nas exposições permanentes.</p>','National Museum of Ireland – Archaeology','Museu nacional com tesouros da Irlanda antiga: artefatos vikings, ouro da Idade do Bronze e corpos de pântano.','publish','closed','closed','','national-museum-archaeology','','','2026-09-15 19:41:32','2026-09-15 18:41:32','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/national-museum-archaeology/',0,'leisure','',0),(10540,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:44','2026-08-24 10:16:44','','National Museum of Ireland – Archaeology','','inherit','open','closed','','national-museum-of-ireland-archaeology','','','2026-08-24 11:16:44','2026-08-24 10:16:44','',10539,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/national-museum-archaeology/national-museum-of-ireland-archaeology/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10541,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:43','2026-08-21 20:48:43','<p>O EPIC, no Custom House Quay, é um museu totalmente digital e interativo sobre a diáspora irlandesa — tema especialmente próximo da comunidade brasileira que também escolheu a Irlanda como lar.</p>','EPIC The Irish Emigration Museum','Museu interativo premiado que conta a história dos 10 milhões de irlandeses que emigraram pelo mundo.','publish','closed','closed','','epic-irish-emigration-museum','','','2026-09-15 19:41:33','2026-09-15 18:41:33','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/epic-irish-emigration-museum/',0,'leisure','',0),(10542,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:44','2026-08-24 10:16:44','','EPIC The Irish Emigration Museum','','inherit','open','closed','','epic-the-irish-emigration-museum','','','2026-08-24 11:16:44','2026-08-24 10:16:44','',10541,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/epic-irish-emigration-museum/epic-the-irish-emigration-museum/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10543,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:43','2026-08-21 20:48:43','<p>Os National Botanic Gardens, em Glasnevin, combinam jardins históricos, estufas de ferro fundido do século XIX e coleções botânicas de referência mundial. Um passeio tranquilo e gratuito a poucos minutos do centro.</p>','National Botanic Gardens','Jardins botânicos nacionais com estufas vitorianas, mais de 15 mil espécies de plantas e entrada gratuita.','publish','closed','closed','','national-botanic-gardens-dublin','','','2026-09-15 19:41:33','2026-09-15 18:41:33','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/national-botanic-gardens-dublin/',0,'leisure','',0),(10544,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:44','2026-08-24 10:16:44','','National Botanic Gardens','','inherit','open','closed','','national-botanic-gardens','','','2026-08-24 11:16:44','2026-08-24 10:16:44','',10543,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/national-botanic-gardens-dublin/national-botanic-gardens/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10545,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:43','2026-08-21 20:48:43','<p>O Glasnevin Cemetery, aberto em 1832, é o cemitério nacional da Irlanda. Entre seus túmulos estão Daniel O\'Connell, Michael Collins e outros líderes da história irlandesa. O museu conta essas histórias em exposições modernas.</p>','Glasnevin Cemetery Museum','Cemitério histórico onde repousam os grandes nomes da independência irlandesa, com museu e visitas guiadas.','publish','closed','closed','','glasnevin-cemetery-museum','','','2026-09-15 19:41:33','2026-09-15 18:41:33','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/glasnevin-cemetery-museum/',0,'leisure','',0),(10546,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:45','2026-08-24 10:16:45','','Glasnevin Cemetery Museum','','inherit','open','closed','','glasnevin-cemetery-museum-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:45','2026-08-24 10:16:45','',10545,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/glasnevin-cemetery-museum/glasnevin-cemetery-museum-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10547,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:44','2026-08-21 20:48:44','<p>O East Pier de Dún Laoghaire é um clássico passeio dublinês: mais de um quilômetro de caminhada plana sobre o mar, com o farol no fim, sorveterias e o People\'s Park por perto.</p>','Dún Laoghaire East Pier','Calçadão marítimo de 1,3 km com vistas da baía de Dublin, ideal para caminhadas à beira-mar.','publish','closed','closed','','dun-laoghaire-east-pier','','','2026-09-15 19:41:33','2026-09-15 18:41:33','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/dun-laoghaire-east-pier/',0,'leisure','',0),(10548,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:45','2026-08-24 10:16:45','','Dún Laoghaire East Pier','','inherit','open','closed','','dun-laoghaire-east-pier-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:45','2026-08-24 10:16:45','',10547,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/dun-laoghaire-east-pier/dun-laoghaire-east-pier-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10549,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:44','2026-08-21 20:48:44','<p>A Velvet Strand de Portmarnock se estende por vários quilômetros voltada para a ilha de Lambay. É uma das praias favoritas dos dublineses para caminhadas ao pôr do sol e banhos de mar no verão.</p>','Portmarnock Beach (Velvet Strand)','Longa praia de areia ao norte de Dublin, popular para caminhadas, banhos e esportes aquáticos.','publish','closed','closed','','portmarnock-beach','','','2026-09-15 19:41:33','2026-09-15 18:41:33','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/portmarnock-beach/',0,'leisure','',0),(10550,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:45','2026-08-24 10:16:45','','Portmarnock Beach (Velvet Strand)','','inherit','open','closed','','portmarnock-beach-velvet-strand','','','2026-08-24 11:16:45','2026-08-24 10:16:45','',10549,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/portmarnock-beach/portmarnock-beach-velvet-strand/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10551,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:44','2026-08-21 20:48:44','<p>Russborough House, projetada por Richard Cassels em 1741, é considerada uma das mansões mais bonitas da Irlanda. Os jardins incluem um labirinto, trilhas e um centro de falcoaria.</p>','Russborough House','Mansão palladiana do século XVIII com interior ornamentado, labirinto e vista para as montanhas de Wicklow.','publish','closed','closed','','russborough-house','','','2026-09-15 19:41:33','2026-09-15 18:41:33','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/russborough-house/',0,'leisure','',0),(10552,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:45','2026-08-24 10:16:45','','Russborough House','','inherit','open','closed','','russborough-house-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:45','2026-08-24 10:16:45','',10551,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/russborough-house/russborough-house-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10553,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:44','2026-08-21 20:48:44','<p>A antiga prisão de Wicklow oferece tours imersivos com atores contando histórias de presos e rebeliões desde 1702. Uma das atrações históricas mais bem avaliadas da Irlanda.</p>','Wicklow\'s Historic Gaol','Prisão histórica do século XVIII transformada em museu interativo sobre dois séculos de história sombria.','publish','closed','closed','','wicklow-historic-gaol','','','2026-09-15 19:41:33','2026-09-15 18:41:33','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/wicklow-historic-gaol/',0,'leisure','',0),(10554,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:45','2026-08-24 10:16:45','','Wicklow&#8217;s Historic Gaol','','inherit','open','closed','','wicklows-historic-gaol','','','2026-08-24 11:16:45','2026-08-24 10:16:45','',10553,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/wicklow-historic-gaol/wicklows-historic-gaol/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10555,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:45','2026-08-21 20:48:45','<p>Brittas Bay é a praia preferida dos dublineses em dias quentes: extensa, limpa e cercada por dunas. Fica a cerca de uma hora do centro de Dublin pela N11.</p>','Brittas Bay Beach','Uma das melhores praias da costa leste, com 4 km de areia dourada e dunas protegidas.','publish','closed','closed','','brittas-bay-beach','','','2026-09-15 19:41:33','2026-09-15 18:41:33','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/brittas-bay-beach/',0,'leisure','',0),(10556,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:45','2026-08-24 10:16:45','','Brittas Bay Beach','','inherit','open','closed','','brittas-bay-beach-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:45','2026-08-24 10:16:45','',10555,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/brittas-bay-beach/brittas-bay-beach-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10557,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:45','2026-08-21 20:48:45','<p>Killruddery é uma propriedade familiar há quase 400 anos. Os jardins incluem parterres formais, um jardim de rosas e trilhas na floresta, além de eventos culturais durante o ano.</p>','Killruddery House & Gardens','Mansão do século XVII ainda habitada, com jardins formais, orangerie e mercado de produtores aos sábados.','publish','closed','closed','','killruddery-house-gardens','','','2026-09-15 19:41:33','2026-09-15 18:41:33','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/killruddery-house-gardens/',0,'leisure','',0),(10558,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:46','2026-08-24 10:16:46','','Killruddery House &#038; Gardens','','inherit','open','closed','','killruddery-house-gardens-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:46','2026-08-24 10:16:46','',10557,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/killruddery-house-gardens/killruddery-house-gardens-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10559,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:45','2026-08-21 20:48:45','<p>Criados no estilo de William Robinson, os Mount Usher Gardens combinam árvores gigantes, pontes sobre o rio Vartry e milhares de espécies vegetais num cenário de grande beleza.</p>','Mount Usher Gardens','Jardins românticos às margens do rio Vartry, com plantas de todo o mundo e estilo de jardim selvagem.','publish','closed','closed','','mount-usher-gardens','','','2026-09-15 19:41:33','2026-09-15 18:41:33','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/mount-usher-gardens/',0,'leisure','',0),(10560,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:46','2026-08-24 10:16:46','','Mount Usher Gardens','','inherit','open','closed','','mount-usher-gardens-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:46','2026-08-24 10:16:46','',10559,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/mount-usher-gardens/mount-usher-gardens-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10561,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:46','2026-08-21 20:48:46','<p>O Wicklow Way atravessa turfeiras, lagos glaciares e vales das montanhas de Wicklow. Pode ser feito em trechos de um dia — muitos brasileiros fazem o trecho de Marlay Park a Roundwood ou Glendalough num fim de semana.</p>','The Wicklow Way','A trilha de longa distância mais antiga da Irlanda: 131 km pelas montanhas de Wicklow, de Dublin a Clonegal.','publish','closed','closed','','wicklow-way','','','2026-09-15 19:41:33','2026-09-15 18:41:33','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/wicklow-way/',0,'leisure','',0),(10562,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:46','2026-08-24 10:16:46','','The Wicklow Way','','inherit','open','closed','','the-wicklow-way','','','2026-08-24 11:16:46','2026-08-24 10:16:46','',10561,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/wicklow-way/the-wicklow-way/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10563,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:46','2026-08-21 20:48:46','<p>O Emerald Park, antes conhecido como Tayto Park, é o único parque temático da Irlanda, combinando montanhas-russas como o Cu Chulainn com um zoológico de animais exóticos. Fica a cerca de 30 minutos de Dublin.</p>','Emerald Park','Parque temático e zoológico (antigo Tayto Park) com montanhas-russas, zoo e atrações para toda a família.','publish','closed','closed','','emerald-park','','','2026-09-15 19:41:33','2026-09-15 18:41:33','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/emerald-park/',0,'leisure','',0),(10564,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:46','2026-08-24 10:16:46','','Emerald Park','','inherit','open','closed','','emerald-park-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:46','2026-08-24 10:16:46','',10563,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/emerald-park/emerald-park-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10565,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:46','2026-08-21 20:48:46','<p>Fundada em 1147, a Bective Abbey é um conjunto monástico bem preservado e de acesso livre, a poucos minutos de Trim. Serviu de locação para o filme \"Coração Valente\".</p>','Bective Abbey','Ruínas de abadia cisterciense do século XII às margens do rio Boyne, cenário do filme Braveheart.','publish','closed','closed','','bective-abbey','','','2026-09-15 19:41:34','2026-09-15 18:41:34','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/bective-abbey/',0,'leisure','',0),(10566,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:46','2026-08-24 10:16:46','','Bective Abbey','','inherit','open','closed','','bective-abbey-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:46','2026-08-24 10:16:46','',10565,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/bective-abbey/bective-abbey-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10567,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:46','2026-08-21 20:48:46','<p>Kells foi o lar do famoso Livro de Kells por séculos. A vila conserva cinco alta cruzes medievais, a torre redonda e a igreja de São Columba — um passeio histórico compacto e gratuito.</p>','Kells Historic Town','Vila monástica histórica, antiga casa do Livro de Kells, com alta cruzes e torre redonda.','publish','closed','closed','','kells-historic-town','','','2026-09-15 19:41:34','2026-09-15 18:41:34','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/kells-historic-town/',0,'leisure','',0),(10568,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:47','2026-08-24 10:16:47','','Kells Historic Town','','inherit','open','closed','','kells-historic-town-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:47','2026-08-24 10:16:47','',10567,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/kells-historic-town/kells-historic-town-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10569,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:47','2026-08-21 20:48:47','<p>Sonairte, em Laytown, é um centro sem fins lucrativos dedicado à sustentabilidade, com jardins orgânicos, trilha pelo rio Nanny e eventos educativos para famílias.</p>','Sonairte Ecology Centre','Centro de ecologia e horta orgânica numa fazenda histórica perto do mar, com trilhas e loja vegetariana.','publish','closed','closed','','sonairte-ecology-centre','','','2026-09-15 19:41:34','2026-09-15 18:41:34','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/sonairte-ecology-centre/',0,'leisure','',0),(10570,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:47','2026-08-24 10:16:47','','Sonairte Ecology Centre','','inherit','open','closed','','sonairte-ecology-centre-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:47','2026-08-24 10:16:47','',10569,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/sonairte-ecology-centre/sonairte-ecology-centre-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10571,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:47','2026-08-21 20:48:47','<p>Dowth completa o trio de túmulos neolíticos do Brú na Bóinne junto com Newgrange e Knowth. Após anos fechado, hoje recebe visitas guiadas organizadas a partir do centro de visitantes.</p>','Dowth Passage Tomb','Terceiro grande túmulo de passagem do Brú na Bóinne, com 5.000 anos, aberto a visitas guiadas.','publish','closed','closed','','dowth','','','2026-09-15 19:41:34','2026-09-15 18:41:34','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/dowth/',0,'leisure','',0),(10572,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:47','2026-08-24 10:16:47','','Dowth Passage Tomb','','inherit','open','closed','','dowth-passage-tomb','','','2026-08-24 11:16:47','2026-08-24 10:16:47','',10571,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/dowth/dowth-passage-tomb/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10573,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:47','2026-08-21 20:48:47','<p>O Spanish Arch era parte da muralha medieval de Galway e guardava o acesso ao cais. Hoje é ponto de encontro popular, ao lado do museu da cidade e das famosas casas coloridas do Long Walk.</p>','Spanish Arch & Long Walk','Arco do século XVI à beira do rio Corrib e as coloridas casas do Long Walk, cartão-postal de Galway.','publish','closed','closed','','spanish-arch-long-walk','','','2026-09-15 19:41:34','2026-09-15 18:41:34','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/spanish-arch-long-walk/',0,'leisure','',0),(10574,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:47','2026-08-24 10:16:47','','Spanish Arch &#038; Long Walk','','inherit','open','closed','','spanish-arch-long-walk-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:47','2026-08-24 10:16:47','',10573,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/spanish-arch-long-walk/spanish-arch-long-walk-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10575,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:48','2026-08-21 20:48:48','<p>À beira do rio Corrib, junto ao Spanish Arch, o museu apresenta exposições sobre a cidade medieval, a pesca tradicional e o clássico barco Galway Hooker. Entrada gratuita.</p>','Galway City Museum','Museu moderno sobre a história de Galway, do período medieval à cultura das Ilhas Aran.','publish','closed','closed','','galway-city-museum','','','2026-09-15 19:41:34','2026-09-15 18:41:34','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/galway-city-museum/',0,'leisure','',0),(10576,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:47','2026-08-24 10:16:47','','Galway City Museum','','inherit','open','closed','','galway-city-museum-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:47','2026-08-24 10:16:47','',10575,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/galway-city-museum/galway-city-museum-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10577,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:48','2026-08-21 20:48:48','<p>Brigit\'s Garden leva visitantes por quatro jardins que representam as festas sazonais celtas, com esculturas, prado de flores silvestres e áreas de descoberta para crianças.</p>','Brigit\'s Garden','Jardins inspirados nas festas celtas, com jardim solar, floresta antiga e playground natural.','publish','closed','closed','','brigits-garden','','','2026-09-15 19:41:34','2026-09-15 18:41:34','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/brigits-garden/',0,'leisure','',0),(10578,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:48','2026-08-24 10:16:48','','Brigit&#8217;s Garden','','inherit','open','closed','','brigits-garden-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:48','2026-08-24 10:16:48','',10577,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/brigits-garden/brigits-garden-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10579,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:48','2026-08-21 20:48:48','<p>Coole Park foi o refúgio de escritores como W.B. Yeats. Hoje é uma reserva natural com trilhas entre lagos e florestas de calcário, e a famosa árvore autografada pelos literatos do início do século XX.</p>','Coole Park','Reserva natural e antiga propriedade de Lady Gregory, coração do Renascimento Literário irlandês.','publish','closed','closed','','coole-park','','','2026-09-15 19:41:34','2026-09-15 18:41:34','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/coole-park/',0,'leisure','',0),(10580,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:48','2026-08-24 10:16:48','','Coole Park','','inherit','open','closed','','coole-park-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:48','2026-08-24 10:16:48','',10579,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/coole-park/coole-park-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10581,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:48','2026-08-21 20:48:48','<p>Portumna Castle é um raro exemplo de casa senhorial semi-fortificada do início do século XVII. Os jardins geométricos foram reconstruídos segundo registros originais, e a propriedade integra o Portumna Forest Park.</p>','Portumna Castle & Gardens','Mansão fortificada do século XVII às margens do Lough Derg, com jardins restaurados e parque florestal.','publish','closed','closed','','portumna-castle-gardens','','','2026-09-15 19:41:34','2026-09-15 18:41:34','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/portumna-castle-gardens/',0,'leisure','',0),(10582,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:48','2026-08-24 10:16:48','','Portumna Castle &#038; Gardens','','inherit','open','closed','','portumna-castle-gardens-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:48','2026-08-24 10:16:48','',10581,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/portumna-castle-gardens/portumna-castle-gardens-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10583,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:49','2026-08-21 20:48:49','<p>Thoor Ballylee (Yeats\' Tower) foi a casa de verão de W.B. Yeats nos anos 1920 e inspirou boa parte de sua poesia. A torre e o cottage anexo ficam abertos ao público na temporada.</p>','Thoor Ballylee','Torre normanda do século XIV onde viveu o poeta W.B. Yeats, chamada por ele de \"o lugar mais bonito do mundo\".','publish','closed','closed','','thoor-ballylee','','','2026-09-15 19:41:34','2026-09-15 18:41:34','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/thoor-ballylee/',0,'leisure','',0),(10584,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:48','2026-08-24 10:16:48','','Thoor Ballylee','','inherit','open','closed','','thoor-ballylee-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:48','2026-08-24 10:16:48','',10583,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/thoor-ballylee/thoor-ballylee-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10585,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:49','2026-08-21 20:48:49','<p>Fundado pelos O\'Brien no século XIII, o Ennis Friary conserva talha em pedra de grande qualidade, incluindo cenas da Paixão. Visitas guiadas explicam sua importância religiosa regional.</p>','Ennis Friary','Convento franciscano do século XIII com esculturas medievais notáveis, no centro de Ennis.','publish','closed','closed','','ennis-friary','','','2026-09-15 19:41:34','2026-09-15 18:41:34','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/ennis-friary/',0,'leisure','',0),(10586,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:48','2026-08-24 10:16:48','','Ennis Friary','','inherit','open','closed','','ennis-friary-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:48','2026-08-24 10:16:48','',10585,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/ennis-friary/ennis-friary-2/',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(10587,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:49','2026-08-21 20:48:49','<p>A poucos minutos de barco de Kilrush, Scattery Island abriga um assentamento monástico fundado por São Senan, com seis igrejas, uma torre redonda intacta e um forte napoleônico.</p>','Scattery Island','Ilha monástica no estuário do Shannon, com torre redonda, ruínas de igrejas e colônia de focas.','publish','closed','closed','','scattery-island','','','2026-09-15 19:41:35','2026-09-15 18:41:35','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/scattery-island/',0,'leisure','',0),(10588,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:48','2026-08-24 10:16:48','','Scattery Island','','inherit','open','closed','','scattery-island-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:48','2026-08-24 10:16:48','',10587,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/scattery-island/scattery-island-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10589,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:50','2026-08-21 20:48:50','<p>Inis Cealtra foi um importante centro monástico desde o tempo de São Caimín. Barcos partem do cais de Mountshannon na temporada, e a travessia curta recompensa com um dos sítios sagrados mais atmosféricos da Irlanda.</p>','Holy Island (Inis Cealtra)','Ilha sagrada no Lough Derg com mosteiro do século VII, células de pedra e cruzes antigas.','publish','closed','closed','','holy-island-inis-cealtra','','','2026-09-15 19:41:35','2026-09-15 18:41:35','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/holy-island-inis-cealtra/',0,'leisure','',0),(10590,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:49','2026-08-24 10:16:49','','Holy Island (Inis Cealtra)','','inherit','open','closed','','holy-island-inis-cealtra-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:49','2026-08-24 10:16:49','',10589,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/holy-island-inis-cealtra/holy-island-inis-cealtra-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10591,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:50','2026-08-21 20:48:50','<p>Spanish Point recebeu esse nome após náufragos da Armada Espanhola chegarem à costa em 1588. Hoje é uma praia familiar tranquila com boas ondas suaves para iniciantes no surf.</p>','Spanish Point Beach','Baía de areia com águas calmas e história ligada à Armada Espanhola, popular para famílias e surf.','publish','closed','closed','','spanish-point-beach','','','2026-09-15 19:41:35','2026-09-15 18:41:35','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/spanish-point-beach/',0,'leisure','',0),(10592,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:49','2026-08-24 10:16:49','','Spanish Point Beach','','inherit','open','closed','','spanish-point-beach-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:49','2026-08-24 10:16:49','',10591,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/spanish-point-beach/spanish-point-beach-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10593,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:50','2026-08-21 20:48:50','<p>Craggaunowen mostra como viviam os irlandeses há milhares de anos: um crannóg (moradia lacustre), forno de fulacht fiadh e o castelo-torre de 1550. Também exibe o barco Brendan, que cruzou o Atlântico em 1976.</p>','Craggaunowen','Parque de história viva que recria a Irlanda pré-histórica e medieval, com crannóg e casa fortificada.','publish','closed','closed','','craggaunowen','','','2026-09-15 19:41:35','2026-09-15 18:41:35','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/craggaunowen/',0,'leisure','',0),(10594,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:49','2026-08-24 10:16:49','','Craggaunowen','','inherit','open','closed','','craggaunowen-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:49','2026-08-24 10:16:49','',10593,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/craggaunowen/craggaunowen-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10595,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:50','2026-08-21 20:48:50','<p>O jardim murado da família Vandeleur foi restaurado pela comunidade e hoje combina plantas exóticas, horta e uma estufa vitoriana reconstruída. Um refúgio tranquilo perto do mar.</p>','Vandeleur Walled Garden','Jardim murado do século XIX restaurado, com estufa vitoriana e café, no oeste de Clare.','publish','closed','closed','','vandeleur-walled-garden','','','2026-09-15 19:41:35','2026-09-15 18:41:35','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/vandeleur-walled-garden/',0,'leisure','',0),(10596,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:49','2026-08-24 10:16:49','','Vandeleur Walled Garden','','inherit','open','closed','','vandeleur-walled-garden-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:49','2026-08-24 10:16:49','',10595,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/vandeleur-walled-garden/vandeleur-walled-garden-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10597,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:50','2026-08-21 20:48:50','<p>O English Market funciona desde 1788 e é o coração gastronômico de Cork. Rainha Elizabeth II o visitou em 2011. Vale a visita tanto para comprar quanto para almoçar no balcão do Farmgate Café.</p>','English Market','Mercado coberto histórico do século XVIII, templo da gastronomia de Cork com bancas de peixe, queijos e quitandas.','publish','closed','closed','','english-market-cork','','','2026-09-15 19:41:35','2026-09-15 18:41:35','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/english-market-cork/',0,'leisure','',0),(10598,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:49','2026-08-24 10:16:49','','English Market','','inherit','open','closed','','english-market','','','2026-08-24 11:16:49','2026-08-24 10:16:49','',10597,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/english-market-cork/english-market/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10599,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:51','2026-08-21 20:48:51','<p>O Cork City Gaol funcionou de 1824 a 1923. Hoje, suas celas originais recebem visitantes com um audioguia envolvente que retrata a vida de presos e guardas na Cork do século XIX.</p>','Cork City Gaol','Antiga prisão vitoriana com figuras de cera e audioguia sobre dois séculos de vida carcerária.','publish','closed','closed','','cork-city-gaol','','','2026-09-15 19:41:35','2026-09-15 18:41:35','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/cork-city-gaol/',0,'leisure','',0),(10600,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:49','2026-08-24 10:16:49','','Cork City Gaol','','inherit','open','closed','','cork-city-gaol-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:49','2026-08-24 10:16:49','',10599,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/cork-city-gaol/cork-city-gaol-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10601,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:51','2026-08-21 20:48:51','<p>No Blackrock Castle, o observatório combina história e astronomia com exposições interativas, planetário e eventos de observação de estrelas. Ótimo programa para crianças curiosas.</p>','Blackrock Castle Observatory','Castelo do século XVI transformado em observatório de ciências astronômicas às margens do rio Lee.','publish','closed','closed','','blackrock-castle-observatory','','','2026-09-15 19:41:35','2026-09-15 18:41:35','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/blackrock-castle-observatory/',0,'leisure','',0),(10602,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:50','2026-08-24 10:16:50','','Blackrock Castle Observatory','','inherit','open','closed','','blackrock-castle-observatory-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:50','2026-08-24 10:16:50','',10601,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/blackrock-castle-observatory/blackrock-castle-observatory-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10603,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:51','2026-08-21 20:48:51','<p>Ilnacullin (Garnish Island) é um jardim insular desenhado no início do século XX, com glicínias, jardim italiano e a torre martelo com vista para o mar. O passeio de barco passa por colônias de focas.</p>','Garnish Island','Ilha-jardim na baía de Glengarriff, famosa pelos jardins italianos, torre martelo e focas no trajeto de barco.','publish','closed','closed','','garnish-island','','','2026-09-15 19:41:35','2026-09-15 18:41:35','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/garnish-island/',0,'leisure','',0),(10604,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:50','2026-08-24 10:16:50','','Garnish Island','','inherit','open','closed','','garnish-island-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:50','2026-08-24 10:16:50','',10603,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/garnish-island/garnish-island-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10605,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:51','2026-08-21 20:48:51','<p>Spike Island guarda 1.300 anos de história: mosteiro, fortaleza e a prisão que em 1847 abrigava mais de 2.000 detentos. O tour inclui o forte Star, túneis e exposições premiadas.</p>','Spike Island','Ilha-fortaleza no porto de Cork, já a maior prisão do mundo, hoje museu premiado acessível por ferry.','publish','closed','closed','','spike-island-cork','','','2026-09-15 19:41:35','2026-09-15 18:41:35','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/spike-island-cork/',0,'leisure','',0),(10606,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:50','2026-08-24 10:16:50','','Spike Island','','inherit','open','closed','','spike-island','','','2026-08-24 11:16:50','2026-08-24 10:16:50','',10605,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/spike-island-cork/spike-island/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10607,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:51','2026-08-21 20:48:51','<p>As terras da família St Leger foram desenhadas no estilo Capability Brown e hoje são um parque público gratuito com manada de cervos, lagos e bosques — um dos espaços verdes mais queridos do norte de Cork.</p>','Doneraile Park','Parque paisagístico do século XVIII com cervos, trilhas e playground, entrada gratuita.','publish','closed','closed','','doneraile-park','','','2026-09-15 19:41:35','2026-09-15 18:41:35','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/doneraile-park/',0,'leisure','',0),(10608,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:50','2026-08-24 10:16:50','','Doneraile Park','','inherit','open','closed','','doneraile-park-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:50','2026-08-24 10:16:50','',10607,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/doneraile-park/doneraile-park-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10609,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:51','2026-08-21 20:48:51','<p>Skellig Michael abriga um mosteiro cristão primitivo construído em degraus de pedra a 180 metros acima do mar. O acesso é limitado a barcos licenciados entre maio e outubro, com reservas muito concorridas.</p>','Skellig Michael','Patrimônio Mundial da UNESCO: mosteiro do século VI no topo de ilha rochosa no Atlântico, cenário de Star Wars.','publish','closed','closed','','skellig-michael','','','2026-09-15 19:41:35','2026-09-15 18:41:35','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/skellig-michael/',0,'leisure','',0),(10610,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:50','2026-08-24 10:16:50','','Skellig Michael','','inherit','open','closed','','skellig-michael-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:50','2026-08-24 10:16:50','',10609,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/skellig-michael/skellig-michael-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10611,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:51','2026-08-21 20:48:51','<p>Valentia Island combina natureza e história: as pegadas fósseis de tetrápodes estão entre as mais antigas do mundo, e a ilha sediou o primeiro cabo telegráfico transatlântico da Europa à América.</p>','Valentia Island','Ilha conectada por ponte e ferry, com pegadas de dinossauro, jardins subtropicais e o farol de Cromwell Point.','publish','closed','closed','','valentia-island','','','2026-09-15 19:41:36','2026-09-15 18:41:36','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/valentia-island/',0,'leisure','',0),(10612,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:50','2026-08-24 10:16:50','','Valentia Island','','inherit','open','closed','','valentia-island-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:50','2026-08-24 10:16:50','',10611,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/valentia-island/valentia-island-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10613,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:51','2026-08-21 20:48:51','<p>Os Kerry Cliffs oferecem o melhor mirante para as ilhas Skellig, a partir de plataformas seguras sobre penhascos que caem direto no Atlântico. Um dos pontos mais dramáticos do Ring of Kerry.</p>','Kerry Cliffs','Falésias de mais de 300 metros com vista para Skellig Michael, no Anel de Skellig.','publish','closed','closed','','kerry-cliffs','','','2026-09-15 19:41:36','2026-09-15 18:41:36','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/kerry-cliffs/',0,'leisure','',0),(10614,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:51','2026-08-24 10:16:51','','Kerry Cliffs','','inherit','open','closed','','kerry-cliffs-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:51','2026-08-24 10:16:51','',10613,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/kerry-cliffs/kerry-cliffs-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10615,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:52','2026-08-21 20:48:52','<p>Derrynane House preserva memórias de Daniel O\'Connell, campeão da emancipação católica. O parque ao redor inclui a praia de Derrynane, trilhas litorâneas e jardins com plantas raras.</p>','Derrynane House & National Historic Park','Casa de Daniel O\'Connell, o Libertador, dentro de um parque costeiro com praia e jardins subtropicais.','publish','closed','closed','','derrynane-house','','','2026-09-15 19:41:36','2026-09-15 18:41:36','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/derrynane-house/',0,'leisure','',0),(10616,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:51','2026-08-24 10:16:51','','Derrynane House &#038; National Historic Park','','inherit','open','closed','','derrynane-house-national-historic-park','','','2026-08-24 11:16:51','2026-08-24 10:16:51','',10615,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/derrynane-house/derrynane-house-national-historic-park/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10617,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:52','2026-08-21 20:48:52','<p>Gallarus Oratory é o exemplo mais bem preservado de arquitetura cristã primitiva da Irlanda. Suas paredes de pedra sem argamassa permanecem impermeáveis há mais de mil anos.</p>','Gallarus Oratory','Oratório cristão primitivo em pedra seca, com mais de 1.200 anos, em forma de casco de barco invertido.','publish','closed','closed','','gallarus-oratory','','','2026-09-15 19:41:36','2026-09-15 18:41:36','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/gallarus-oratory/',0,'leisure','',0),(10618,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:51','2026-08-24 10:16:51','','Gallarus Oratory','','inherit','open','closed','','gallarus-oratory-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:51','2026-08-24 10:16:51','',10617,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/gallarus-oratory/gallarus-oratory-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10619,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:52','2026-08-21 20:48:52','<p>Muckross Abbey foi fundada por volta de 1448 e várias vezes saqueada e reconstruída. Poetas e chefes gaélicos estão enterrados em seu cemitério. Acesso livre a pé ou de bicicleta a partir de Muckross House.</p>','Muckross Abbey','Abadia franciscana do século XV com claustro e um enorme teixo central, no coração do parque nacional.','publish','closed','closed','','muckross-abbey','','','2026-09-15 19:41:36','2026-09-15 18:41:36','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/muckross-abbey/',0,'leisure','',0),(10620,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:51','2026-08-24 10:16:51','','Muckross Abbey','','inherit','open','closed','','muckross-abbey-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:51','2026-08-24 10:16:51','',10619,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/muckross-abbey/muckross-abbey-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10621,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:52','2026-08-21 20:48:52','<p>Banna Strand se estende por cerca de 10 km e é famosa pelo desembarque de Roger Casement em 1916. Hoje é uma praia popular para famílias, surfistas e caminhadas com vista para o Atlântico.</p>','Banna Strand','Praia extensa de areia dourada ao norte de Tralee, com dunas e águas ideais para surf e banho.','publish','closed','closed','','banna-strand','','','2026-09-15 19:41:36','2026-09-15 18:41:36','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/banna-strand/',0,'leisure','',0),(10622,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:51','2026-08-24 10:16:51','','Banna Strand','','inherit','open','closed','','banna-strand-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:51','2026-08-24 10:16:51','',10621,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/banna-strand/banna-strand-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10623,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:52','2026-08-21 20:48:52','<p>O Rock of Dunamase domina a planície de Laois desde o século IX. A fortaleza, associada ao casamento de Strongbow e Aoife, é de acesso livre e oferece um dos mirantes mais impressionantes do midlands.</p>','Rock of Dunamase','Fortaleza normanda em ruínas sobre afloramento rochoso, com vistas de 360° pelo interior de Laois.','publish','closed','closed','','rock-of-dunamase','','','2026-09-15 19:41:36','2026-09-15 18:41:36','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/rock-of-dunamase/',0,'leisure','',0),(10624,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:51','2026-08-24 10:16:51','','Rock of Dunamase','','inherit','open','closed','','rock-of-dunamase-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:51','2026-08-24 10:16:51','',10623,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/rock-of-dunamase/rock-of-dunamase-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10625,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:52','2026-08-21 20:48:52','<p>Emo Court foi projetada por James Gandon (arquiteto do Custom House de Dublin) e seus terrenos incluem um lago formal atribuído a Capability Brown. A casa pode ser visitada em tours guiados gratuitos.</p>','Emo Court','Mansão neoclássica do século XVIII com jardins e lago desenhados por Capability Brown; entrada gratuita.','publish','closed','closed','','emo-court','','','2026-09-15 19:41:36','2026-09-15 18:41:36','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/emo-court/',0,'leisure','',0),(10626,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:51','2026-08-24 10:16:51','','Emo Court','','inherit','open','closed','','emo-court-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:51','2026-08-24 10:16:51','',10625,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/emo-court/emo-court-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10627,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:52','2026-08-21 20:48:52','<p>Os Heywood Gardens combinam um jardim paisagístico do século XVIII com terraços formais projetados por Edwin Lutyens em 1906, incluindo um jardim circular murado de grande charme.</p>','Heywood Gardens','Jardins formais dos séculos XVIII/XIX com terraços, lago e o famoso \"jardim secreto\" circular.','publish','closed','closed','','heywood-gardens','','','2026-09-15 19:41:36','2026-09-15 18:41:36','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/heywood-gardens/',0,'leisure','',0),(10628,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:52','2026-08-24 10:16:52','','Heywood Gardens','','inherit','open','closed','','heywood-gardens-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:52','2026-08-24 10:16:52','',10627,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/heywood-gardens/heywood-gardens-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10629,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:52','2026-08-21 20:48:52','<p>A torre redonda de Timahoe ergue-se quase 30 metros sobre um mosteiro do século VII fundado por São Mochua. Seu portal esculpido com cabeças humanas é único entre as torres irlandesas.</p>','Timahoe Round Tower','Torre redonda do século XII considerada uma das mais belas da Irlanda, com portal ricamente decorado.','publish','closed','closed','','timahoe-round-tower','','','2026-09-15 19:41:36','2026-09-15 18:41:36','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/timahoe-round-tower/',0,'leisure','',0),(10630,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:52','2026-08-24 10:16:52','','Timahoe Round Tower','','inherit','open','closed','','timahoe-round-tower-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:52','2026-08-24 10:16:52','',10629,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/timahoe-round-tower/timahoe-round-tower-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10631,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:52','2026-08-21 20:48:52','<p>Abbeyleix foi uma das primeiras vilas planejadas da Irlanda. O Heritage House documenta sua história, a indústria do tapete Abbeyleix e a vida rural do midlands, com exposições e arquivo local.</p>','Abbeyleix Heritage House','Centro de patrimônio que conta a história planejada da vila georgiana de Abbeyleix e do tapete local.','publish','closed','closed','','abbeyleix-heritage-house','','','2026-09-15 19:41:36','2026-09-15 18:41:36','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/abbeyleix-heritage-house/',0,'leisure','',0),(10632,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:52','2026-08-24 10:16:52','','Abbeyleix Heritage House','','inherit','open','closed','','abbeyleix-heritage-house-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:52','2026-08-24 10:16:52','',10631,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/abbeyleix-heritage-house/abbeyleix-heritage-house-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10633,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:53','2026-08-21 20:48:53','<p>As Slieve Bloom Mountains oferecem algumas das caminhadas mais tranquilas da Irlanda central, com rotas marcadas, o Glenbarrow Waterfall e vistas que alcançam metade do país em dias claros.</p>','Slieve Bloom Mountains','Montanhas de turfeira e floresta entre Laois e Offaly, com trilhas, cachoeiras e mirantes panorâmicos.','publish','closed','closed','','slieve-bloom-mountains','','','2026-09-15 19:41:36','2026-09-15 18:41:36','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/slieve-bloom-mountains/',0,'leisure','',0),(10634,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:52','2026-08-24 10:16:52','','Slieve Bloom Mountains','','inherit','open','closed','','slieve-bloom-mountains-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:52','2026-08-24 10:16:52','',10633,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/slieve-bloom-mountains/slieve-bloom-mountains-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10635,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:53','2026-08-21 20:48:53','<p>Fundado por São Ciarán em 545, Clonmacnoise foi um grande centro de aprendizado e peregrinação. O sítio reúne duas torres redondas, sete igrejas, três alta cruzes e um museu com lápidas célticas.</p>','Clonmacnoise','Um dos mosteiros mais importantes da Europa medieval, às margens do rio Shannon, com torres redondas e alta cruzes.','publish','closed','closed','','clonmacnoise','','','2026-09-15 19:41:37','2026-09-15 18:41:37','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/clonmacnoise/',0,'leisure','',0),(10636,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:52','2026-08-24 10:16:52','','Clonmacnoise','','inherit','open','closed','','clonmacnoise-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:52','2026-08-24 10:16:52','',10635,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/clonmacnoise/clonmacnoise-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10637,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:53','2026-08-21 20:48:53','<p>Birr Castle combina um jardim histórico excepcional com o Leviatã de Parsonstown — por décadas o maior telescópio do mundo — e um centro de ciência interativo. A família Parsons ainda vive no castelo.</p>','Birr Castle Demesne','Propriedade científica dos Parsons com jardins premiados, o telescópio gigante do século XIX e centro de ciência.','publish','closed','closed','','birr-castle-demesne','','','2026-09-15 19:41:37','2026-09-15 18:41:37','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/birr-castle-demesne/',0,'leisure','',0),(10638,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:52','2026-08-24 10:16:52','','Birr Castle Demesne','','inherit','open','closed','','birr-castle-demesne-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:52','2026-08-24 10:16:52','',10637,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/birr-castle-demesne/birr-castle-demesne-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10639,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:53','2026-08-21 20:48:53','<p>Lough Boora transformou antigas turfeiras industriais num parque de 2.000 hectares com esculturas monumentais, trilhas planas para todas as idades e observação de aves como o peneireiro e o maçarico.</p>','Lough Boora Discovery Park','Parque de turfeiras regeneradas com esculturas ao ar livre, trilhas de caminhada e ciclismo e aves raras.','publish','closed','closed','','lough-boora-discovery-park','','','2026-09-15 19:41:37','2026-09-15 18:41:37','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/lough-boora-discovery-park/',0,'leisure','',0),(10640,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:53','2026-08-24 10:16:53','','Lough Boora Discovery Park','','inherit','open','closed','','lough-boora-discovery-park-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:53','2026-08-24 10:16:53','',10639,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/lough-boora-discovery-park/lough-boora-discovery-park-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10641,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:53','2026-08-21 20:48:53','<p>Charleville Forest Castle é um dos castelos góticos mais atmosféricos da Irlanda, imortalizado em fotos e filmes. A floresta ao redor guarda alguns dos carvalhos mais antigos do país.</p>','Charleville Forest Castle','Castelo neogótico do século XIX cercado por floresta antiga de carvalhos, com tours e eventos.','publish','closed','closed','','charleville-forest-castle','','','2026-09-15 19:41:37','2026-09-15 18:41:37','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/charleville-forest-castle/',0,'leisure','',0),(10642,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:53','2026-08-24 10:16:53','','Charleville Forest Castle','','inherit','open','closed','','charleville-forest-castle-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:53','2026-08-24 10:16:53','',10641,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/charleville-forest-castle/charleville-forest-castle-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10643,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:53','2026-08-21 20:48:53','<p>Nos antigos bond stores de Tullamore, o centro de visitantes narra a história do blended whiskey irlandês criado em 1829, terminando com uma degustação comparativa de três rótulos.</p>','Tullamore D.E.W. Experience','Centro de visitantes do whisky Tullamore D.E.W. num armazém do século XIX, com degustações guiadas.','publish','closed','closed','','tullamore-dew-experience','','','2026-09-15 19:41:37','2026-09-15 18:41:37','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/tullamore-dew-experience/',0,'leisure','',0),(10644,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:53','2026-08-24 10:16:53','','Tullamore D.E.W. Experience','','inherit','open','closed','','tullamore-d-e-w-experience','','','2026-08-24 11:16:53','2026-08-24 10:16:53','',10643,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/tullamore-dew-experience/tullamore-d-e-w-experience/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10645,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:53','2026-08-21 20:48:53','<p>Belvedere House fica às margens do Lough Ennell e é famosa pela Jealous Wall — a maior folly da Irlanda, construída por um irmão para bloquear a vista da mansão vizinha. O parque tem playground e trilhas.</p>','Belvedere House Gardens & Park','Casa de campo do século XVIII com jardins, folly \"Jealous Wall\" e eventos familiares o ano inteiro.','publish','closed','closed','','belvedere-house-gardens','','','2026-09-15 19:41:37','2026-09-15 18:41:37','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/belvedere-house-gardens/',0,'leisure','',0),(10646,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:53','2026-08-24 10:16:53','','Belvedere House Gardens &#038; Park','','inherit','open','closed','','belvedere-house-gardens-park','','','2026-08-24 11:16:53','2026-08-24 10:16:53','',10645,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/belvedere-house-gardens/belvedere-house-gardens-park/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10647,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:53','2026-08-21 20:48:53','<p>Athlone Castle guarda a travessia estratégica do Shannon desde 1129. O centro de visitantes usa exposições interativas para contar o cerco de 1691 e a história militar e civil da cidade.</p>','Athlone Castle Visitor Centre','Castelo normando do século XII no rio Shannon, com museu interativo sobre o cerco de Athlone.','publish','closed','closed','','athlone-castle','','','2026-09-15 19:41:37','2026-09-15 18:41:37','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/athlone-castle/',0,'leisure','',0),(10648,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:53','2026-08-24 10:16:53','','Athlone Castle Visitor Centre','','inherit','open','closed','','athlone-castle-visitor-centre','','','2026-08-24 11:16:53','2026-08-24 10:16:53','',10647,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/athlone-castle/athlone-castle-visitor-centre/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10649,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:54','2026-08-21 20:48:54','<p>A Kilbeggan Distillery produz whiskey desde 1757. O tour mostra o processo tradicional, o motor a vapor de 1870 em operação e termina com degustação no bar de 200 anos.</p>','Kilbeggan Distillery Experience','Destilaria licenciada mais antiga do mundo (1757), com moinho a vapor funcionando e degustações.','publish','closed','closed','','kilbeggan-distillery','','','2026-09-15 19:41:37','2026-09-15 18:41:37','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/kilbeggan-distillery/',0,'leisure','',0),(10650,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:53','2026-08-24 10:16:53','','Kilbeggan Distillery Experience','','inherit','open','closed','','kilbeggan-distillery-experience','','','2026-08-24 11:16:53','2026-08-24 10:16:53','',10649,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/kilbeggan-distillery/kilbeggan-distillery-experience/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10651,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:54','2026-08-21 20:48:54','<p>Mullaghmeen cobre colinas de faia, freixo e bétula com rotas marcadas até o ponto mais alto de Westmeath. Ao lado fica o Lough Derravaragh, cenário da lenda dos Filhos de Lir.</p>','Mullaghmeen Forest','Grande floresta de folhosas plantadas, com trilhas e vista para o Lough Derravaragh.','publish','closed','closed','','mullaghmeen-forest','','','2026-09-15 19:41:37','2026-09-15 18:41:37','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/mullaghmeen-forest/',0,'leisure','',0),(10652,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:54','2026-08-24 10:16:54','','Mullaghmeen Forest','','inherit','open','closed','','mullaghmeen-forest-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:54','2026-08-24 10:16:54','',10651,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/mullaghmeen-forest/mullaghmeen-forest-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10653,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:54','2026-08-21 20:48:54','<p>Glendeer Pet Farm é um programa clássico de dia chuvoso ou ensolarado para famílias com crianças pequenas: alimentação de animais, tratores de brinquedo e área interna coberta.</p>','Glendeer Pet Farm','Fazenda de animais aberta ao público com cabras, cordeiros, aves e playground coberto.','publish','closed','closed','','glendeer-pet-farm','','','2026-09-15 19:41:37','2026-09-15 18:41:37','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/glendeer-pet-farm/',0,'leisure','',0),(10654,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:54','2026-08-21 20:48:54','<p>A Corlea Trackway foi construída em 148 a.C. e é a maior via de madeira pré-histórica já descoberta na Europa. O centro de visitantes permite ver a estrada original preservada no ambiente úmido.</p>','Corlea Trackway Visitor Centre','Centro que protege uma estrada de carvalho de 2.000 anos construída sobre a turfeira, única na Europa.','publish','closed','closed','','corlea-trackway','','','2026-09-15 19:41:37','2026-09-15 18:41:37','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/corlea-trackway/',0,'leisure','',0),(10655,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:54','2026-08-24 10:16:54','','Corlea Trackway Visitor Centre','','inherit','open','closed','','corlea-trackway-visitor-centre','','','2026-08-24 11:16:54','2026-08-24 10:16:54','',10654,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/corlea-trackway/corlea-trackway-visitor-centre/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10656,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:54','2026-08-21 20:48:54','<p>Ardagh é frequentemente citada como uma das vilas mais bonitas da Irlanda, com seu verde cercado por edifícios do século XVIII. O centro de patrimônio explica a história local e o tesouro de Ardagh.</p>','Ardagh Heritage Village','Vila vencedora de prêmios de conservação, com verde central pitoresco e centro de interpretação.','publish','closed','closed','','ardagh-heritage-village','','','2026-09-15 19:41:37','2026-09-15 18:41:37','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/ardagh-heritage-village/',0,'leisure','',0),(10657,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:54','2026-08-24 10:16:54','','Ardagh Heritage Village','','inherit','open','closed','','ardagh-heritage-village-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:54','2026-08-24 10:16:54','',10656,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/ardagh-heritage-village/ardagh-heritage-village-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10658,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:54','2026-08-21 20:48:54','<p>A motte de Granard, erguida por Richard de Tuite em 1199, coroa um morro usado desde a Idade do Ferro. Do topo, avistam-se os condados vizinhos em todos os horizontes.</p>','Granard Motte & Bailey','Motte normanda do século XII sobre morro antigo, com estátua de Santa Kitirine e vistas amplas.','publish','closed','closed','','granard-motte-bailey','','','2026-09-15 19:41:38','2026-09-15 18:41:38','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/granard-motte-bailey/',0,'leisure','',0),(10659,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:54','2026-08-24 10:16:54','','Granard Motte &#038; Bailey','','inherit','open','closed','','granard-motte-bailey-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:54','2026-08-24 10:16:54','',10658,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/granard-motte-bailey/granard-motte-bailey-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10660,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:54','2026-08-21 20:48:54','<p>O Royal Canal Greenway acompanha o canal do século XVIII por 130 km planos, ideais para bicicleta. O marco final fica em Cloondara, onde o canal encontra o rio Shannon.</p>','Royal Canal Greenway','Greenway de 130 km ao longo do Royal Canal, de Dublin a Cloondara — o trecho final fica em Longford.','publish','closed','closed','','royal-canal-greenway','','','2026-09-15 19:41:38','2026-09-15 18:41:38','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/royal-canal-greenway/',0,'leisure','',0),(10661,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:54','2026-08-24 10:16:54','','Royal Canal Greenway','','inherit','open','closed','','royal-canal-greenway-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:54','2026-08-24 10:16:54','',10660,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/royal-canal-greenway/royal-canal-greenway-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10662,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:54','2026-08-21 20:48:54','<p>Newcastle Wood oferece caminhadas sombreadas e observação de vida silvestre a poucos minutos de Ballymahon, no coração rural de Longford.</p>','Newcastle Wood','Floresta de coníferas e folhosas com trilhas tranquilas perto de Ballymahon.','publish','closed','closed','','newcastle-wood','','','2026-09-15 19:41:38','2026-09-15 18:41:38','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/newcastle-wood/',0,'leisure','',0),(10663,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:54','2026-08-24 10:16:54','','Newcastle Wood','','inherit','open','closed','','newcastle-wood-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:54','2026-08-24 10:16:54','',10662,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/newcastle-wood/newcastle-wood-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10664,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:55','2026-08-21 20:48:55','<p>Lough Ree (\"lago dos reis\") é o segundo maior lago do Shannon, compartilhado por Longford, Westmeath e Roscommon. De Lanesborough e Ballyleague partem cruzeiros e rotas de pesca famosas.</p>','Lough Ree','Grande lago do rio Shannon com ilhas, pesca, passeios de barco e praias fluviais.','publish','closed','closed','','lough-ree','','','2026-09-15 19:41:38','2026-09-15 18:41:38','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/lough-ree/',0,'leisure','',0),(10665,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:54','2026-08-24 10:16:54','','Lough Ree','','inherit','open','closed','','lough-ree-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:54','2026-08-24 10:16:54','',10664,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/lough-ree/lough-ree-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10666,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:55','2026-08-21 20:48:55','<p>Rathcroghan (Ráth Crúachan) foi sede dos reis de Connacht e palco do épico Táin Bó Cúailnge. O centro de visitantes em Tulsk organiza tours arqueológicos pelos monumentos e pela caverna de Oweynagat.</p>','Rathcroghan','Capital real antiga de Connacht e porta de entrada para o outro mundo na mitologia irlandesa.','publish','closed','closed','','rathcroghan','','','2026-09-15 19:41:38','2026-09-15 18:41:38','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/rathcroghan/',0,'leisure','',0),(10667,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:55','2026-08-24 10:16:55','','Rathcroghan','','inherit','open','closed','','rathcroghan-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:55','2026-08-24 10:16:55','',10666,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/rathcroghan/rathcroghan-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10668,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:55','2026-08-21 20:48:55','<p>Fundada em 1161, Boyle Abbey é uma das mais bem preservadas fundações cistercienses de Connacht, com arcadas românicas e góticas lado a lado no claustro.</p>','Boyle Abbey','Abadia cisterciense do século XII com claustro impressionante, no coração de Boyle.','publish','closed','closed','','boyle-abbey','','','2026-09-15 19:41:38','2026-09-15 18:41:38','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/boyle-abbey/',0,'leisure','',0),(10669,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:55','2026-08-24 10:16:55','','Boyle Abbey','','inherit','open','closed','','boyle-abbey-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:55','2026-08-24 10:16:55','',10668,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/boyle-abbey/boyle-abbey-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10670,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:55','2026-08-21 20:48:55','<p>Strokestown Park preserva a casa senhorial intacta e abriga o National Famine Museum, referência internacional sobre a Grande Fome de 1845-52. Os jardins murados de 4 acres estão entre os maiores da Irlanda.</p>','Strokestown Park & National Famine Museum','Mansão georgiana com o Museu Nacional da Grande Fome e jardins murados restaurados.','publish','closed','closed','','strokestown-park-famine-museum','','','2026-09-15 19:41:38','2026-09-15 18:41:38','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/strokestown-park-famine-museum/',0,'leisure','',0),(10671,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:55','2026-08-24 10:16:55','','Strokestown Park &#038; National Famine Museum','','inherit','open','closed','','strokestown-park-national-famine-museum','','','2026-08-24 11:16:55','2026-08-24 10:16:55','',10670,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/strokestown-park-famine-museum/strokestown-park-national-famine-museum/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10672,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:55','2026-08-21 20:48:55','<p>Na última mina de carvão da Irlanda, ex-trabalhadores guiam visitantes pelos túneis explicando 400 anos de mineração. Uma experiência autêntica e tocante da história industrial irlandesa.</p>','Arigna Mining Experience','Tour guiado por mina de carvão real conduzido por ex-mineradores, nas colinas de Arigna.','publish','closed','closed','','arigna-mining-experience','','','2026-09-15 19:41:38','2026-09-15 18:41:38','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/arigna-mining-experience/',0,'leisure','',0),(10673,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:55','2026-08-24 10:16:55','','Arigna Mining Experience','','inherit','open','closed','','arigna-mining-experience-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:55','2026-08-24 10:16:55','',10672,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/arigna-mining-experience/arigna-mining-experience-2/',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(10674,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:55','2026-08-21 20:48:55','<p>Lough Key combina 350 hectares de floresta e lago com atrações como a Moylurg Viewing Tower, o Zipit Forest Adventures e o Boda Borg — desafios indoor em equipe. Um dos parques mais completos do oeste.</p>','Lough Key Forest & Activity Park','Parque florestal com ilhas, torre de observação, zip line, bungalows e trilhas para todas as idades.','publish','closed','closed','','lough-key-forest-park','','','2026-09-15 19:41:38','2026-09-15 18:41:38','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/lough-key-forest-park/',0,'leisure','',0),(10675,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:55','2026-08-24 10:16:55','','Lough Key Forest &#038; Activity Park','','inherit','open','closed','','lough-key-forest-activity-park','','','2026-08-24 11:16:55','2026-08-24 10:16:55','',10674,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/lough-key-forest-park/lough-key-forest-activity-park/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10676,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:55','2026-08-21 20:48:55','<p>Construído por Robert de Ufford em 1269, o Roscommon Castle mudou de mãos várias vezes entre irlandeses e ingleses. Hoje integra um parque municipal com trilhas e o Loughnaneane Park.</p>','Roscommon Castle','Castelo normando do século XIII em ruínas evocativas, com parque público e lago ao redor.','publish','closed','closed','','roscommon-castle','','','2026-09-15 19:41:38','2026-09-15 18:41:38','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/roscommon-castle/',0,'leisure','',0),(10677,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:55','2026-08-24 10:16:55','','Roscommon Castle','','inherit','open','closed','','roscommon-castle-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:55','2026-08-24 10:16:55','',10676,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/roscommon-castle/roscommon-castle-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10678,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:55','2026-08-21 20:48:55','<p>Glencar Waterfall inspirou o poema \"The Stolen Child\" de Yeats. A queda d\'água fica a poucos minutos de carro do Lough Gill, com passarela fácil de acesso e ambiente de floresta encantada.</p>','Glencar Waterfall','Cascata de 15 metros imortalizada por W.B. Yeats, perto de Sligo, com trilha curta e área de piquenique.','publish','closed','closed','','glencar-waterfall','','','2026-09-15 19:41:39','2026-09-15 18:41:39','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/glencar-waterfall/',0,'leisure','',0),(10679,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:56','2026-08-24 10:16:56','','Glencar Waterfall','','inherit','open','closed','','glencar-waterfall-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:56','2026-08-24 10:16:56','',10678,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/glencar-waterfall/glencar-waterfall-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10680,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:55','2026-08-21 20:48:55','<p>Parke\'s Castle foi erguido sobre uma torre anterior dos O\'Rourke, reis de Breifne. Restaurado com pedra original, oferece exposições e vista privilegiada do Lough Gill.</p>','Parke\'s Castle','Castelo-forte do século XVII restaurado às margens do Lough Gill, com exposição sobre o plantation.','publish','closed','closed','','parkes-castle','','','2026-09-15 19:41:39','2026-09-15 18:41:39','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/parkes-castle/',0,'leisure','',0),(10681,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:56','2026-08-24 10:16:56','','Parke&#8217;s Castle','','inherit','open','closed','','parkes-castle-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:56','2026-08-24 10:16:56','',10680,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/parkes-castle/parkes-castle-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10682,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:56','2026-08-21 20:48:56','<p>A Acres Lake Floating Boardwalk é a primeira passarela flutuante da Irlanda, ligando Drumshanbo ao Lough Allen. Integra o Shannon Blueway, rede de trilhas aquáticas e terrestres.</p>','Acres Lake Floating Boardwalk','Passarela flutuante de 600 m sobre o Lough Allen, parte do Shannon Blueway, com trilhas e caiaque.','publish','closed','closed','','acres-lake-floating-boardwalk','','','2026-09-15 19:41:39','2026-09-15 18:41:39','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/acres-lake-floating-boardwalk/',0,'leisure','',0),(10683,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:56','2026-08-24 10:16:56','','Acres Lake Floating Boardwalk','','inherit','open','closed','','acres-lake-floating-boardwalk-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:56','2026-08-24 10:16:56','',10682,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/acres-lake-floating-boardwalk/acres-lake-floating-boardwalk-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10684,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:56','2026-08-21 20:48:56','<p>Lough Allen é o primeiro grande lago do rio Shannon, com praias discretas, mirantes e rotas de caiaque. As montanhas ao redor guardam paisagens de turfeira pouco exploradas.</p>','Lough Allen','Lago serrilhado no alto do Shannon, cercado pelas montanhas de Arigna e Sliabh an Iarainn.','publish','closed','closed','','lough-allen','','','2026-09-15 19:41:39','2026-09-15 18:41:39','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/lough-allen/',0,'leisure','',0),(10685,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:56','2026-08-24 10:16:56','','Lough Allen','','inherit','open','closed','','lough-allen-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:56','2026-08-24 10:16:56','',10684,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/lough-allen/lough-allen-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10686,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:56','2026-08-21 20:48:56','<p>Os terrenos de Lough Rynn, antiga sede dos condes de Leitrim, incluem jardins murados restaurados, um labirinto e trilhas à beira do lago. A propriedade funciona hoje como hotel, mas os jardins recebem visitantes.</p>','Lough Rynn Castle Gardens','Jardins históricos da propriedade dos Clements, com labirinto, walled garden e vista para o lago.','publish','closed','closed','','lough-rynn-castle-gardens','','','2026-09-15 19:41:39','2026-09-15 18:41:39','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/lough-rynn-castle-gardens/',0,'leisure','',0),(10687,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:56','2026-08-24 10:16:56','','Lough Rynn Castle Gardens','','inherit','open','closed','','lough-rynn-castle-gardens-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:56','2026-08-24 10:16:56','',10686,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/lough-rynn-castle-gardens/lough-rynn-castle-gardens-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10688,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:56','2026-08-21 20:48:56','<p>Seán Mac Diarmada, executado após o Levante da Páscoa de 1916, nasceu nesta casa de pedra típica. O sítio preserva mobiliário de época e conta a trajetória do líder republicano.</p>','Seán Mac Diarmada Cottage','Casa natal de um dos signatários da Proclamação de 1916, preservada como museu no norte de Leitrim.','publish','closed','closed','','sean-mac-diarmada-cottage','','','2026-09-15 19:41:39','2026-09-15 18:41:39','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/sean-mac-diarmada-cottage/',0,'leisure','',0),(10689,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:56','2026-08-24 10:16:56','','Seán Mac Diarmada Cottage','','inherit','open','closed','','sean-mac-diarmada-cottage-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:56','2026-08-24 10:16:56','',10688,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/sean-mac-diarmada-cottage/sean-mac-diarmada-cottage-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10690,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:56','2026-08-21 20:48:56','<p>O Cavan Burren Park guarda um dos conjuntos megalíticos mais acessíveis da Irlanda, com rotas curtas e painéis explicativos. Faz parte do Geoparque Global UNESCO Marble Arch Caves.</p>','Cavan Burren Park','Paisagem cárstica com megálitos, dolmens e trilhas interpretativas no Geoparque Global Marble Arch Caves.','publish','closed','closed','','cavan-burren-park','','','2026-09-15 19:41:39','2026-09-15 18:41:39','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/cavan-burren-park/',0,'leisure','',0),(10691,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:56','2026-08-24 10:16:56','','Cavan Burren Park','','inherit','open','closed','','cavan-burren-park-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:56','2026-08-24 10:16:56','',10690,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/cavan-burren-park/cavan-burren-park-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10692,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:56','2026-08-21 20:48:56','<p>Killykeen se estende pelas águas rendilhadas do Lough Oughter, perto do castelo de mesmo nome. Trilhas planas, píeres de pesca e aluguel de caiaques fazem dele um destino de fim de semana tranquilo.</p>','Killykeen Forest Park','Penínsulas florestais entre as ilhotas do Lough Oughter, com trilhas, caiaque e pesca.','publish','closed','closed','','killykeen-forest-park','','','2026-09-15 19:41:39','2026-09-15 18:41:39','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/killykeen-forest-park/',0,'leisure','',0),(10693,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:57','2026-08-24 10:16:57','','Killykeen Forest Park','','inherit','open','closed','','killykeen-forest-park-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:57','2026-08-24 10:16:57','',10692,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/killykeen-forest-park/killykeen-forest-park-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10694,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:56','2026-08-21 20:48:56','<p>Dún a Rí combina história e natureza: cabanas de gelo do século XVIII, uma ponte \"romana\", grutas e trilhas entre carvalhos e faías. Um dos parques florestais mais charmosos da região fronteiriça.</p>','Dún a Rí Forest Park','Parque florestal com cabanas de gelo, ponte romana e lendas locais, nas margens do rio Cabra.','publish','closed','closed','','dun-a-ri-forest-park','','','2026-09-15 19:41:39','2026-09-15 18:41:39','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/dun-a-ri-forest-park/',0,'leisure','',0),(10695,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:57','2026-08-24 10:16:57','','Dún a Rí Forest Park','','inherit','open','closed','','dun-a-ri-forest-park-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:57','2026-08-24 10:16:57','',10694,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/dun-a-ri-forest-park/dun-a-ri-forest-park-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10696,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:56','2026-08-21 20:48:56','<p>O Shannon Pot é onde o maior rio da Irlanda emerge do subsolo calcário. O sítio mítico, associado à deusa Sionna, fica numa paisagem remota de turfeira com plataforma de observação.</p>','Shannon Pot','Nascente do rio Shannon, o mais longo da Irlanda, num poço cárstico nas encostas do Cuilcagh.','publish','closed','closed','','shannon-pot','','','2026-09-15 19:41:40','2026-09-15 18:41:40','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/shannon-pot/',0,'leisure','',0),(10697,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:57','2026-08-24 10:16:57','','Shannon Pot','','inherit','open','closed','','shannon-pot-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:57','2026-08-24 10:16:57','',10696,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/shannon-pot/shannon-pot-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10698,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:57','2026-08-21 20:48:57','<p>Instalado num convento do século XIX, o Cavan County Museum destaca-se pela trincheira WWI em escala real construída nos jardins, além de coleções sobre história local e a Grande Fome.</p>','Cavan County Museum','Museu premiado com a maior réplica de trincheira da Primeira Guerra Mundial ao ar livre na Irlanda.','publish','closed','closed','','cavan-county-museum','','','2026-09-15 19:41:40','2026-09-15 18:41:40','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/cavan-county-museum/',0,'leisure','',0),(10699,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:57','2026-08-24 10:16:57','','Cavan County Museum','','inherit','open','closed','','cavan-county-museum-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:57','2026-08-24 10:16:57','',10698,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/cavan-county-museum/cavan-county-museum-2/',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(10700,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:57','2026-08-21 20:48:57','<p>Belturbet foi entroncamento das linhas Cavan &amp; Leitrim e Great Northern. O complexo restaurado inclui museu ferroviário, vagões originais e exposições sobre a era do trem na região.</p>','Belturbet Railway Station','Estação ferroviária de bitola estreita restaurada, com museu ferroviário e vagões de época.','publish','closed','closed','','belturbet-railway-station','','','2026-09-15 19:41:40','2026-09-15 18:41:40','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/belturbet-railway-station/',0,'leisure','',0),(10701,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:57','2026-08-24 10:16:57','','Belturbet Railway Station','','inherit','open','closed','','belturbet-railway-station-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:57','2026-08-24 10:16:57','',10700,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/belturbet-railway-station/belturbet-railway-station-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10702,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:57','2026-08-21 20:48:57','<p>O Castle Leslie Estate combina hotel histórico com 1.000 acres de floresta, lagos e centro equestre abertos a visitantes diurnos. Paul McCartney celebrou aqui seu casamento em 2002.</p>','Castle Leslie Estate','Propriedade da família Leslie desde 1660, com castelo vitoriano, centro equestre, lago e trilhas.','publish','closed','closed','','castle-leslie-estate','','','2026-09-15 19:41:40','2026-09-15 18:41:40','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/castle-leslie-estate/',0,'leisure','',0),(10703,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:57','2026-08-24 10:16:57','','Castle Leslie Estate','','inherit','open','closed','','castle-leslie-estate-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:57','2026-08-24 10:16:57','',10702,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/castle-leslie-estate/castle-leslie-estate-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10704,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:57','2026-08-21 20:48:57','<p>Rossmore Forest Park oferece rotas fáceis entre lagos e bosques, com esculturas escondidas e os portais góticos da antiga mansão. Popular para corrida, passeios com cachorro e piqueniques.</p>','Rossmore Forest Park','Antiga propriedade dos Rossmore com trilhas, esculturas de madeira, lagos e ruínas de portais.','publish','closed','closed','','rossmore-forest-park','','','2026-09-15 19:41:40','2026-09-15 18:41:40','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/rossmore-forest-park/',0,'leisure','',0),(10705,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:58','2026-08-24 10:16:58','','Rossmore Forest Park','','inherit','open','closed','','rossmore-forest-park-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:58','2026-08-24 10:16:58','',10704,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/rossmore-forest-park/rossmore-forest-park-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10706,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:57','2026-08-21 20:48:57','<p>Fundado em 1974, o Monaghan County Museum foi pioneiro no país e acumulou prêmios. Destaque para a coleção de renda de Carrickmacross e exposições sobre a história da região de fronteira.</p>','Monaghan County Museum','Primeiro museu de condado da Irlanda, premiado, com coleções sobre artesanato, conflitos e vida rural.','publish','closed','closed','','monaghan-county-museum','','','2026-09-15 19:41:40','2026-09-15 18:41:40','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/monaghan-county-museum/',0,'leisure','',0),(10707,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:58','2026-08-24 10:16:58','','Monaghan County Museum','','inherit','open','closed','','monaghan-county-museum-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:58','2026-08-24 10:16:58','',10706,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/monaghan-county-museum/monaghan-county-museum-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10708,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:57','2026-08-21 20:48:57','<p>A Carrickmacross Lace Gallery mantém viva a tradição da renda irlandesa desde 1846. Visitantes veem artesãs trabalhando e podem comprar peças exclusivas feitas à mão.</p>','Carrickmacross Lace Gallery','Ateliê e galeria da famosa renda de Carrickmacross, técnica usada no vestido de noiva de Diana, princesa de Gales.','publish','closed','closed','','carrickmacross-lace-gallery','','','2026-09-15 19:41:40','2026-09-15 18:41:40','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/carrickmacross-lace-gallery/',0,'leisure','',0),(10709,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:58','2026-08-24 10:16:58','','Carrickmacross Lace Gallery','','inherit','open','closed','','carrickmacross-lace-gallery-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:58','2026-08-24 10:16:58','',10708,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/carrickmacross-lace-gallery/carrickmacross-lace-gallery-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10710,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:57','2026-08-21 20:48:57','<p>Inniskeen inspirou a obra de Patrick Kavanagh, um dos maiores poetas irlandeses do século XX. O centro, instalado na antiga igreja, apresenta sua vida, poemas e a paisagem que ele eternizou.</p>','Patrick Kavanagh Centre','Centro dedicado ao poeta Patrick Kavanagh na igreja antiga de Inniskeen, sua terra natal.','publish','closed','closed','','patrick-kavanagh-centre','','','2026-09-15 19:41:40','2026-09-15 18:41:40','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/patrick-kavanagh-centre/',0,'leisure','',0),(10711,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:58','2026-08-24 10:16:58','','Patrick Kavanagh Centre','','inherit','open','closed','','patrick-kavanagh-centre-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:58','2026-08-24 10:16:58','',10710,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/patrick-kavanagh-centre/patrick-kavanagh-centre-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10712,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:57','2026-08-21 20:48:57','<p>Sliabh Beagh (\"montanha de Brehon\") oferece caminhadas por turfeiras intocadas com vistas para seis condados. A rede de trilhas parte do Knockatallon Walkers\' Rest.</p>','Sliabh Beagh','Planalto de turfeira na fronteira com a Irlanda do Norte, com trilhas, mirante e centro de visitantes.','publish','closed','closed','','sliabh-beagh','','','2026-09-15 19:41:40','2026-09-15 18:41:40','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/sliabh-beagh/',0,'leisure','',0),(10713,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:58','2026-08-24 10:16:58','','Sliabh Beagh','','inherit','open','closed','','sliabh-beagh-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:58','2026-08-24 10:16:58','',10712,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/sliabh-beagh/sliabh-beagh-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10714,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:57','2026-08-21 20:48:57','<p>Glenveagh protege 16.000 hectares de montanhas, lagos e turfeiras. O castelo do século XIX e seus jardins exóticos ficam às margens do Lough Veagh, acessíveis a pé ou de shuttle.</p>','Glenveagh National Park','Segundo maior parque nacional da Irlanda, com castelo, jardins, vales glaciais e águias-reais reintroduzidas.','publish','closed','closed','','glenveagh-national-park','','','2026-09-15 19:41:40','2026-09-15 18:41:40','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/glenveagh-national-park/',0,'leisure','',0),(10715,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:58','2026-08-24 10:16:58','','Glenveagh National Park','','inherit','open','closed','','glenveagh-national-park-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:58','2026-08-24 10:16:58','',10714,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/glenveagh-national-park/glenveagh-national-park-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10716,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:58','2026-08-21 20:48:58','<p>As falésias de Sliabh Liag caem quase 600 metros sobre o Atlântico, três vezes mais altas que as de Moher. A estrada até Bunglas e a trilha de crista exigem cuidado, mas recompensam com vistas extremas.</p>','Sliabh Liag (Slieve League)','Falésias marinhas de quase 600 metros — entre as mais altas da Europa — com a trilha One Man\'s Pass.','publish','closed','closed','','sliabh-liag','','','2026-09-15 19:41:40','2026-09-15 18:41:40','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/sliabh-liag/',0,'leisure','',0),(10717,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:58','2026-08-24 10:16:58','','Sliabh Liag (Slieve League)','','inherit','open','closed','','sliabh-liag-slieve-league','','','2026-08-24 11:16:58','2026-08-24 10:16:58','',10716,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/sliabh-liag/sliabh-liag-slieve-league/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10718,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:58','2026-08-21 20:48:58','<p>Donegal Castle, do século XV, foi sede dos O\'Donnell, reis de Tir Chonaill. Restaurado, combina a torre gaélica com uma ala jacobina do século XVII e exposições sobre o clã.</p>','Donegal Castle','Fortaleza dos O\'Donnell restaurada com mansão jacobina anexa, no centro de Donegal Town.','publish','closed','closed','','donegal-castle','','','2026-09-15 19:41:40','2026-09-15 18:41:40','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/donegal-castle/',0,'leisure','',0),(10719,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:59','2026-08-24 10:16:59','','Donegal Castle','','inherit','open','closed','','donegal-castle-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:59','2026-08-24 10:16:59','',10718,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/donegal-castle/donegal-castle-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10720,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:58','2026-08-21 20:48:58','<p>Malin Head marca o extremo norte da ilha. Além das vistas sobre o mar, o cabeço guarda a Signal Tower de 1805 e serviu de locação para \"Star Wars: Os Últimos Jedi\".</p>','Malin Head','Ponto mais ao norte da Irlanda, com torre de sinais napoleônica, locações de Star Wars e vistas do Atlântico.','publish','closed','closed','','malin-head','','','2026-09-15 19:41:41','2026-09-15 18:41:41','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/malin-head/',0,'leisure','',0),(10721,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:59','2026-08-24 10:16:59','','Malin Head','','inherit','open','closed','','malin-head-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:59','2026-08-24 10:16:59','',10720,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/malin-head/malin-head-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10722,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:58','2026-08-21 20:48:58','<p>Erguido após o naufrágio da fragata HMS Saldanha, o farol de Fanad Head é um dos mais fotografados da Irlanda. Tours internos revelam a vida dos faroleiros; há até suítes para pernoite.</p>','Fanad Head Lighthouse','Farol icônico de 1817 entre as praias de Fanad, com tours internos e hospedagem no farol.','publish','closed','closed','','fanad-head-lighthouse','','','2026-09-15 19:41:41','2026-09-15 18:41:41','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/fanad-head-lighthouse/',0,'leisure','',0),(10723,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:59','2026-08-24 10:16:59','','Fanad Head Lighthouse','','inherit','open','closed','','fanad-head-lighthouse-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:59','2026-08-24 10:16:59','',10722,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/fanad-head-lighthouse/fanad-head-lighthouse-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10724,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:58','2026-08-21 20:48:58','<p>O Grianán of Aileach domina a península de Inishowen com muralhas de 5 metros de espessura. Do topo, vê-se Lough Swilly, Lough Foyle e, em dias claros, três províncias.</p>','Grianán of Aileach','Fortaleza de pedra do século VI/VII no topo do Greenan Mountain, antiga sede dos reis de Tyrconnell.','publish','closed','closed','','grianan-of-aileach','','','2026-09-15 19:41:41','2026-09-15 18:41:41','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/grianan-of-aileach/',0,'leisure','',0),(10725,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:59','2026-08-24 10:16:59','','Grianán of Aileach','','inherit','open','closed','','grianan-of-aileach-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:59','2026-08-24 10:16:59','',10724,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/grianan-of-aileach/grianan-of-aileach-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10726,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:58','2026-08-21 20:48:58','<p>Errigal é o pico-símbolo de Donegal, de quartzito cintilante. A rota clássica sobe e desce pela crista sul em 2-3 horas, com recompensa de 360° sobre a cadeia Derryveagh.</p>','Errigal','Montanha mais alta de Donegal (751 m), com subida íngreme e panorama sobre o Poisoned Glen.','publish','closed','closed','','errigal','','','2026-09-15 19:41:41','2026-09-15 18:41:41','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/errigal/',0,'leisure','',0),(10727,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:59','2026-08-24 10:16:59','','Errigal','','inherit','open','closed','','errigal-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:59','2026-08-24 10:16:59','',10726,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/errigal/errigal-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10728,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:58','2026-08-21 20:48:58','<p>Ards Forest Park combina floresta, dunas e praias desertas com a abadia franciscana de Ards. As trilhas circulares passam por penhascos com vista para Horn Head e Atlantic Drive.</p>','Ards Forest Park','Península florestal com praias, ruínas franciscanas e trilhas costeiras de frente para Sheephaven Bay.','publish','closed','closed','','ards-forest-park','','','2026-09-15 19:41:41','2026-09-15 18:41:41','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/ards-forest-park/',0,'leisure','',0),(10729,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:59','2026-08-24 10:16:59','','Ards Forest Park','','inherit','open','closed','','ards-forest-park-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:59','2026-08-24 10:16:59','',10728,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/ards-forest-park/ards-forest-park-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10730,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:58','2026-08-21 20:48:58','<p>Benbulben forma um paredão de 526 metros visível de toda a região. A caminhada clássica parte de Luke\'s Bridge até a crista; na base, a Benbulben Forest Walk oferece rota fácil com vista frontal.</p>','Benbulben','Mesa de calcário símbolo de Sligo, imortalizada por Yeats, com trilha na crista e caminhada fácil na base.','publish','closed','closed','','benbulben','','','2026-09-15 19:41:41','2026-09-15 18:41:41','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/benbulben/',0,'leisure','',0),(10731,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:16:59','2026-08-24 10:16:59','','Benbulben','','inherit','open','closed','','benbulben-2','','','2026-08-24 11:16:59','2026-08-24 10:16:59','',10730,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/benbulben/benbulben-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10732,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:59','2026-08-21 20:48:59','<p>Strandhill é um dos polos de surf da costa noroeste, com ondas consistentes e infraestrutura de escolas e cafés. A vila também é conhecida pelos banhos de sargaço (seaweed baths).</p>','Strandhill Beach','Praia de surf aos pés do Knocknarea, com escolas de surf, banhos de sargaço e pôr do sol famoso.','publish','closed','closed','','strandhill-beach','','','2026-09-15 19:41:41','2026-09-15 18:41:41','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/strandhill-beach/',0,'leisure','',0),(10733,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:00','2026-08-24 10:17:00','','Strandhill Beach','','inherit','open','closed','','strandhill-beach-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:00','2026-08-24 10:17:00','',10732,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/strandhill-beach/strandhill-beach-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10734,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:59','2026-08-21 20:48:59','<p>Carrowmore reúne cerca de 30 monumentos megalíticos, entre os mais antigos da Irlanda. O centro de visitantes organiza tours guiados pelo cemitério e explica a pré-história do noroeste.</p>','Carrowmore Megalithic Cemetery','Maior conjunto de túmulos megalíticos da Irlanda, com mais de 5.500 anos, sob o olhar do Knocknarea.','publish','closed','closed','','carrowmore-megalithic-cemetery','','','2026-09-15 19:41:41','2026-09-15 18:41:41','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/carrowmore-megalithic-cemetery/',0,'leisure','',0),(10735,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:00','2026-08-24 10:17:00','','Carrowmore Megalithic Cemetery','','inherit','open','closed','','carrowmore-megalithic-cemetery-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:00','2026-08-24 10:17:00','',10734,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/carrowmore-megalithic-cemetery/carrowmore-megalithic-cemetery-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10736,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:59','2026-08-21 20:48:59','<p>O Knocknarea (327 m) é coroado por um enorme cairn atribuído à rainha guerreira Medb. A trilha de 40-50 minutos é a caminhada mais popular de Sligo, com panorama de Benbulben ao oceano.</p>','Queen Maeve\'s Trail (Knocknarea)','Trilha até o cairn de pedra da rainha Medb no topo do Knocknarea, com vista de Sligo e do Atlântico.','publish','closed','closed','','queen-maeves-trail-knocknarea','','','2026-09-15 19:41:41','2026-09-15 18:41:41','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/queen-maeves-trail-knocknarea/',0,'leisure','',0),(10737,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:00','2026-08-24 10:17:00','','Queen Maeve&#8217;s Trail (Knocknarea)','','inherit','open','closed','','queen-maeves-trail-knocknarea-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:00','2026-08-24 10:17:00','',10736,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/queen-maeves-trail-knocknarea/queen-maeves-trail-knocknarea-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10738,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:59','2026-08-21 20:48:59','<p>Fundada em 1252, a Sligo Abbey sobreviveu a incêndios e guerras e inspirou contos de Yeats. O claustro e o altar esculpido do século XV são destaques raros do gótico irlandês.</p>','Sligo Abbey','Abadia dominicana do século XIII, única com altar-mor medieval original preservado na Irlanda.','publish','closed','closed','','sligo-abbey','','','2026-09-15 19:41:41','2026-09-15 18:41:41','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/sligo-abbey/',0,'leisure','',0),(10739,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:00','2026-08-24 10:17:00','','Sligo Abbey','','inherit','open','closed','','sligo-abbey-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:00','2026-08-24 10:17:00','',10738,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/sligo-abbey/sligo-abbey-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10740,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:59','2026-08-21 20:48:59','<p>Lissadell House recebeu W.B. Yeats, que a imortalizou em poemas, e foi lar de Constance Markievicz, primeira mulher eleita ao parlamento britânico. Aberta na temporada com tours e exposições.</p>','Lissadell House','Mansão dos Gore-Booth, ligada a Constance Markievicz e a Yeats, com jardins e galeria de exposições.','publish','closed','closed','','lissadell-house','','','2026-09-15 19:41:41','2026-09-15 18:41:41','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/lissadell-house/',0,'leisure','',0),(10741,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:00','2026-08-24 10:17:00','','Lissadell House','','inherit','open','closed','','lissadell-house-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:00','2026-08-24 10:17:00','',10740,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/lissadell-house/lissadell-house-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10742,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:48:59','2026-08-21 20:48:59','<p>Drumcliffe foi fundado por São Columba. Hoje é destino de peregrinação literária: \"Cast a cold Eye / On Life, on Death. / Horseman, pass by!\" — o epitáfio de Yeats marca sua sepultura sob o Benbulben.</p>','Drumcliffe','Sítio monástico do século VI com alta cruz e torre redonda, onde está o túmulo de W.B. Yeats.','publish','closed','closed','','drumcliffe','','','2026-09-15 19:41:41','2026-09-15 18:41:41','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/drumcliffe/',0,'leisure','',0),(10743,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:00','2026-08-24 10:17:00','','Drumcliffe','','inherit','open','closed','','drumcliffe-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:00','2026-08-24 10:17:00','',10742,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/drumcliffe/drumcliffe-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10744,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:00','2026-08-21 20:49:00','<p>Eagles Flying é o maior centro de aves de rapina da Irlanda. As demonstrações diárias de voo livre, com águias passando a centímetros da plateia, encantam crianças e adultos.</p>','Eagles Flying','Centro irlandês de aves de rapina com demonstrações de voo de águias, falcões e corujas.','publish','closed','closed','','eagles-flying','','','2026-09-15 19:41:41','2026-09-15 18:41:41','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/eagles-flying/',0,'leisure','',0),(10745,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:00','2026-08-24 10:17:00','','Eagles Flying','','inherit','open','closed','','eagles-flying-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:00','2026-08-24 10:17:00','',10744,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/eagles-flying/eagles-flying-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10746,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:00','2026-08-21 20:49:00','<p>Croagh Patrick (\"Reek\") é a montanha de peregrinação mais famosa da Irlanda: São Patrício teria jejuado 40 dias no topo em 441 d.C. A subida leva 2 horas e recompensa com vista de Clew Bay.</p>','Croagh Patrick','Montanha sagrada de São Patrício (764 m), com peregrinação anual e vista sobre Clew Bay e suas 365 ilhotas.','publish','closed','closed','','croagh-patrick','','','2026-09-15 19:41:42','2026-09-15 18:41:42','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/croagh-patrick/',0,'leisure','',0),(10747,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:01','2026-08-24 10:17:01','','Croagh Patrick','','inherit','open','closed','','croagh-patrick-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:01','2026-08-24 10:17:01','',10746,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/croagh-patrick/croagh-patrick-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10748,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:00','2026-08-21 20:49:00','<p>Achill combina montanhas que caem no mar, praias como Keem e Keel, e a vila deserta de Slievemore. A Atlantic Drive contorna a ilha com alguns dos cenários mais dramáticos do Wild Atlantic Way.</p>','Achill Island','Maior ilha da Irlanda, ligada por ponte, com falésias de Croaghaun, praias selvagens e vila de Keel.','publish','closed','closed','','achill-island','','','2026-09-15 19:41:42','2026-09-15 18:41:42','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/achill-island/',0,'leisure','',0),(10749,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:01','2026-08-24 10:17:01','','Achill Island','','inherit','open','closed','','achill-island-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:01','2026-08-24 10:17:01','',10748,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/achill-island/achill-island-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10750,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:00','2026-08-21 20:49:00','<p>Keem Bay, no extremo oeste de Achill, é cercada por falésias do Croaghaun e do Benmore. As águas azul-turquesa e o cenário isolado fizeram dela um dos destinos mais fotografados do país.</p>','Keem Bay','Baía em forma de ferradura com areia branca, eleita repetidamente entre as praias mais bonitas da Irlanda.','publish','closed','closed','','keem-bay','','','2026-09-15 19:41:42','2026-09-15 18:41:42','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/keem-bay/',0,'leisure','',0),(10751,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:01','2026-08-24 10:17:01','','Keem Bay','','inherit','open','closed','','keem-bay-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:01','2026-08-24 10:17:01','',10750,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/keem-bay/keem-bay-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10752,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:00','2026-08-21 20:49:00','<p>Westport House, construída sobre o forte de Grace O\'Malley, é uma das casas históricas mais visitadas da Irlanda. Os terrenos incluem parque de aventura, piratas, trenó e atividades para crianças.</p>','Westport House & Adventure Park','Mansão georgiana da família Browne com parque de aventura, zoológico pequeno e terrenos históricos.','publish','closed','closed','','westport-house','','','2026-09-15 19:41:42','2026-09-15 18:41:42','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/westport-house/',0,'leisure','',0),(10753,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:01','2026-08-24 10:17:01','','Westport House &#038; Adventure Park','','inherit','open','closed','','westport-house-adventure-park','','','2026-08-24 11:17:01','2026-08-24 10:17:01','',10752,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/westport-house/westport-house-adventure-park/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10754,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:00','2026-08-21 20:49:00','<p>Em Turlough, perto de Castlebar, o museu apresenta a vida cotidiana rural entre 1850 e 1950: pesca, agricultura, festas e artesanato. O parque inclui jardins de ervas e a torre redonda de Turlough.</p>','National Museum of Ireland – Country Life','Museu nacional da vida rural irlandesa, num parque com jardins e moinho, entrada gratuita.','publish','closed','closed','','national-museum-country-life','','','2026-09-15 19:41:42','2026-09-15 18:41:42','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/national-museum-country-life/',0,'leisure','',0),(10755,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:01','2026-08-24 10:17:01','','National Museum of Ireland – Country Life','','inherit','open','closed','','national-museum-of-ireland-country-life','','','2026-08-24 11:17:01','2026-08-24 10:17:01','',10754,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/national-museum-country-life/national-museum-of-ireland-country-life/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10756,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:00','2026-08-21 20:49:00','<p>Downpatrick Head é famoso pelo Dún Briste, pilha de rocha de 45 metros separada da costa por um temporal em 1393. O sítio inclui ruínas eclesiásticas e vistas impressionantes do mar.</p>','Downpatrick Head','Cabeço com o sea stack Dún Briste (\"rota quebrada\"), igreja antiga e poço de São Patrício sobre o Atlântico.','publish','closed','closed','','downpatrick-head','','','2026-09-15 19:41:42','2026-09-15 18:41:42','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/downpatrick-head/',0,'leisure','',0),(10757,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:01','2026-08-24 10:17:01','','Downpatrick Head','','inherit','open','closed','','downpatrick-head-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:01','2026-08-24 10:17:01','',10756,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/downpatrick-head/downpatrick-head-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10758,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:00','2026-08-21 20:49:00','<p>Os Céide Fields são campos cercados por muros de pedra cultivados antes das pirâmides do Egito. O centro de visitantes, com arquitetura premiada, explica a descoberta arqueológica sob a turfeira.</p>','Céide Fields','Sistema agrícola neolítico de 5.500 anos, o mais extenso do mundo, sob a turfeira do norte de Mayo.','publish','closed','closed','','ceide-fields','','','2026-09-15 19:41:42','2026-09-15 18:41:42','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/ceide-fields/',0,'leisure','',0),(10759,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:02','2026-08-24 10:17:02','','Céide Fields','','inherit','open','closed','','ceide-fields-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:02','2026-08-24 10:17:02','',10758,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/ceide-fields/ceide-fields-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10760,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:00','2026-08-21 20:49:00','<p>O Great Western Greenway segue a linha férrea de 1895 por 42 km planos entre montanhas e mar. Aluguel de bicicletas em Westport, Newport, Mulranny e Achill facilita trechos de meio dia.</p>','Great Western Greenway','Greenway de 42 km sobre antiga ferrovia, de Westport a Achill, um dos passeios de bicicleta mais bonitos da Irlanda.','publish','closed','closed','','great-western-greenway','','','2026-09-15 19:41:42','2026-09-15 18:41:42','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/great-western-greenway/',0,'leisure','',0),(10761,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:02','2026-08-24 10:17:02','','Great Western Greenway','','inherit','open','closed','','great-western-greenway-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:02','2026-08-24 10:17:02','',10760,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/great-western-greenway/great-western-greenway-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10762,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:01','2026-08-21 20:49:01','<p>Wild Nephin protege 15.000 hectares de turfeira intacta — um dos maiores trechos selvagens da Europa. O centro de visitantes em Ballycroy explica o ecossistema e a reserva de céu escuro.</p>','Wild Nephin Ballycroy National Park','Parque nacional de turfeiras selvagens e montanhas Nephin, com centro de visitantes e céus escuros.','publish','closed','closed','','wild-nephin-ballycroy-national-park','','','2026-09-15 19:41:42','2026-09-15 18:41:42','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/wild-nephin-ballycroy-national-park/',0,'leisure','',0),(10763,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:02','2026-08-24 10:17:02','','Wild Nephin Ballycroy National Park','','inherit','open','closed','','wild-nephin-ballycroy-national-park-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:02','2026-08-24 10:17:02','',10762,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/wild-nephin-ballycroy-national-park/wild-nephin-ballycroy-national-park-2/',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(10764,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:01','2026-08-21 20:49:01','<p>Clare Island, fortaleza marítima de Grace O\'Malley no século XVI, guarda sua abadia com afrescos medievais raros. Ferry parte de Roonagh Quay; a ilha tem pub, pousadas e trilhas até o farol.</p>','Clare Island','Ilha da pirata Grace O\'Malley na entrada de Clew Bay, com abadia muralhada, farol e trilhas costeiras.','publish','closed','closed','','clare-island','','','2026-09-15 19:41:42','2026-09-15 18:41:42','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/clare-island/',0,'leisure','',0),(10765,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:02','2026-08-24 10:17:02','','Clare Island','','inherit','open','closed','','clare-island-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:02','2026-08-24 10:17:02','',10764,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/clare-island/clare-island-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10766,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:01','2026-08-21 20:49:01','<p>Kilkenny Castle domina a cidade desde 1195. Os interiores restaurados incluem a biblioteca e o salão de desenho; os jardins descem até o rio Nore e são abertos gratuitamente ao público.</p>','Kilkenny Castle','Castelo normando de 1195, sede dos duques de Ormonde por seis séculos, com jardins vitorianos.','publish','closed','closed','','kilkenny-castle','','','2026-09-15 19:41:42','2026-09-15 18:41:42','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/kilkenny-castle/',0,'leisure','',0),(10767,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:02','2026-08-24 10:17:02','','Kilkenny Castle','','inherit','open','closed','','kilkenny-castle-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:02','2026-08-24 10:17:02','',10766,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/kilkenny-castle/kilkenny-castle-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10768,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:01','2026-08-21 20:49:01','<p>Instalado na igreja de St Mary do século XIII, o museu apresenta a vida dos mercadores e monges da Kilkenny medieval, com exposições imersivas e a cripta restaurada.</p>','Medieval Mile Museum','Museu na igreja de St Mary sobre a Kilkenny medieval, com cripta e lápidas dos mercadores.','publish','closed','closed','','medieval-mile-museum','','','2026-09-15 19:41:43','2026-09-15 18:41:43','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/medieval-mile-museum/',0,'leisure','',0),(10769,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:02','2026-08-24 10:17:02','','Medieval Mile Museum','','inherit','open','closed','','medieval-mile-museum-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:02','2026-08-24 10:17:02','',10768,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/medieval-mile-museum/medieval-mile-museum-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10770,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:01','2026-08-21 20:49:01','<p>Jerpoint Abbey é famosa pelas esculturas de seus claustros e pelas efígies de cavaleiros esculpidas em pedra. Uma das ruínas monásticas mais atmosféricas do sudeste.</p>','Jerpoint Abbey','Abadia cisterciense do século XII com esculturas góticas excepcionais e figuras esculpidas nos túmulos.','publish','closed','closed','','jerpoint-abbey','','','2026-09-15 19:41:43','2026-09-15 18:41:43','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/jerpoint-abbey/',0,'leisure','',0),(10771,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:03','2026-08-24 10:17:03','','Jerpoint Abbey','','inherit','open','closed','','jerpoint-abbey-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:03','2026-08-24 10:17:03','',10770,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/jerpoint-abbey/jerpoint-abbey-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10772,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:01','2026-08-21 20:49:01','<p>Rothe House foi construída entre 1594 e 1610 pelo mercador John Rothe. O complexo de três casas e pátios inclui um jardim reconstruído segundo plantas do século XVII.</p>','Rothe House & Garden','Casa mercantil tudor do século XVII, única do tipo aberta ao público na Irlanda, com jardim de recriação histórica.','publish','closed','closed','','rothe-house-garden','','','2026-09-15 19:41:43','2026-09-15 18:41:43','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/rothe-house-garden/',0,'leisure','',0),(10773,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:03','2026-08-24 10:17:03','','Rothe House &#038; Garden','','inherit','open','closed','','rothe-house-garden-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:03','2026-08-24 10:17:03','',10772,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/rothe-house-garden/rothe-house-garden-2/',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(10774,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:01','2026-08-21 20:49:01','<p>No coração da Medieval Mile, o tour da Smithwick\'s percorre a cervejaria mais antiga da Irlanda, com degustação final no bar original. História, arquitetura e cerveja num só passeio.</p>','Smithwick\'s Experience','Tour pela antiga cervejaria de Kilkenny, onde o ale Smithwick\'s é produzido desde 1710.','publish','closed','closed','','smithwicks-experience','','','2026-09-15 19:41:43','2026-09-15 18:41:43','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/smithwicks-experience/',0,'leisure','',0),(10775,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:03','2026-08-24 10:17:03','','Smithwick&#8217;s Experience','','inherit','open','closed','','smithwicks-experience-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:03','2026-08-24 10:17:03','',10774,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/smithwicks-experience/smithwicks-experience-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10776,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:01','2026-08-21 20:49:01','<p>Dunmore Cave é citada no Annals como local de massacre de vikings em 928. As formações de calcário e a câmara de 45 metros de profundidade são visitadas em tours guiados.</p>','Dunmore Cave','Caverna de calcário com formações dramáticas e história ligada a um ataque viking do século X.','publish','closed','closed','','dunmore-cave','','','2026-09-15 19:41:43','2026-09-15 18:41:43','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/dunmore-cave/',0,'leisure','',0),(10777,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:03','2026-08-24 10:17:03','','Dunmore Cave','','inherit','open','closed','','dunmore-cave-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:03','2026-08-24 10:17:03','',10776,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/dunmore-cave/dunmore-cave-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10778,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:02','2026-08-21 20:49:02','<p>Castlecomer Discovery Park transforma a antiga área de minas de carvão num centro de aventura: Elf Village para crianças, arborismo, arco e flecha, canoagem no lago e trilhas interpretativas.</p>','Castlecomer Discovery Park','Parque de aventura em 80 acres de floresta, com arborismo, zip lines, canoagem e trilhas.','publish','closed','closed','','castlecomer-discovery-park','','','2026-09-15 19:41:43','2026-09-15 18:41:43','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/castlecomer-discovery-park/',0,'leisure','',0),(10779,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:02','2026-08-21 20:49:02','<p>Jerpoint Park preserva as ruínas da cidade medieval desaparecida de Newtown Jerpoint, incluindo a igreja de São Nicolau — associada por alguns à origem das lendas de Papai Noel. Tours guiados pela família dona da terra.</p>','Jerpoint Park (Newtown Jerpoint)','Cidade medieval perdida de Newtown Jerpoint, com igreja de São Nicolau e lendas sobre o santo.','publish','closed','closed','','jerpoint-park','','','2026-09-15 19:41:43','2026-09-15 18:41:43','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/jerpoint-park/',0,'leisure','',0),(10780,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:03','2026-08-24 10:17:03','','Jerpoint Park (Newtown Jerpoint)','','inherit','open','closed','','jerpoint-park-newtown-jerpoint','','','2026-08-24 11:17:03','2026-08-24 10:17:03','',10779,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/jerpoint-park/jerpoint-park-newtown-jerpoint/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10781,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:02','2026-08-21 20:49:02','<p>Woodstock Gardens, acima da vila de Inistioge, foram restaurados pelo conselho do condado: arboreto, jardim murado, estufa e a famosa avenue de teixos. Entrada gratuita.</p>','Woodstock Gardens','Jardins vitorianos restaurados da mansão Tighe, com arboreto, avenue de teixos e vista do vale do Nore.','publish','closed','closed','','woodstock-gardens','','','2026-09-15 19:41:43','2026-09-15 18:41:43','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/woodstock-gardens/',0,'leisure','',0),(10782,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:03','2026-08-24 10:17:03','','Woodstock Gardens','','inherit','open','closed','','woodstock-gardens-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:03','2026-08-24 10:17:03','',10781,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/woodstock-gardens/woodstock-gardens-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10783,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:02','2026-08-21 20:49:02','<p>O tour pela House of Waterford Crystal mostra artesãos soprando, cortando e gravando o cristal mais famoso da Irlanda. A galeria exibe troféus esportivos e peças monumentais.</p>','House of Waterford Crystal','Fábrica e centro de visitantes do cristal Waterford, com tour pela produção e galeria de peças únicas.','publish','closed','closed','','house-of-waterford-crystal','','','2026-09-15 19:41:43','2026-09-15 18:41:43','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/house-of-waterford-crystal/',0,'leisure','',0),(10784,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:04','2026-08-24 10:17:04','','House of Waterford Crystal','','inherit','open','closed','','house-of-waterford-crystal-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:04','2026-08-24 10:17:04','',10783,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/house-of-waterford-crystal/house-of-waterford-crystal-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10785,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:02','2026-08-21 20:49:02','<p>Os Waterford Treasures reúnem três museus — Viking, Medieval e Bishop\'s Palace — que contam 1.100 anos de história da cidade mais antiga da Irlanda, fundada pelos vikings em 914.</p>','Waterford Treasures Museums','Conjunto de museus sobre a Irlanda viking e medieval, no coração do Viking Triangle.','publish','closed','closed','','waterford-treasures','','','2026-09-15 19:41:43','2026-09-15 18:41:43','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/waterford-treasures/',0,'leisure','',0),(10786,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:04','2026-08-24 10:17:04','','Waterford Treasures Museums','','inherit','open','closed','','waterford-treasures-museums','','','2026-08-24 11:17:04','2026-08-24 10:17:04','',10785,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/waterford-treasures/waterford-treasures-museums/',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(10787,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:02','2026-08-21 20:49:02','<p>Reginald\'s Tower guarda memórias dos vikings, do casamento de Strongbow e Aoife e da chegada de Strongbow. Hoje é museu do Waterford Treasures, com a espada viking de Waterford em exposição.</p>','Reginald\'s Tower','Torre viking do século XIII, o edifício civil mais antigo da Irlanda em uso contínuo.','publish','closed','closed','','reginals-tower','','','2026-09-15 19:41:44','2026-09-15 18:41:44','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/reginals-tower/',0,'leisure','',0),(10788,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:04','2026-08-24 10:17:04','','Reginald&#8217;s Tower','','inherit','open','closed','','reginalds-tower','','','2026-08-24 11:17:04','2026-08-24 10:17:04','',10787,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/reginals-tower/reginalds-tower/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10789,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:02','2026-08-21 20:49:02','<p>O Waterford Greenway (Deise Greenway) liga a cidade a Dungarvan por 46 km planos, cruzando o rio Suir em ponte de 200 m, passando por 11 pontes e um túnel de 400 m. Aluguel de bicicletas nas duas pontas.</p>','Waterford Greenway','Greenway de 46 km sobre antiga ferrovia, com viadutos, túnel e travessia do rio Suir — a mais popular da Irlanda.','publish','closed','closed','','waterford-greenway','','','2026-09-15 19:41:44','2026-09-15 18:41:44','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/waterford-greenway/',0,'leisure','',0),(10790,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:04','2026-08-24 10:17:04','','Waterford Greenway','','inherit','open','closed','','waterford-greenway-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:04','2026-08-24 10:17:04','',10789,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/waterford-greenway/waterford-greenway-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10791,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:02','2026-08-21 20:49:02','<p>A Copper Coast combina praias como Bunmahon e Annestown com penhascos de rocha vulcânica antiga. O centro geológico em Bunmahon explica a história de 460 milhões de anos da costa.</p>','Copper Coast Geopark','Litoral de 25 km com falésias, praias e geologia vulcânica de 460 milhões de anos, patrimônio UNESCO.','publish','closed','closed','','copper-coast-geopark','','','2026-09-15 19:41:44','2026-09-15 18:41:44','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/copper-coast-geopark/',0,'leisure','',0),(10792,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:04','2026-08-24 10:17:04','','Copper Coast Geopark','','inherit','open','closed','','copper-coast-geopark-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:04','2026-08-24 10:17:04','',10791,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/copper-coast-geopark/copper-coast-geopark-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10793,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:03','2026-08-21 20:49:03','<p>Mount Congreve é famoso pela coleção de azaleias e rododendros que explode em cores na primavera. Ambrose Congreve dedicou 80 anos ao jardim, hoje aberto ao público com café e viveiro.</p>','Mount Congreve Gardens','Um dos maiores jardins privados da Europa, com 70 acres de azaleias, rododendros e bosques plantados por Ambrose Congreve.','publish','closed','closed','','mount-congreve-gardens','','','2026-09-15 19:41:44','2026-09-15 18:41:44','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/mount-congreve-gardens/',0,'leisure','',0),(10794,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:04','2026-08-24 10:17:04','','Mount Congreve Gardens','','inherit','open','closed','','mount-congreve-gardens-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:04','2026-08-24 10:17:04','',10793,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/mount-congreve-gardens/mount-congreve-gardens-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10795,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:03','2026-08-21 20:49:03','<p>O castelo de Lismore, residência irlandesa dos Devonshires, não é aberto, mas seus jardins em dois níveis sim. Destaques: o jardim murado do século XVII e a vista do vale do Blackwater.</p>','Lismore Castle Gardens','Jardins históricos do castelo dos duques de Devonshire, com upper e lower gardens sobre o rio Blackwater.','publish','closed','closed','','lismore-castle-gardens','','','2026-09-15 19:41:44','2026-09-15 18:41:44','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/lismore-castle-gardens/',0,'leisure','',0),(10796,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:04','2026-08-24 10:17:04','','Lismore Castle Gardens','','inherit','open','closed','','lismore-castle-gardens-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:04','2026-08-24 10:17:04','',10795,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/lismore-castle-gardens/lismore-castle-gardens-2/',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(10797,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:03','2026-08-21 20:49:03','<p>Ardmore é um dos sítios cristãos mais antigos da Irlanda, fundado por São Declan antes da chegada de Patrício. A torre redonda, a catedral com frisos esculpidos e o oratório de pedra formam um conjunto raro.</p>','Ardmore Round Tower & Cathedral','Sítio monástico de São Declan com torre redonda de 30 m, catedral com esculturas e oratório primitivo.','publish','closed','closed','','ardmore-round-tower','','','2026-09-15 19:41:44','2026-09-15 18:41:44','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/ardmore-round-tower/',0,'leisure','',0),(10798,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:05','2026-08-24 10:17:05','','Ardmore Round Tower &#038; Cathedral','','inherit','open','closed','','ardmore-round-tower-cathedral','','','2026-08-24 11:17:05','2026-08-24 10:17:05','',10797,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/ardmore-round-tower/ardmore-round-tower-cathedral/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10799,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:03','2026-08-21 20:49:03','<p>O Coumshingaun Loop contorna o lago glaciar de Coumshingaun, cercado por paredes de 300 metros nas Comeragh Mountains. A trilha de 7,5 km exige bom preparo físico, mas é acessível sem equipamento.</p>','Coumshingaun Loop (Comeragh Mountains)','Trilha circular em torno de um lago glaciar num circo de falésias — uma das caminhadas mais espetaculares do sul.','publish','closed','closed','','coumshingaun-loop','','','2026-09-15 19:41:44','2026-09-15 18:41:44','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/coumshingaun-loop/',0,'leisure','',0),(10800,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:05','2026-08-24 10:17:05','','Coumshingaun Loop (Comeragh Mountains)','','inherit','open','closed','','coumshingaun-loop-comeragh-mountains','','','2026-08-24 11:17:05','2026-08-24 10:17:05','',10799,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/coumshingaun-loop/coumshingaun-loop-comeragh-mountains/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10801,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:03','2026-08-21 20:49:03','<p>No Irish National Heritage Park, 16 sítios reconstituídos mostram como os irlandeses viveram do mesolítico à chegada dos normandos. Tours guiados, trilhas e até pernoite em cabana de caçador.</p>','Irish National Heritage Park','Parque de 35 acres que recria 9.000 anos de história irlandesa: cabanas do mesolítico, crannóg, mosteiro e anel normando.','publish','closed','closed','','irish-national-heritage-park','','','2026-09-15 19:41:44','2026-09-15 18:41:44','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/irish-national-heritage-park/',0,'leisure','',0),(10802,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:05','2026-08-24 10:17:05','','Irish National Heritage Park','','inherit','open','closed','','irish-national-heritage-park-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:05','2026-08-24 10:17:05','',10801,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/irish-national-heritage-park/irish-national-heritage-park-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10803,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:03','2026-08-21 20:49:03','<p>Johnstown Castle combina um castelo gótico vitoriano, 50 hectares de jardins com lagos e grutas, e o Irish Agricultural Museum. Um dos passeios familiares mais completos do sudeste.</p>','Johnstown Castle','Castelo neogótico do século XIX com lagos, jardins e o Museu da Agricultura Irlandesa.','publish','closed','closed','','johnstown-castle','','','2026-09-15 19:41:44','2026-09-15 18:41:44','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/johnstown-castle/',0,'leisure','',0),(10804,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:05','2026-08-24 10:17:05','','Johnstown Castle','','inherit','open','closed','','johnstown-castle-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:05','2026-08-24 10:17:05','',10803,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/johnstown-castle/johnstown-castle-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10805,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:03','2026-08-21 20:49:03','<p>O Hook Head Lighthouse foi construído por William Marshal por volta de 1210 e ainda guia navios. Tours guiados sobem os 115 degraus; a península ao redor é rota cênica premiada.</p>','Hook Lighthouse','Farol medieval em operação desde o século XIII — um dos mais antigos do mundo — com tours e café.','publish','closed','closed','','hook-lighthouse','','','2026-09-15 19:41:44','2026-09-15 18:41:44','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/hook-lighthouse/',0,'leisure','',0),(10806,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:05','2026-08-24 10:17:05','','Hook Lighthouse','','inherit','open','closed','','hook-lighthouse-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:05','2026-08-24 10:17:05','',10805,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/hook-lighthouse/hook-lighthouse-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10807,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:03','2026-08-21 20:49:03','<p>O Dunbrody, construído em 1845, transportou milhares de irlandeses para a América. A réplica em New Ross oferece tour com atores interpretando passageiros — experiência comovente para quem conhece histórias de emigração.</p>','Dunbrody Famine Ship','Réplica fiel de um navio de emigrantes da Grande Fome, com tour imersivo sobre a travessia do Atlântico.','publish','closed','closed','','dunbrody-famine-ship','','','2026-09-15 19:41:44','2026-09-15 18:41:44','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/dunbrody-famine-ship/',0,'leisure','',0),(10808,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:05','2026-08-24 10:17:05','','Dunbrody Famine Ship','','inherit','open','closed','','dunbrody-famine-ship-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:05','2026-08-24 10:17:05','',10807,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/dunbrody-famine-ship/dunbrody-famine-ship-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10809,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:03','2026-08-21 20:49:03','<p>As Great Saltee Islands abrigam dezenas de milhares de aves marinhas na primavera: gansos-patola, papagaios-do-mar e gaivotas. Barcos de passageiros partem de Kilmore Quay na temporada.</p>','Saltee Islands','Santuário de aves marinhas com uma das maiores colônias de gansos-patola da Irlanda, acessível por barco de Kilmore Quay.','publish','closed','closed','','saltee-islands','','','2026-09-15 19:41:44','2026-09-15 18:41:44','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/saltee-islands/',0,'leisure','',0),(10810,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:06','2026-08-24 10:17:06','','Saltee Islands','','inherit','open','closed','','saltee-islands-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:06','2026-08-24 10:17:06','',10809,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/saltee-islands/saltee-islands-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10811,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:04','2026-08-21 20:49:04','<p>Curracloe é uma das praias mais premiadas da Irlanda, com águas rasas seguras e o Raven Nature Reserve nas dunas ao sul. Foi locação da cena de desembarque de \"Saving Private Ryan\".</p>','Curracloe Beach','Praia de 11 km de areia fina, cenário da abertura de \"O Resgate do Soldado Ryan\", com dunas e trilhas.','publish','closed','closed','','curracloe-beach','','','2026-09-15 19:41:45','2026-09-15 18:41:45','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/curracloe-beach/',0,'leisure','',0),(10812,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:06','2026-08-24 10:17:06','','Curracloe Beach','','inherit','open','closed','','curracloe-beach-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:06','2026-08-24 10:17:06','',10811,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/curracloe-beach/curracloe-beach-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10813,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:04','2026-08-21 20:49:04','<p>Gerida pelo NPWS, a reserva recebe milhares de aves migratórias entre outubro e março. A torre de observação e o centro de visitantes são gratuitos e acessíveis.</p>','Wexford Wildfowl Reserve','Reserva natural no North Slob, refúgio de inverno de um terço da população mundial de gansos-de-frente-branca da Groenlândia.','publish','closed','closed','','wexford-wildfowl-reserve','','','2026-09-15 19:41:45','2026-09-15 18:41:45','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/wexford-wildfowl-reserve/',0,'leisure','',0),(10814,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:06','2026-08-24 10:17:06','','Wexford Wildfowl Reserve','','inherit','open','closed','','wexford-wildfowl-reserve-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:06','2026-08-24 10:17:06','',10813,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/wexford-wildfowl-reserve/wexford-wildfowl-reserve-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10815,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:04','2026-08-21 20:49:04','<p>Ferns foi sede dos MacMurrough, reis de Leinster. O castelo de William Marshal tem uma capela única em planta de cruz, com vitrais contemporâneos. Entrada gratuita.</p>','Ferns Castle','Castelo normando do século XIII com capela em cruz e vitrais modernos, na antiga capital dos reis de Leinster.','publish','closed','closed','','ferns-castle','','','2026-09-15 19:41:45','2026-09-15 18:41:45','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/ferns-castle/',0,'leisure','',0),(10816,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:06','2026-08-24 10:17:06','','Ferns Castle','','inherit','open','closed','','ferns-castle-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:06','2026-08-24 10:17:06','',10815,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/ferns-castle/ferns-castle-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10817,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:04','2026-08-21 20:49:04','<p>William Marshal fundou Tintern Abbey em agradecimento por sobreviver a um naufrágio na costa de Wexford. A abadia, restaurada ao longo dos séculos, fica num vale tranquilo com trilhas.</p>','Tintern Abbey','Abadia cisterciense fundada em 1200 por William Marshal, com colunata vitoriana e vale arborizado.','publish','closed','closed','','tintern-abbey-wexford','','','2026-09-15 19:41:45','2026-09-15 18:41:45','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/tintern-abbey-wexford/',0,'leisure','',0),(10818,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:06','2026-08-24 10:17:06','','Tintern Abbey','','inherit','open','closed','','tintern-abbey','','','2026-08-24 11:17:06','2026-08-24 10:17:06','',10817,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/tintern-abbey-wexford/tintern-abbey/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10819,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:04','2026-08-21 20:49:04','<p>O Rock of Cashel foi sede dos reis de Munster por séculos — São Patrício teria convertido o rei Aenghus aqui. A Capela de Cormac (1127) é a joia românica da Irlanda; a catedral gótica e a torre redonda completam o conjunto.</p>','Rock of Cashel','Conjunto medieval espetacular sobre afloramento de calcário: catedral gótica, capela românica e torre redonda.','publish','closed','closed','','rock-of-cashel','','','2026-09-15 19:41:45','2026-09-15 18:41:45','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/rock-of-cashel/',0,'leisure','',0),(10820,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:06','2026-08-24 10:17:06','','Rock of Cashel','','inherit','open','closed','','rock-of-cashel-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:06','2026-08-24 10:17:06','',10819,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/rock-of-cashel/rock-of-cashel-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10821,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:04','2026-08-21 20:49:04','<p>Cahir Castle resistiu a cercos e manteve suas muralhas, torres e masmorra quase intactas. O filme \"Braveheart\" usou o castelo como locação. Tours guiados incluem a torre de menagem.</p>','Cahir Castle','Um dos castelos mais bem preservados da Irlanda, do século XIII, numa ilha do rio Suir.','publish','closed','closed','','cahir-castle','','','2026-09-15 19:41:45','2026-09-15 18:41:45','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/cahir-castle/',0,'leisure','',0),(10822,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:06','2026-08-24 10:17:06','','Cahir Castle','','inherit','open','closed','','cahir-castle-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:06','2026-08-24 10:17:06','',10821,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/cahir-castle/cahir-castle-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10823,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:04','2026-08-21 20:49:04','<p>O Swiss Cottage foi desenhado por John Nash como casa de lazer dos Cahir. Os interiores com papel de parede original e a trilha pela floresta até o castelo fazem parte da visita.</p>','Swiss Cottage','Chalé ornamental de 1810, exemplo perfeito do estilo \"picturesque\", com interior restaurado e floresta.','publish','closed','closed','','swiss-cottage','','','2026-09-15 19:41:45','2026-09-15 18:41:45','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/swiss-cottage/',0,'leisure','',0),(10824,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:07','2026-08-24 10:17:07','','Swiss Cottage','','inherit','open','closed','','swiss-cottage-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:07','2026-08-24 10:17:07','',10823,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/swiss-cottage/swiss-cottage-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10825,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:04','2026-08-21 20:49:04','<p>O Glen of Aherlow se estende por 25 km entre as Galtee Mountains, a mais alta cadeia do interior. Rotas de caminhada, o mirante da estátua Christ the King e a vila de Bansha compõem o passeio.</p>','Glen of Aherlow','Vale cênico entre as Galtee Mountains, com trilhas, mirante do Christ the King e vilas charmosas.','publish','closed','closed','','glen-of-aherlow','','','2026-09-15 19:41:45','2026-09-15 18:41:45','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/glen-of-aherlow/',0,'leisure','',0),(10826,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:07','2026-08-24 10:17:07','','Glen of Aherlow','','inherit','open','closed','','glen-of-aherlow-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:07','2026-08-24 10:17:07','',10825,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/glen-of-aherlow/glen-of-aherlow-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10827,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:04','2026-08-21 20:49:04','<p>The Vee é o desfiladeiro entre as Knockmealdown Mountains, famoso pelo mirante da \"Vee Rock\" e pelo Bay Lough, lago glaciar cercado de lendas. Rota cênica clássica entre Clogheen e Lismore.</p>','The Vee & Bay Lough','Passo de montanha em forma de V com mirante sobre o vale do Suir e o lago glaciar Bay Lough.','publish','closed','closed','','the-vee-bay-lough','','','2026-09-15 19:41:45','2026-09-15 18:41:45','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/the-vee-bay-lough/',0,'leisure','',0),(10828,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:07','2026-08-24 10:17:07','','The Vee &#038; Bay Lough','','inherit','open','closed','','the-vee-bay-lough-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:07','2026-08-24 10:17:07','',10827,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/the-vee-bay-lough/the-vee-bay-lough-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10829,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:04','2026-08-21 20:49:04','<p>Ormond Castle combina duas torres medievais do século XV com uma mansão elisabetana de 1565 — a única do gênero na Irlanda. Os interiores com estuque e a lenda do amor por Elizabeth I atraem visitantes.</p>','Ormond Castle','Casa isabelina única na Irlanda, construída por Tomás Butler, 10º Conde de Ormond, junto a torres medievais.','publish','closed','closed','','ormond-castle','','','2026-09-15 19:41:45','2026-09-15 18:41:45','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/ormond-castle/',0,'leisure','',0),(10830,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:07','2026-08-24 10:17:07','','Ormond Castle','','inherit','open','closed','','ormond-castle-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:07','2026-08-24 10:17:07','',10829,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/ormond-castle/ormond-castle-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10831,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:05','2026-08-21 20:49:05','<p>Mitchelstown Cave abriga o Tower of Babel, uma estalactite de 9 metros, e salões onde já se gravaram concertos por causa da acústica. Tours guiados percorrem 3 km de galerias iluminadas.</p>','Mitchelstown Cave','Uma das maiores cavernas da Europa, com estalactites gigantes, salões enormes e acústica de concertos.','publish','closed','closed','','mitchelstown-cave','','','2026-09-15 19:41:45','2026-09-15 18:41:45','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/mitchelstown-cave/',0,'leisure','',0),(10832,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:07','2026-08-24 10:17:07','','Mitchelstown Cave','','inherit','open','closed','','mitchelstown-cave-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:07','2026-08-24 10:17:07','',10831,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/mitchelstown-cave/mitchelstown-cave-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10833,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:05','2026-08-21 20:49:05','<p>Holy Cross Abbey recebeu seu nome da relíquia da Santa Cruz trazida no século XIII. Restaurada em 1975, é uma das poucas abadias medievais da Irlanda novamente usadas para missas.</p>','Holy Cross Abbey','Abadia cisterciense restaurada do século XII, famosa pela relíquia da Vera Cruz e ainda local de culto.','publish','closed','closed','','holy-cross-abbey','','','2026-09-15 19:41:45','2026-09-15 18:41:45','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/holy-cross-abbey/',0,'leisure','',0),(10834,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:07','2026-08-24 10:17:07','','Holy Cross Abbey','','inherit','open','closed','','holy-cross-abbey-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:07','2026-08-24 10:17:07','',10833,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/holy-cross-abbey/holy-cross-abbey-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10835,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:05','2026-08-21 20:49:05','<p>King John\'s Castle é um dos castelos normandos mais bem preservados da Europa. O centro de visitantes recria o cerco de 1642 e a vida medieval, com vista das muralhas para o rio Shannon.</p>','King John\'s Castle','Castelo normando de 1210 às margens do Shannon, com exposições interativas sobre cercos e história medieval.','publish','closed','closed','','king-johns-castle-limerick','','','2026-09-15 19:41:46','2026-09-15 18:41:46','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/king-johns-castle-limerick/',0,'leisure','',0),(10836,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:08','2026-08-24 10:17:08','','King John&#8217;s Castle','','inherit','open','closed','','king-johns-castle','','','2026-08-24 11:17:08','2026-08-24 10:17:08','',10835,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/king-johns-castle-limerick/king-johns-castle/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10837,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:05','2026-08-21 20:49:05','<p>O Hunt Museum, no Custom House do século XVIII, exibe mais de 2.000 peças reunidas pela família Hunt: desde artefatos irlandeses antigos até desenhos atribuídos a Da Vinci e Picasso.</p>','Hunt Museum','Coleção de arte e antiguidades dos Hunt, com Picasso, Renoir, Leonardo da Vinci e artefatos célticos.','publish','closed','closed','','hunt-museum','','','2026-09-15 19:41:46','2026-09-15 18:41:46','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/hunt-museum/',0,'leisure','',0),(10838,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:08','2026-08-24 10:17:08','','Hunt Museum','','inherit','open','closed','','hunt-museum-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:08','2026-08-24 10:17:08','',10837,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/hunt-museum/hunt-museum-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10839,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:05','2026-08-21 20:49:05','<p>Construída no local do palácio dos reis de Thomond, St Mary\'s Cathedral conserva misericórdias de coro do século XV e marcas de balas do cerco de 1691. Visitas guiadas revelam 850 anos de história.</p>','St Mary\'s Cathedral','Catedral de 1168, o edifício em uso mais antigo de Limerick, com misericórdias medievais raras.','publish','closed','closed','','st-marys-cathedral-limerick','','','2026-09-15 19:41:46','2026-09-15 18:41:46','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/st-marys-cathedral-limerick/',0,'leisure','',0),(10840,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:08','2026-08-24 10:17:08','','St Mary&#8217;s Cathedral','','inherit','open','closed','','st-marys-cathedral','','','2026-08-24 11:17:08','2026-08-24 10:17:08','',10839,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/st-marys-cathedral-limerick/st-marys-cathedral/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10841,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:05','2026-08-21 20:49:05','<p>Adare combina cottages de telhado de palha, a abadia franciscana, o trinitarian abbey e o Desmond Castle em ruínas. Sede do Ryder Cup 2027, é parada obrigatória na rota Cork–Limerick.</p>','Adare','Vila considerada a mais bonita da Irlanda, com cottages de palha, mosteiros e o castelo dos Desmond.','publish','closed','closed','','adare-village','','','2026-09-15 19:41:46','2026-09-15 18:41:46','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/adare-village/',0,'leisure','',0),(10842,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:08','2026-08-24 10:17:08','','Adare','','inherit','open','closed','','adare','','','2026-08-24 11:17:08','2026-08-24 10:17:08','',10841,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/adare-village/adare/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10843,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:05','2026-08-21 20:49:05','<p>Foynes foi o hub do hidroavião transatlântico entre 1937 e 1945. O museu exibe uma réplica completa do Boeing 314 e conta a história do Irish Coffee, inventado aqui para aquecer passageiros.</p>','Foynes Flying Boat & Maritime Museum','Museu na antiga base do Pan Am, com réplica em tamanho real do Boeing 314 e a origem do Irish Coffee.','publish','closed','closed','','foynes-flying-boat-museum','','','2026-09-15 19:41:46','2026-09-15 18:41:46','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/foynes-flying-boat-museum/',0,'leisure','',0),(10844,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:08','2026-08-24 10:17:08','','Foynes Flying Boat &#038; Maritime Museum','','inherit','open','closed','','foynes-flying-boat-maritime-museum','','','2026-08-24 11:17:08','2026-08-24 10:17:08','',10843,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/foynes-flying-boat-museum/foynes-flying-boat-maritime-museum/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10845,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:05','2026-08-21 20:49:05','<p>Lough Gur é um dos sítios arqueológicos mais importantes da Irlanda, habitado há 5.000 anos. O centro de visitantes e o Grange Stone Circle, com 113 pedras, revelam a pré-história do sudoeste.</p>','Lough Gur','Lago em forma de rim cercado por megálitos, círculos de pedra e o Grange Stone Circle, o maior da Irlanda.','publish','closed','closed','','lough-gur','','','2026-09-15 19:41:46','2026-09-15 18:41:46','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/lough-gur/',0,'leisure','',0),(10846,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:08','2026-08-24 10:17:08','','Lough Gur','','inherit','open','closed','','lough-gur-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:08','2026-08-24 10:17:08','',10845,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/lough-gur/lough-gur-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10847,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:05','2026-08-21 20:49:05','<p>Curraghchase foi a propriedade do poeta Aubrey de Vere. As ruínas da mansão incendiada em 1941, trilhas sombreadas e o lago com plataforma de observação fazem do parque um refúgio tranquilo.</p>','Curraghchase Forest Park','Parque florestal com ruínas da mansão De Vere, trilhas, lago e colônia de morcegos protegida.','publish','closed','closed','','curraghchase-forest-park','','','2026-09-15 19:41:46','2026-09-15 18:41:46','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/curraghchase-forest-park/',0,'leisure','',0),(10848,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:08','2026-08-24 10:17:08','','Curraghchase Forest Park','','inherit','open','closed','','curraghchase-forest-park-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:08','2026-08-24 10:17:08','',10847,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/curraghchase-forest-park/curraghchase-forest-park-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10849,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:06','2026-08-21 20:49:06','<p>O Irish National Stud cria garanhões de elite desde 1946. A visita inclui os estábulos, o Horse Museum e os Japanese Gardens — considerados os mais finos da Europa — com o St Fiachra\'s Garden ao lado.</p>','Irish National Stud & Japanese Gardens','Haras nacional com garanhões campeões, museu do cavalo e os famosos Jardins Japoneses de 1906.','publish','closed','closed','','irish-national-stud-japanese-gardens','','','2026-09-15 19:41:46','2026-09-15 18:41:46','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/irish-national-stud-japanese-gardens/',0,'leisure','',0),(10850,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:09','2026-08-24 10:17:09','','Irish National Stud &#038; Japanese Gardens','','inherit','open','closed','','irish-national-stud-japanese-gardens-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:09','2026-08-24 10:17:09','',10849,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/irish-national-stud-japanese-gardens/irish-national-stud-japanese-gardens-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10851,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:06','2026-08-21 20:49:06','<p>Castletown House foi construída para William Conolly, o homem mais rico da Irlanda do século XVIII. Os interiores incluem a Long Gallery de 24 metros; o parque tem trilhas e o Conolly Folly ao lado.</p>','Castletown House','Mansão palladiana de 1722, a maior da Irlanda, com salões restaurados e parque aberto ao público.','publish','closed','closed','','castletown-house','','','2026-09-15 19:41:46','2026-09-15 18:41:46','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/castletown-house/',0,'leisure','',0),(10852,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:09','2026-08-24 10:17:09','','Castletown House','','inherit','open','closed','','castletown-house-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:09','2026-08-24 10:17:09','',10851,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/castletown-house/castletown-house-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (10853,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:06','2026-08-21 20:49:06','<p>O Bog of Allen Nature Centre ensina sobre ecossistemas de turfeira — paisagens que cobrem boa parte do midlands. Visitantes exploram a Girley Bog com guias e conhecem o jardim de anfíbios.</p>','Bog of Allen Nature Centre','Centro do Irish Peatland Conservation Council com jardim de sapos, turfeira visitável e exposições sobre pântanos.','publish','closed','closed','','bog-of-allen-nature-centre','','','2026-09-15 19:41:47','2026-09-15 18:41:47','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/bog-of-allen-nature-centre/',0,'leisure','',0),(10854,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:09','2026-08-24 10:17:09','','Bog of Allen Nature Centre','','inherit','open','closed','','bog-of-allen-nature-centre-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:09','2026-08-24 10:17:09','',10853,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/bog-of-allen-nature-centre/bog-of-allen-nature-centre-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10855,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:06','2026-08-21 20:49:06','<p>Pollardstown Fen sobreviveu à última era glacial e abriga plantas e insetos raros. Passarelas de madeira permitem explorar a reserva gratuitamente, perto do Grand Canal.</p>','Pollardstown Fen','Maior fen (pântano alcalino) da Irlanda, reserva natural com passarelas e plantas raras de origem glacial.','publish','closed','closed','','pollardstown-fen','','','2026-09-15 19:41:47','2026-09-15 18:41:47','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/pollardstown-fen/',0,'leisure','',0),(10856,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:09','2026-08-24 10:17:09','','Pollardstown Fen','','inherit','open','closed','','pollardstown-fen-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:09','2026-08-24 10:17:09','',10855,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/pollardstown-fen/pollardstown-fen-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10857,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:06','2026-08-21 20:49:06','<p>Maynooth Castle foi o centro do poder dos Geraldines até 1535. As ruínas restauradas incluem a torre de menagem com exposição sobre a família FitzGerald. Entrada gratuita.</p>','Maynooth Castle','Fortaleza dos Fitzgerald, os poderosos condes de Kildare, no campus da universidade mais antiga da Irlanda.','publish','closed','closed','','maynooth-castle','','','2026-09-15 19:41:47','2026-09-15 18:41:47','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/maynooth-castle/',0,'leisure','',0),(10858,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:09','2026-08-24 10:17:09','','Maynooth Castle','','inherit','open','closed','','maynooth-castle-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:09','2026-08-24 10:17:09','',10857,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/maynooth-castle/maynooth-castle-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10859,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:06','2026-08-21 20:49:06','<p>Donadea Forest Park preserva as ruínas do castelo dos Aylmer e oferece trilhas populares, incluindo a rota de 5 km. O memorial 9/11 homenageia o bombeiro irlandês-americano Sean Tallon.</p>','Donadea Forest Park','Floresta com trilhas, lago, torre do castelo de Aylmer e o 9/11 Memorial Garden.','publish','closed','closed','','donadea-forest-park','','','2026-09-15 19:41:47','2026-09-15 18:41:47','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/donadea-forest-park/',0,'leisure','',0),(10860,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:09','2026-08-24 10:17:09','','Donadea Forest Park','','inherit','open','closed','','donadea-forest-park-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:09','2026-08-24 10:17:09','',10859,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/donadea-forest-park/donadea-forest-park-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10861,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:06','2026-08-21 20:49:06','<p>Lullymore combina história (mosteiro do século VI, rebelião de 1798) com diversão familiar: mini-trem, playground de madeira, minigolfe e trilhas pela turfeira.</p>','Lullymore Heritage & Discovery Park','Parque de descoberta numa ilha de calcário na turfeira, com tren, playground, minigolfe e história da turfa.','publish','closed','closed','','lullymore-heritage-park','','','2026-09-15 19:41:47','2026-09-15 18:41:47','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/lullymore-heritage-park/',0,'leisure','',0),(10862,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:10','2026-08-24 10:17:10','','Lullymore Heritage &#038; Discovery Park','','inherit','open','closed','','lullymore-heritage-discovery-park','','','2026-08-24 11:17:10','2026-08-24 10:17:10','',10861,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/lullymore-heritage-park/lullymore-heritage-discovery-park/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10863,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:06','2026-08-21 20:49:06','<p>Mondello Park recebe campeonatos nacionais e internacionais de automobilismo e motociclismo. Visitantes assistem às corridas e podem experimentar karting e track days.</p>','Mondello Park','Único autódromo internacional da Irlanda, com corridas abertas ao público e experiências de pilotagem.','publish','closed','closed','','mondello-park','','','2026-09-15 19:41:47','2026-09-15 18:41:47','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/mondello-park/',0,'leisure','',0),(10864,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:10','2026-08-24 10:17:10','','Mondello Park','','inherit','open','closed','','mondello-park-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:10','2026-08-24 10:17:10','',10863,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/mondello-park/mondello-park-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10865,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:06','2026-08-21 20:49:06','<p>Carlingford conserva portais medievais, o Tholsel e o King John\'s Castle em ruínas. A vila é famosa pelas ostras, pelas trilhas do Cooley Peninsula e pela vista para as Mourne Mountains.</p>','Carlingford','Vila medieval preservada na costa do Carlingford Lough, com muralhas, castelo e o Carlingford Oyster Festival.','publish','closed','closed','','carlingford','','','2026-09-15 19:41:47','2026-09-15 18:41:47','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/carlingford/',0,'leisure','',0),(10866,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:10','2026-08-24 10:17:10','','Carlingford','','inherit','open','closed','','carlingford-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:10','2026-08-24 10:17:10','',10865,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/carlingford/carlingford-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10867,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:06','2026-08-21 20:49:06','<p>O Proleek Dolmen, no terreno do Ballymascanlon House Hotel, é um dos megálitos mais fotogênicos da Irlanda. A tradição diz que acertar uma pedrinha no topo garante casamento ou boa sorte.</p>','Proleek Dolmen','Dólmen megalítico com laje de 40 toneladas, cercado de lendas — quem acertar uma pedra no topo terá sorte.','publish','closed','closed','','proleek-dolmen','','','2026-09-15 19:41:47','2026-09-15 18:41:47','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/proleek-dolmen/',0,'leisure','',0),(10868,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:10','2026-08-24 10:17:10','','Proleek Dolmen','','inherit','open','closed','','proleek-dolmen-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:10','2026-08-24 10:17:10','',10867,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/proleek-dolmen/proleek-dolmen-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10869,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:06','2026-08-21 20:49:06','<p>Fundado por São Buite no século VI, Monasterboice abriga a Muiredach\'s High Cross, considerada a mais bela da Irlanda, com painéis esculpidos do Antigo e Novo Testamento, além de duas torres redondas.</p>','Monasterboice','Sítio monástico com as alta cruzes mais famosas da Irlanda, incluindo a Muiredach\'s Cross do século X.','publish','closed','closed','','monasterboice','','','2026-09-15 19:41:47','2026-09-15 18:41:47','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/monasterboice/',0,'leisure','',0),(10870,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:10','2026-08-24 10:17:10','','Monasterboice','','inherit','open','closed','','monasterboice-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:10','2026-08-24 10:17:10','',10869,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/monasterboice/monasterboice-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10871,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:07','2026-08-21 20:49:07','<p>Mellifont (\"fonte de mel\") introduziu a arquitetura cisterciense na Irlanda e sediou o Sínodo de 1152. O lavabo octogonal restaurado é uma peça arquitetônica rara na Europa.</p>','Mellifont Abbey','Primeira abadia cisterciense da Irlanda (1142), com lavabo octogonal único e ruínas evocativas.','publish','closed','closed','','mellifont-abbey','','','2026-09-15 19:41:47','2026-09-15 18:41:47','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/mellifont-abbey/',0,'leisure','',0),(10872,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:10','2026-08-24 10:17:10','','Mellifont Abbey','','inherit','open','closed','','mellifont-abbey-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:10','2026-08-24 10:17:10','',10871,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/mellifont-abbey/mellifont-abbey-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10873,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:07','2026-08-21 20:49:07','<p>O Carlingford Lough Greenway segue a antiga linha férrea por 10 km planos entre a vila medieval e a fronteira. Ideal para bicicleta com crianças, com paradas em Omeath e Victoria Lock.</p>','Carlingford Lough Greenway','Greenway de 10 km ao longo do lough, entre Carlingford e Newry, com vista para as Mourne Mountains.','publish','closed','closed','','carlingford-lough-greenway','','','2026-09-15 19:41:48','2026-09-15 18:41:48','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/carlingford-lough-greenway/',0,'leisure','',0),(10874,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:10','2026-08-24 10:17:10','','Carlingford Lough Greenway','','inherit','open','closed','','carlingford-lough-greenway-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:10','2026-08-24 10:17:10','',10873,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/carlingford-lough-greenway/carlingford-lough-greenway-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10875,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:07','2026-08-21 20:49:07','<p>Millmount domina Drogheda desde o século XII. O complexo inclui o County Museum, com exposições sobre a Batalha do Boyne e a história local, e a torre Martello do século XIX.</p>','Millmount Fort & Museum','Fortaleza sobre motte normanda com vista de Drogheda, abrigando o museu municipal e a torre Martello.','publish','closed','closed','','millmount-fort-museum','','','2026-09-15 19:41:48','2026-09-15 18:41:48','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/millmount-fort-museum/',0,'leisure','',0),(10876,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:11','2026-08-24 10:17:11','','Millmount Fort &#038; Museum','','inherit','open','closed','','millmount-fort-museum-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:11','2026-08-24 10:17:11','',10875,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/millmount-fort-museum/millmount-fort-museum-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10877,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:07','2026-08-21 20:49:07','<p>O Brownshill Dolmen impressiona pela escala: sua laje de granito pesa cerca de 100 toneladas e é a maior da Europa. O monumento neolítico fica a poucos minutos do centro de Carlow.</p>','Brownshill Dolmen','Dólmen com a maior laje de cobertura da Europa: 100 toneladas de granito sobre pedras de suporte de 5.000 anos.','publish','closed','closed','','brownshill-dolmen','','','2026-09-15 19:41:48','2026-09-15 18:41:48','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/brownshill-dolmen/',0,'leisure','',0),(10878,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:11','2026-08-24 10:17:11','','Brownshill Dolmen','','inherit','open','closed','','brownshill-dolmen-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:11','2026-08-24 10:17:11','',10877,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/brownshill-dolmen/brownshill-dolmen-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10879,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:07','2026-08-21 20:49:07','<p>Altamont é chamado de \"o jardim mais romântico da Irlanda\". O lago espelhado, as árvores antigas e a coleção de bulbos e azaleias fazem dele um destino de todas as estações. Gerido pelo OPW, é gratuito.</p>','Altamont Gardens','Jardins românticos do século XVIII com lago, arboreto e o \"corredor de azaleias\" — entrada gratuita.','publish','closed','closed','','altamont-gardens','','','2026-09-15 19:41:48','2026-09-15 18:41:48','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/altamont-gardens/',0,'leisure','',0),(10880,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:11','2026-08-24 10:17:11','','Altamont Gardens','','inherit','open','closed','','altamont-gardens-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:11','2026-08-24 10:17:11','',10879,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/altamont-gardens/altamont-gardens-2/',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(10881,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:07','2026-08-21 20:49:07','<p>Duckett\'s Grove foi uma grande mansão gótica até o incêndio de 1933. As torres em ruínas e os jardins murados restaurados, com roseiras históricas, são hoje um parque público gratuito.</p>','Duckett\'s Grove','Ruínas góticas vitorianas da mansão Duckett, com walled gardens restaurados e parque público.','publish','closed','closed','','ducketts-grove','','','2026-09-15 19:41:48','2026-09-15 18:41:48','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/ducketts-grove/',0,'leisure','',0),(10882,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:11','2026-08-24 10:17:11','','Duckett&#8217;s Grove','','inherit','open','closed','','ducketts-grove-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:11','2026-08-24 10:17:11','',10881,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/ducketts-grove/ducketts-grove-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10883,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:08','2026-08-21 20:49:08','<p>Huntington Castle, em Clonegal, oferece tours guiados pelos porões do século XVII, salões históricos e jardins murados com o famoso yew walk. A vila de Clonegal venceu prêmios de vila mais bonita da Irlanda.</p>','Huntington Castle & Gardens','Castelo de 1625 da família Durdin-Robertson, com porões medievais, jardins murados e templo druídico.','publish','closed','closed','','huntington-castle-gardens','','','2026-09-15 19:41:48','2026-09-15 18:41:48','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/huntington-castle-gardens/',0,'leisure','',0),(10884,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:11','2026-08-24 10:17:11','','Huntington Castle &#038; Gardens','','inherit','open','closed','','huntington-castle-gardens-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:11','2026-08-24 10:17:11','',10883,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/huntington-castle-gardens/huntington-castle-gardens-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10885,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:08','2026-08-21 20:49:08','<p>Borris House guarda 800 anos de história ligada aos reis gaélicos de Leinster. Aberta na temporada com tours guiados, inclui a fábrica de renda Borris Lace e eventos de artesanato.</p>','Borris House','Casa ancestral dos MacMurrough Kavanagh, reis de Leinster, com salões Tudor e mercado de artesãos.','publish','closed','closed','','borris-house','','','2026-09-15 19:41:48','2026-09-15 18:41:48','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/borris-house/',0,'leisure','',0),(10886,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:11','2026-08-24 10:17:11','','Borris House','','inherit','open','closed','','borris-house-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:11','2026-08-24 10:17:11','',10885,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/borris-house/borris-house-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10887,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:08','2026-08-21 20:49:08','<p>Oak Park Forest Park oferece caminhadas tranquilas entre árvores centenárias, com dois lagos e observação de aves aquáticas. Um dos espaços verdes favoritos dos moradores de Carlow.</p>','Oak Park Forest Park','Floresta de carvalhos e faías com trilhas, lagos e o Oak Park Lake, perto da cidade de Carlow.','publish','closed','closed','','oak-park-forest-park','','','2026-09-15 19:41:48','2026-09-15 18:41:48','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/oak-park-forest-park/',0,'leisure','',0),(10888,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:11','2026-08-24 10:17:11','','Oak Park Forest Park','','inherit','open','closed','','oak-park-forest-park-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:11','2026-08-24 10:17:11','',10887,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/oak-park-forest-park/oak-park-forest-park-2/',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(10889,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:08','2026-08-21 20:49:08','<p>Mount Leinster domina o sul de Carlow. A estrada até os Nine Stones e a trilha até o topo recompensam com vistas de Wexford, Kilkenny, Carlow e Wicklow — e é um clássico do parapente irlandês.</p>','Mount Leinster & Nine Stones','Ponto mais alto das Blackstairs Mountains (795 m), com mirante dos Nine Stones e vista para quatro condados.','publish','closed','closed','','mount-leinster-nine-stones','','','2026-09-15 19:41:48','2026-09-15 18:41:48','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/mount-leinster-nine-stones/',0,'leisure','',0),(10890,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:12','2026-08-24 10:17:12','','Mount Leinster &#038; Nine Stones','','inherit','open','closed','','mount-leinster-nine-stones-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:12','2026-08-24 10:17:12','',10889,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/mount-leinster-nine-stones/mount-leinster-nine-stones-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10891,283039558,'2026-08-21 21:49:56','2026-08-21 20:49:56','<p>Erguido por Hugh de Lacy por volta de 1190, o castelo de Carlingford guardava o porto. O salão do século XIII e as muralhas estão abertos a visitas com vista espetacular do lough.</p>','King John\'s Castle (Carlingford)','Fortaleza normanda do século XII sobre o Carlingford Lough, com salão medieval e vista para as Mourne Mountains.','publish','closed','closed','','king-johns-castle-carlingford','','','2026-09-15 19:41:48','2026-09-15 18:41:48','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/king-johns-castle-carlingford/',0,'leisure','',0),(10892,283039558,'2026-08-24 11:17:12','2026-08-24 10:17:12','','King John&#8217;s Castle (Carlingford)','','inherit','open','closed','','king-johns-castle-carlingford-2','','','2026-08-24 11:17:12','2026-08-24 10:17:12','',10891,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/lazer/king-johns-castle-carlingford/king-johns-castle-carlingford-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(10917,283039558,'2026-08-24 12:58:14','0000-00-00 00:00:00','','Auto Draft','','auto-draft','closed','closed','','','','','2026-08-24 12:58:14','0000-00-00 00:00:00','',0,'https://conexaobrirlanda.com/?post_type=sponsor&p=10917',0,'sponsor','',0),(10941,283039558,'2026-08-25 07:52:51','2026-08-25 06:52:51','','tdCriativo_logo','','inherit','open','closed','','whatsapp-image-2026-08-24-at-12-