lates Class followed by delicious Pastries & a raffle with Sponsored Prizes. All Proceeds will be donated to Carlow Womens Aid Charity','publish','closed','closed','','pilates-pastries','','','2026-09-21 07:57:27','2026-09-21 06:57:27','',0,'http://localhost:8080/eventos/pilates-pastries/',0,'event','',0),(21430,283039560,'2026-09-21 07:57:29','2026-09-21 06:57:29','','Pilates & Pastries','','inherit','open','closed','','pilates-pastries-2','','','2026-09-21 07:57:29','2026-09-21 06:57:29','',21429,'http://localhost:8080/eventos/pilates-pastries/pilates-pastries-2/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(21440,283039560,'2026-09-21 07:57:38','2026-09-21 06:57:38','Cover crops, healthy soils and healthier farmers','Rooted in Health','Cover crops, healthy soils and healthier farmers','publish','closed','closed','','rooted-in-health','','','2026-09-21 07:57:38','2026-09-21 06:57:38','',0,'http://localhost:8080/eventos/rooted-in-health/',0,'event','',0),(21449,283039560,'2026-09-21 07:57:47','2026-09-21 06:57:47','This training will help disabled people learn more about their rights and build confidence to speak up for themselves and others.','Disability Equality Training - Carlow Disabled Person Organisation (CDPO)','This training will help disabled people learn more about their rights and build confidence to speak up for themselves and others.','publish','closed','closed','','disability-equality-training-carlow-disabled-person-organisation-cdpo','','','2026-09-21 07:57:47','2026-09-21 06:57:47','',0,'http://localhost:8080/eventos/disability-equality-training-carlow-disabled-person-organisation-cdpo/',0,'event','',0),(21450,283039560,'2026-09-21 07:57:47','2026-09-21 06:57:47','','Disability Equality Training - Carlow Disabled Person Organisation (CDPO)','','inherit','open','closed','','disability-equality-training-carlow-disabled-person-organisation-cdpo-2','','','2026-09-21 07:57:47','2026-09-21 06:57:47','',21449,'http://localhost:8080/eventos/disability-equality-training-