 touch with us</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Do you have a suggestion, a question, or would you like to advertise with us? Send us a message!</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><a href=\"https://wa.me/353899451428\">Message us on WhatsApp</a></p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Email: tdcriativo@gmail.com</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Contact','','publish','closed','closed','','contact','','','2026-09-21 15:36:37','2026-09-21 14:36:37','',0,'http://localhost:8080/contact/',0,'page','',0),(22152,0,'2026-09-21 15:36:37','2026-09-21 14:36:37','<!-- wp:heading --><h2>Who we are</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Conexão BR Irlanda is the portal of the Brazilian community in Ireland. Our goal is to connect, inform and support Brazilians who live in, or plan to move to, Ireland.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading --><h2>Our mission</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>To offer relevant information, practical guides, events and a support network so that every Brazilian can live better in Ireland.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading --><h2>Our vision</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>To be the main reference for Brazilians in Ireland.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->','About Us','','publish','closed','closed','','about-us','','','2026-09-21 15:36:37','2026-09-21 14:36:37','',0,'http://localhost:8080/about-us/',0,'page','',0),(22183,0,'2026-09-21 17:05:27','2026-09-21 16:05:27','Stage 3.2 editorial state fixture.','[STAGE32-EDITORIAL] source','','publish','closed','closed','','stage32-editorial-source','','','2026-09-21 17:05:27','2026-09-21 16:05:27','',0,'http://localhost:8080/guias/stage32-editorial-source/',0,'guide','',0),(22188,0,'2026-09-21 21:33:32','2026-09-21 20:33:32','','Home','','publish','closed','closed','','home-3','','','2026-09-21 21:33:32','2026-09-21 20:33:32','',0,'http://localhost:8080/2026/09/21/home-3/',0,'nav_menu_item','',0),(22189,0,'2026-09-21 21:33:32','2026-09-2