ra, preserva, protege o que ainda vai florescer. E, já que é tempo de conservar e preparar, talvez o inverno também seja um convite à escolha.</p><p>Antes de lançar as sementes, é preciso saber <strong>o que se deseja ver crescer</strong>. Quais sonhos merecem germinar quando o sol voltar a aquecer a terra? Quais ideias, afetos ou planos você</p><p>quer nutrir agora, no silêncio, para que brotem com força quando a estação mudar?</p><p>Porque o calor interno não se limita ao corpo — ele pode tomar forma de <strong>ideias que acendem</strong>, de <strong>intenções que se aquecem</strong>, de <strong>planos que ganham contorno </strong>mesmo sob o frio.</p><p>São pequenas brasas que mantêm viva a esperança de um novo florescer.</p><p>Enquanto lá fora tudo parece quieto, dentro de nós algo se reorganiza. O que parece pausa é, na verdade, preparo. O descanso é o terreno fértil de tudo o que virá.</p><p>Há um tipo de calor que não vem do fogo — ele nasce devagar, em silêncio, quando o frio nos convida a voltar para dentro.</p><p>É um calor que brota do coração e precisa ser nutrido com cuidado. A mente, quando alimentada por pensamentos prósperos, por ideias que inspiram e por gestos que despertam a criatividade, ajuda a manter essa chama acesa. Esse calor nos cura, nos desperta e nos permite dar o <strong>primeiro voo às ideias novas</strong> — pequenas centelhas que podem aproximar-nos de nós mesmos e das pessoas ao nosso redor.</p><p>Talvez seja justamente esse recolhimento que nos permita <strong>acessar a nossa fonte criativa.</strong></p><p>Para criar, precisamos nos sensibilizar para o que nos cerca, perceber as possibilidades à nossa volta, escolher o que nos inspira e transformar isso em algo único — uma ação, uma expressão, uma ideia que carregue paixão e determinação. Quando o ruído lá fora diminui, conseguimos ouvir essas vozes sutis dentro de nós, aquelas que pedem espaço, forma e cor.</p><p>O inverno, com sua calma, cria o terreno perfeito para imaginar e recriar o que queremos viver.</p><p>Então, acenda suas pequenas fogueiras: um livro, uma canção, uma sopa quente, uma lembrança boa. Permita-se esse calor que nasce de dentro e se espalha devagar.</p><p><em>O inverno é um lembrete de que o calor verdadeiro não está apenas no sol — está naquilo que escolhemos nutrir quando o mundo esfria.</em></p><p></p><p></p><p><u><strong>Ana Luiza A Duarte</strong></u></p><p><u><strong>Terapeuta Integrativa</strong></u></p><p></p>','O calor que nasce do inverno','Texto: Ana Luiza A Duarte Terapeuta Integrativa O inverno chega com seu ar denso, seus dias curtos e um certo recolhimento inevitável. E, enquanto o mundo parece adormecer, algo em nós começa a despertar. É o tempo de ouvir o que o corpo pede, o que o coração sussurra, o que a alma quer conservar. O frio, às vezes, é uma forma de cuidado: desacelera, preserva, protege o que ainda vai florescer. E, já que é tempo de conservar e preparar, talvez o inverno também seja um convite à escolha. Antes...','inherit','closed','closed','','10352-revision-v1','','','2026-09-26 16:39:47','2026-09-26 15:39:47','',10352,'http://localhost:8080/?p=29245',0,'revision','',0),(29260,0,'2026-09-26 16:44:56','2026-09-26 15:44:56','<p></p><p><em><strong>Por Sonia Campos, Mestra em Ciência da Informação e Especialista em Business Intelligence.</strong></em></p><p></p><p>instagram: <u>https://www.instagram.com/soninhafields/</u></p><p></p><p><strong>Muitos pequenos empreendedores trabalham duro, vendem bem, mas no final do mês ainda sentem que nunca sobra </strong><strong>dinheiro.</strong><strong>Na</strong><strong> maioria dos casos, o problema não é falta de vendas, mas falta de organização financeira.</strong></p><p><strong>Cuidar das finanças da empresa não é só controlar gastos. É entender para onde o dinheiro vai, como ele entra e como ele pode crescer. A seguir, os pontos essenciais para todo empreendedor iniciante:</strong></p><p><strong>​</strong></p><p><strong>1. Separe as finanças da empresa das suas.</strong></p><p><strong>Misturar dinheiro pessoal com o da empresa é o erro mais comum e o mais caro. Quando isso acontece:</strong></p><ul><li><p><strong>O lucro real fica difícil de identificar</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>O caixa se confunde</strong></p></li></ul><p><em><strong>Decisões importantes ficam baseadas em sensação, não em números</strong></em></p><p><strong>A solução: crie uma conta bancária separada para a empresa e pague-se com um pró-labore fixo. Isso garante clareza e segurança.</strong></p><p><strong>​</strong></p><p><strong>2. Preço certo é essencial</strong></p><p><strong>Não basta cobrar “o que o cliente aceita pagar”. O preço precisa cobrir:</strong></p><p><strong>Custos fixos (aluguel, contas, equipamentos)</strong></p><p><strong>Custos variáveis (matéria-prima, embalagem, comissões)</strong></p><p><strong>Impostos</strong></p><p><strong>Margem de lucro adequada</strong></p><p><em><strong>Sem isso, você pode sim, estar vendendo muito, mas perdendo dinheiro sem perceber.</strong></em></p><p><strong>​</strong></p><p><strong>3. Lucro é ferramenta, não é prêmio </strong></p><p><strong>Quando sobra lucro, muitos gastam tudo. Empresas sólidas usam o lucro para:</strong></p><ul><li><p><strong>Melhorar processos</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Investir em marketing</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Comprar melhores insumos</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Criar reserva financeira</strong></p></li></ul><p><em><strong>Negócios que reinvestem crescem; negócios que consomem tudo, estagnam.</strong></em></p><p><strong>​</strong></p><p><strong>4. Tenha uma reserva financeira</strong></p><p><strong>Problemas acontecem. Uma reserva financeira evita desespero quando o caixa aperta. Ela ajuda a:</strong></p><ul><li><p><strong>Passar por meses mais fracos</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Evitar dívidas emergenciais</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Tomar decisões sem pressão</strong></p></li></ul><p><em><strong>Não precisa começar grande, mas comece já, mesmo aos poucos.</strong></em></p><p><strong>​</strong></p><p><strong>5. Acompanhe os números sempre</strong></p><p><strong>Não precisa de sistemas complexos, mas controle diário é essencial. Tenha clareza sobre:</strong></p><ul><li><p><strong>Quanto entrou</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Quanto saiu</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Obrigações futuras</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Onde estão ocorrendo perdas</strong></p></li></ul><p><em><strong>Quem não acompanha números trabalha no escuro. Quem acompanha, decide com segurança.</strong></em></p><p><em><strong>​</strong></em></p><p><strong>6. O maior risco é perder dinheiro sem perceber</strong></p><p><strong>Muitos empreendedores faturam, mas não veem lucro porque:</strong></p><ul><li><p><strong>Precificam errado</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Gastam sem controle</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Não acompanham os números</strong></p></li></ul><p><em><strong>Se você sente que nunca sobra dinheiro, o problema não está no quanto vende, mas em como gerencia o que entra.</strong></em></p><p><strong> </strong></p><p><strong>Conclusão:</strong></p><p><strong>Gestão financeira não é burocracia, é estratégia. Empreendedores que entendem seus números:</strong></p><ul><li><p><strong>Tomam decisões melhores</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Reduzem perdas</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Criam crescimento consistente </strong></p></li></ul><p><em><strong>Se você sente que trabalha muito e o dinheiro nunca sobra, ligue um alerta EMERGENCIAL, talvez você esteja trabalhando por trabalhar, deixando passar as oportunidades de lucro que podem fazer o seu negócio decolar. </strong></em></p><p></p><p><strong>Sonia Campos Especialista em Business IntelligenceConsultora e Professora UniversitáriaMestre em Ciência da Informação</strong></p><p></p><p><strong>Instagram </strong><u><strong>@soninhafields</strong></u></p>','Financial Management: The Invisible Foundation of Every Business That Prospers','By Sonia Campos, MSc in Information Science and Specialist in Business Intelligence. instagram: https://www.instagram.com/soninhafields/','inherit','closed','closed','','29191-revision-v1','','','2026-09-26 16:44:56','2026-09-26 15:44:56','',29191,'http://localhost:8080/?p=29260',0,'revision','',0),(29261,0,'2026-09-26 16:45:37','2026-09-26 15:45:37','<p></p><p><em><strong>By Sonia Campos, MSc in Information Science and Specialist in Business Intelligence.</strong></em></p><p></p><p>instagram: <u>https://www.instagram.com/soninhafields/</u></p><p></p><p><strong>Many small business owners work hard and sell well, but at the end of the month still feel that no money is ever left over. In most cases the problem is not a lack of sales, but a lack of financial organisation.</strong></p><p><strong>Caring for the company’s finances is not only about controlling expenses. It is about understanding where the money goes, how it comes in and how it can grow. Below are the essential points for every beginning entrepreneur:</strong></p><p><strong> </strong></p><p><strong>1. Separate the company’s finances from your own.</strong></p><p><strong>Mixing personal money with the company’s is the most common and the most expensive mistake. When that happens:</strong></p><ul><li><p><strong>The real profit becomes hard to identify</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>The cash flow gets muddled</strong></p></li></ul><p><em><strong>Important decisions end up based on a feeling, not on numbers</strong></em></p><p><strong>The solution: open a separate business bank account and pay yourself a fixed salary. That guarantees clarity and security.</strong></p><p><strong> </strong></p><p><strong>2. The right price is essential</strong></p><p><strong>It is not enough to charge “what the customer is willing to pay”. The price needs to cover:</strong></p><p><strong>Fixed costs (rent, bills, equipment)</strong></p><p><strong>Variable costs (raw materials, packaging, commissions)</strong></p><p><strong>Taxes</strong></p><p><strong>An adequate profit margin</strong></p><p><em><strong>Without this you may well be selling a lot and still losing money without noticing.</strong></em></p><p><strong> </strong></p><p><strong>3. Profit is a tool, not a prize</strong></p><p><strong>When there is profit left over, many people spend it all. Solid businesses use profit to:</strong></p><ul><li><p><strong>Improve processes</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Invest in marketing</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Buy better inputs</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Build a financial reserve</strong></p></li></ul><p><em><strong>Businesses that reinvest grow; businesses that consume everything stagnate.</strong></em></p><p><strong> </strong></p><p><strong>4. Have a financial reserve</strong></p><p><strong>Problems happen. A financial reserve avoids desperation when cash is tight. It helps you to:</strong></p><ul><li><p><strong>Get through weaker months</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Avoid emergency debt</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Make decisions without pressure</strong></p></li></ul><p><em><strong>It does not have to start big, but start now, even little by little.</strong></em></p><p><strong> </strong></p><p><strong>5. Always track the numbers</strong></p><p><strong>You do not need complex systems, but daily control is essential. Be clear about:</strong></p><ul><li><p><strong>How much came in</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>How much went out</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Future obligations</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Where losses are occurring</strong></p></li></ul><p><em><strong>Whoever does not track the numbers works in the dark. Whoever does, decides with confidence.</strong></em></p><p><em><strong> </strong></em></p><p><strong>6. The biggest risk is losing money without noticing</strong></p><p><strong>Many entrepreneurs take in revenue but see no profit because they:</strong></p><ul><li><p><strong>Price incorrectly</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Spend without control</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Do not track the numbers</strong></p></li></ul><p><em><strong>If you feel that no money is ever left over, the problem is not how much you sell, but how you manage what comes in.</strong></em></p><p><strong> </strong></p><p><strong>Conclusion:</strong></p><p><strong>Financial management is not bureaucracy, it is strategy. Entrepreneurs who understand their numbers:</strong></p><ul><li><p><strong>Make better decisions</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Reduce losses</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Create consistent growth</strong></p></li></ul><p><em><strong>If you feel you work very hard and the money is never left over, raise an URGENT flag: perhaps you are working for the sake of working, letting profit opportunities pass that could take your business to the next level.</strong></em></p><p></p><p><strong>Sonia Campos, Specialist in Business Intelligence, Consultant and University Lecturer, MSc in Information Science</strong></p><p></p><p><strong>Instagram </strong><u><strong>@soninhafields</strong></u></p>\n','Financial Management: The Invisible Foundation of Every Business That Prospers','By Sonia Campos, MSc in Information Science and Specialist in Business Intelligence. instagram: https://www.instagram.com/soninhafields/','inherit','closed','closed','','29191-revision-v1','','','2026-09-26 16:45:37','2026-09-26 15:45:37','',29191,'http://localhost:8080/?p=29261',0,'revision','',0),(29425,283039560,'2026-09-26 17:04:06','2026-09-26 16:04:06','http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/laois_tourism_events.xml_.txt','laois_tourism_events.xml_.txt','','private','open','closed','','laois_tourism_events-xml_-txt','','','2026-09-26 17:04:06','2026-09-26 16:04:06','',0,'http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/laois_tourism_events.xml_.txt',0,'attachment','',0),(100001,283039560,'2026-08-31 09:25:52','2026-08-31 09:25:52','<p>The gallery in Mountmellick library is delighted to host for the month of September, the exhibition of painting and sculpture ,“Flora, Fauna and Fable”, which is part of the Laois Homecoming Festival. This exhibition of new local works, a core part of the festival’s visual arts and all are welcome.</p>','Art Exhibition At Mountmellick Library','The gallery in Mountmellick library is delighted to host for the month of September, the exhibition of painting and sculpture ,“Flora, Fauna and Fable”, which is part of the Laois Homecoming Festival. This exhibition of new local works, a core part of the festival’s visual arts and all are welcome.','publish','closed','closed','','art-exhibition-at-mountmellick-library','','','2026-08-31 09:25:52','2026-08-31 09:25:52','',0,'http://localhost:8080/eventos/art-exhibition-at-mountmellick-library/',0,'event','',0),(100002,283039560,'2026-08-31 10:49:20','2026-08-31 10:49:20','<p>This September, Dunamaise Arts Centre is delighted to be part of LASTA 2026, a national youth-led festival celebrating fresh ideas, contemporary creativity and new voices in the arts. Across visual art, professional development and immersive performance, Dunamaise presents three exciting events as part of this year’s programme.</p>','Lasta 2026 at Dunamaise Arts Centre','This September, Dunamaise Arts Centre is delighted to be part of LASTA 2026, a national youth-led festival celebrating fresh ideas, contemporary creativity and new voices in the arts. Across visual art, professional development and immersive performance, Dunamaise presents three exciting events as part of this year’s programme.','publish','closed','closed','','lasta-2026-at-dunamaise-arts-centre','','','2026-08-31 10:49:20','2026-08-31 10:49:20','',0,'http://localhost:8080/eventos/lasta-2026-at-dunamaise-arts-centre/',0,'event','',0),(100003,283039560,'2026-07-01 11:33:02','2026-07-01 11:33:02','<p>Join Aislinn from In Stitches for a fun and creative children’s crochet workshop at Dunamaise Arts Centre. Young makers will learn the basics of crochet in a relaxed and supportive environment, developing new skills while creating their own handmade projects. Perfect for beginners, this workshop encourages creativity, patience, and confidence through the art of making.</p>','In Stitches By Aislinn Children\'s Crochet Workshop','Join Aislinn from In Stitches for a fun and creative children’s crochet workshop at Dunamaise Arts Centre. Young makers will learn the basics of crochet in a relaxed and supportive environment, developing new skills while creating their own handmade projects. Perfect for beginners, this workshop encourages creativity, patience, and confidence through the art of making.','publish','closed','closed','','in-stitches-by-aislinn-childrens-crochet-workshop-2','','','2026-07-01 11:33:02','2026-07-01 11:33:02','',0,'http://localhost:8080/eventos/in-stitches-by-aislinn-childrens-crochet-workshop-2/',0,'event','',0),(100004,283039560,'2026-08-25 10:06:14','2026-08-25 10:06:14','<p>Looking to improve flexibility, reduce stress, and prioritise your wellbeing? Join our new4-Week Yoga Programme for Women at Sauna Sessions Stradbally. This beginner-friendly programme combines guided stretching and movement sessions designed to help improve mobility, flexibility, relaxation, and overall wellbeing.</p>','Yoga & Sauna Session','Looking to improve flexibility, reduce stress, and prioritise your wellbeing? Join our new4-Week Yoga Programme for Women at Sauna Sessions Stradbally. This beginner-friendly programme combines guided stretching and movement sessions designed to help improve mobility, flexibility, relaxation, and overall wellbeing.','publish','closed','closed','','yoga-sauna-session-2','','','2026-08-25 10:06:14','2026-08-25 10:06:14','',0,'http://localhost:8080/eventos/yoga-sauna-session-2/',0,'event','',0),(100005,283039560,'2026-08-31 14:32:31','2026-08-31 14:32:31','<p>Laois Arthouse is delighted to announce a seven-week visual art workshop series for adults led by resident artist Lia Laimböck. Lia will be sharing her unique fabric collage process with participants, inviting each participant to create two related works over the 7-week period. Using the theme “What were you thinking of darling?”, Lia will guide participants to make a portrait in collage and to create a second connected work that reflects what the person or animal, portrayed, is thinking.</p>','What Were You Thinking Of Darling?','Laois Arthouse is delighted to announce a seven-week visual art workshop series for adults led by resident artist Lia Laimböck. Lia will be sharing her unique fabric collage process with participants, inviting each participant to create two related works over the 7-week period. Using the theme “What were you thinking of darling?”, Lia will guide participants to make a portrait in collage and to create a second connected work that reflects what the person or animal, portrayed, is thinking.','publish','closed','closed','','what-were-you-thinking-of-darling','','','2026-08-31 14:32:31','2026-08-31 14:32:31','',0,'http://localhost:8080/eventos/what-were-you-thinking-of-darling/',0,'event','',0),(100006,283039560,'2026-09-02 11:22:02','2026-09-02 11:22:02','<p>Discover the joy of crochet with our 6-week Beginners Crochet Course at Portlaoise Library, led by Courtney from LOETB. Perfect for complete beginners, this friendly course will guide you through the basics of crochet in a relaxed and supportive environment. All you need to bring is a size 4 crochet hook and a ball of yarn.</p>','Beginners Crochet Classes At Portlaoise Library','Discover the joy of crochet with our 6-week Beginners Crochet Course at Portlaoise Library, led by Courtney from LOETB. Perfect for complete beginners, this friendly course will guide you through the basics of crochet in a relaxed and supportive environment. All you need to bring is a size 4 crochet hook and a ball of yarn.','publish','closed','closed','','beginners-crochet-classes-at-portlaoise-library','','','2026-09-02 11:22:02','2026-09-02 11:22:02','',0,'http://localhost:8080/eventos/beginners-crochet-classes-at-portlaoise-library/',0,'event','',0),(100007,283039560,'2026-08-26 08:48:16','2026-08-26 08:48:16','<p>Looking for a fun way to improve your fitness, build strength, and boost your confidence? Join Bootcamp with Malone Fitness, a supportive 6-week programme designed for beginners and those returning to exercise. No matter your fitness level, you’ll be welcomed into a friendly and encouraging environment where you can move at your own pace and achieve your goals.</p>','Bootcamp with Malone Fitness','Looking for a fun way to improve your fitness, build strength, and boost your confidence? Join Bootcamp with Malone Fitness, a supportive 6-week programme designed for beginners and those returning to exercise. No matter your fitness level, you’ll be welcomed into a friendly and encouraging environment where you can move at your own pace and achieve your goals.','publish','closed','closed','','bootcamp-with-malone-fitness','','','2026-08-26 08:48:16','2026-08-26 08:48:16','',0,'http://localhost:8080/eventos/bootcamp-with-malone-fitness/',0,'event','',0),(100008,283039560,'2026-08-31 13:59:38','2026-08-31 13:59:38','<p>Celebrate European Week of Sport by investing in your health and wellbeing with a welcoming 6-week Pilates programme in Portarlington, led by Sabrina. Whether you are new to Pilates or have previous experience, these classes are suitable for adults of all fitness levels. Pilates is a popular low-impact exercise that strengthens the body, improves mobility, and helps reduce everyday aches and pains.</p>','Pilates Programme with Sabrina','Celebrate European Week of Sport by investing in your health and wellbeing with a welcoming 6-week Pilates programme in Portarlington, led by Sabrina. Whether you are new to Pilates or have previous experience, these classes are suitable for adults of all fitness levels. Pilates is a popular low-impact exercise that strengthens the body, improves mobility, and helps reduce everyday aches and pains.','publish','closed','closed','','pilates-programme-with-sabrina','','','2026-08-31 13:59:38','2026-08-31 13:59:38','',0,'http://localhost:8080/eventos/pilates-programme-with-sabrina/',0,'event','',0),(100011,283039560,'2026-09-02 09:46:27','2026-09-02 09:46:27','<p>As the Wheel turns towards autumn, you are warmly invited to Harvest of the Heart a full-day Mabon and Harvest Full Moon retreat created to help you slow down, reconnect and honour everything you have cultivated this year. Mabon marks the Autumn Equinox, a sacred pause when light and darkness return to balance.</p>','Mabon & Full Moon Day Retreat','As the Wheel turns towards autumn, you are warmly invited to Harvest of the Heart a full-day Mabon and Harvest Full Moon retreat created to help you slow down, reconnect and honour everything you have cultivated this year. Mabon marks the Autumn Equinox, a sacred pause when light and darkness return to balance.','publish','closed','closed','','mabon-full-moon-day-retreat-2','','','2026-09-02 09:46:27','2026-09-02 09:46:27','',0,'http://localhost:8080/eventos/mabon-full-moon-day-retreat-2/',0,'event','',0),(100012,283039560,'2026-08-31 08:26:02','2026-08-31 08:26:02','<p>A beautiful afternoon of awakening, healing, transformation and deep relaxation in the peaceful surroundings of The Goat House Sauna. Kundalini Activation supports emotional release, inner calm, greater clarity and awareness, renewed energy and a deeper connection with yourself and Spirit. Spaces are limited for intimacy and personal time.</p>','Kundalini Activation At The Goat House Sauna.','A beautiful afternoon of awakening, healing, transformation and deep relaxation in the peaceful surroundings of The Goat House Sauna. Kundalini Activation supports emotional release, inner calm, greater clarity and awareness, renewed energy and a deeper connection with yourself and Spirit. Spaces are limited for intimacy and personal time.','publish','closed','closed','','kundalini-activation-at-the-goat-house-sauna','','','2026-08-31 08:26:02','2026-08-31 08:26:02','',0,'http://localhost:8080/eventos/kundalini-activation-at-the-goat-house-sauna/',0,'event','',0),(100014,283039560,'2026-04-01 11:35:10','2026-04-01 11:35:10','<p>The fantastic Muddy River Band have been thrilling theatre audiences across the country with their spell binding show honouring the music legacy of three of the greatest songwriters of our time; Bob Dylan, Neil Young and Van Morrison. Now the band bring a very special unplugged acoustic performance to the stage. Whether you’re a lifelong fan or discovering these legends for the first time, this show will leave you inspired and longing for more.</p>','The Muddy River Band Acoustic Performance','The fantastic Muddy River Band have been thrilling theatre audiences across the country with their spell binding show honouring the music legacy of three of the greatest songwriters of our time; Bob Dylan, Neil Young and Van Morrison. Now the band bring a very special unplugged acoustic performance to the stage. Whether you’re a lifelong fan or discovering these legends for the first time, this show will leave you inspired and longing for more.','publish','closed','closed','','the-muddy-river-band-acoustic-performance','','','2026-04-01 11:35:10','2026-04-01 11:35:10','',0,'http://localhost:8080/eventos/the-muddy-river-band-acoustic-performance/',0,'event','',0),(100015,283039560,'2026-03-16 12:36:37','2026-03-16 12:36:37','<p>Smash-hit Irish comedian, best-selling author, podcast host and viral online star Emma Doran is back on the road with her brand-new stand-up show Emmaculate. There’s no such thing as a perfect family… but Emma wouldn’t want one anyway. In this hilarious new show, the many trials and tribulations of Emma’s blended family are laid bare as she takes a brutally funny look at womanhood, relationships and the chaos of modern life.</p>','Emma Doran – “Emmaculate” In The Midlands Park Hotel','Smash-hit Irish comedian, best-selling author, podcast host and viral online star Emma Doran is back on the road with her brand-new stand-up show Emmaculate. There’s no such thing as a perfect family… but Emma wouldn’t want one anyway. In this hilarious new show, the many trials and tribulations of Emma’s blended family are laid bare as she takes a brutally funny look at womanhood, relationships and the chaos of modern life.','publish','closed','closed','','emma-doran-emmaculate-in-the-midlands-park-hotel','','','2026-03-16 12:36:37','2026-03-16 12:36:37','',0,'http://localhost:8080/eventos/emma-doran-emmaculate-in-the-midlands-park-hotel/',0,'event','',0),(100016,283039560,'2026-07-13 11:51:28','2026-07-13 11:51:28','<p>Get ready for a spectacular evening celebrating the timeless music of one of rock’s most iconic voices. From rock anthems to heartfelt ballads, enjoy a night filled with nostalgia, great music and incredible entertainment as we celebrate the songs that have become the soundtrack to generations. Whether you’re a lifelong fan or simply love a great night of live music, this is a tribute experience not to be missed.</p>','Rod Stewart Tribute Show','Get ready for a spectacular evening celebrating the timeless music of one of rock’s most iconic voices. From rock anthems to heartfelt ballads, enjoy a night filled with nostalgia, great music and incredible entertainment as we celebrate the songs that have become the soundtrack to generations. Whether you’re a lifelong fan or simply love a great night of live music, this is a tribute experience not to be missed.','publish','closed','closed','','rod-stewart-tribute-show','','','2026-07-13 11:51:28','2026-07-13 11:51:28','',0,'http://localhost:8080/eventos/rod-stewart-tribute-show/',0,'event','',0),(100017,283039560,'2026-09-08 09:55:04','2026-09-08 09:55:04','<p>We are very much so in the shadow of eclipse season so go easy on yourself if you still feel all over the shop, the September juggle and struggle is real for so many.  Put something in the calendar just for you, to really get clear and aligned within yourself again, you deserve it the most. Spaces are limited to honour the depth of the work so book early to avoid disappointment.</p>','September Sanctuary Day Retreat','We are very much so in the shadow of eclipse season so go easy on yourself if you still feel all over the shop, the September juggle and struggle is real for so many.  Put something in the calendar just for you, to really get clear and aligned within yourself again, you deserve it the most. Spaces are limited to honour the depth of the work so book early to avoid disappointment.','publish','closed','closed','','september-sanctuary-day-retreat','','','2026-09-08 09:55:04','2026-09-08 09:55:04','',0,'http://localhost:8080/eventos/september-sanctuary-day-retreat/',0,'event','',0),(100018,283039560,'2026-08-31 13:21:46','2026-08-31 13:21:46','<p>This is a drop-in event so whether you’re newly engaged and looking for your perfect venue or have already booked with us here at The Manor, call in any time to meet Alex and the wedding team for a tour of our wedding venue. Situated in the beautiful heritage Town of Abbeyleix, in Co. Laois and with Heywood Gardens &amp; Abbeyleix Bog on our doorstep, our idyllic country setting ensures your day has a relaxed yet elegant feel.</p>','Abbeyleix Manor Hotel Wedding Showcase','This is a drop-in event so whether you’re newly engaged and looking for your perfect venue or have already booked with us here at The Manor, call in any time to meet Alex and the wedding team for a tour of our wedding venue. Situated in the beautiful heritage Town of Abbeyleix, in Co. Laois and with Heywood Gardens &amp; Abbeyleix Bog on our doorstep, our idyllic country setting ensures your day has a relaxed yet elegant feel.','publish','closed','closed','','abbeyleix-manor-hotel-wedding-showcase','','','2026-08-31 13:21:46','2026-08-31 13:21:46','',0,'http://localhost:8080/eventos/abbeyleix-manor-hotel-wedding-showcase/',0,'event','',0),(100020,283039560,'2026-08-26 08:35:29','2026-08-26 08:35:29','<p>Featuring a stacked roster of Irish and international talent, expect high-stakes championship bouts, bitter rivalries, and jaw-dropping athleticism. Whether you’re a lifelong fan or brand new to the action, this is your chance to experience the intensity, drama and spectacle of live wrestling up close.</p>','Over The Top Wrestling At Midlands Park Hotel','Featuring a stacked roster of Irish and international talent, expect high-stakes championship bouts, bitter rivalries, and jaw-dropping athleticism. Whether you’re a lifelong fan or brand new to the action, this is your chance to experience the intensity, drama and spectacle of live wrestling up close.','publish','closed','closed','','over-the-top-wrestling-at-midlands-park-hotel','','','2026-08-26 08:35:29','2026-08-26 08:35:29','',0,'http://localhost:8080/eventos/over-the-top-wrestling-at-midlands-park-hotel/',0,'event','',0),(100021,283039560,'2026-09-02 08:36:29','2026-09-02 08:36:29','<p>For those who remember the 80s &amp; 90s, you’ll know exactly what this means. After years away, the legendary local DJ duo Double L are getting back behind the decks for one final show. This is your chance to relive the good old days, hear the classics that filled the dancefloors, and party with Double L one last time</p>','Double L Reunion Music Night','For those who remember the 80s &amp; 90s, you’ll know exactly what this means. After years away, the legendary local DJ duo Double L are getting back behind the decks for one final show. This is your chance to relive the good old days, hear the classics that filled the dancefloors, and party with Double L one last time','publish','closed','closed','','double-l-reunion-music-night','','','2026-09-02 08:36:29','2026-09-02 08:36:29','',0,'http://localhost:8080/eventos/double-l-reunion-music-night/',0,'event','',0),(100023,283039560,'2026-09-21 13:02:06','2026-09-21 13:02:06','<p>Join us at Portlaoise Library for a four-week Chair Yoga programme as part of Positive Ageing Week. Chair Yoga is a gentle and accessible form of exercise that can help improve mobility, flexibility, strength and overall wellbeing. Using a chair for support, participants will be guided through a series of movements and stretches suitable for a range of abilities.</p>','Chair Yoga At Portlaoise Library','Join us at Portlaoise Library for a four-week Chair Yoga programme as part of Positive Ageing Week. Chair Yoga is a gentle and accessible form of exercise that can help improve mobility, flexibility, strength and overall wellbeing. Using a chair for support, participants will be guided through a series of movements and stretches suitable for a range of abilities.','publish','closed','closed','','chair-yoga-at-portlaoise-library','','','2026-09-21 13:02:06','2026-09-21 13:02:06','',0,'http://localhost:8080/eventos/chair-yoga-at-portlaoise-library/',0,'event','',0),(100025,283039560,'2026-09-01 08:25:42','2026-09-01 08:25:42','<p>Get ready for an engaging day dedicated to telephone triage nurses. This in-person seminar is perfect for nurses looking to sharpen their skills, share experiences, and connect with colleagues in a relaxed setting. Don’t miss out on discovering the latest tips and practical advice to enhance your triage techniques.</p>','InmoTelephone Triage Nurses Section Seminar','Get ready for an engaging day dedicated to telephone triage nurses. This in-person seminar is perfect for nurses looking to sharpen their skills, share experiences, and connect with colleagues in a relaxed setting. Don’t miss out on discovering the latest tips and practical advice to enhance your triage techniques.','publish','closed','closed','','inmotelephone-triage-nurses-section-seminar','','','2026-09-01 08:25:42','2026-09-01 08:25:42','',0,'http://localhost:8080/eventos/inmotelephone-triage-nurses-section-seminar/',0,'event','',0),(100026,283039560,'2026-08-31 10:04:19','2026-08-31 10:04:19','<p>Join the Local Enterprise Office Laois for a relaxed Lunch &amp; Learn session designed for local businesses, startups, and anyone thinking about starting a business. Whether you are starting out or looking to grow your business, this session will give you valuable insights and connections to help you move forward. Places are limited, so early booking is advised.</p>','Lunch and Learn At BloomHQ','Join the Local Enterprise Office Laois for a relaxed Lunch &amp; Learn session designed for local businesses, startups, and anyone thinking about starting a business. Whether you are starting out or looking to grow your business, this session will give you valuable insights and connections to help you move forward. Places are limited, so early booking is advised.','publish','closed','closed','','lunch-and-learn-at-bloomhq','','','2026-08-31 10:04:19','2026-08-31 10:04:19','',0,'http://localhost:8080/eventos/lunch-and-learn-at-bloomhq/',0,'event','',0),(100027,283039560,'2026-03-23 10:35:43','2026-03-23 10:35:43','<p>Four unforgettable nights of comedy, music, and mayhem as the Tony Award–winning musical Avenue Q brings its outrageous charm to the Dunamaise Arts Centre. Winner of the Tony Awards for Best Musical, Best Book, and Best Score, Avenue Q is a smart, cheeky, and irresistibly funny musical that blends puppets, people, and pop-culture satire to tell a story about finding your purpose in a hilarious and very relatable way.</p>','Avenue Q Hit Musical','Four unforgettable nights of comedy, music, and mayhem as the Tony Award–winning musical Avenue Q brings its outrageous charm to the Dunamaise Arts Centre. Winner of the Tony Awards for Best Musical, Best Book, and Best Score, Avenue Q is a smart, cheeky, and irresistibly funny musical that blends puppets, people, and pop-culture satire to tell a story about finding your purpose in a hilarious and very relatable way.','publish','closed','closed','','avenue-q-hit-musical','','','2026-03-23 10:35:43','2026-03-23 10:35:43','',0,'http://localhost:8080/eventos/avenue-q-hit-musical/',0,'event','',0),(100029,283039560,'2026-04-07 14:00:12','2026-04-07 14:00:12','<p>Vittorio Angelone is an Italian-Irish comedian from Belfast. He has accelerated through the comedy ranks at an anxiety inducing rate and was nominated for Best Newcomer at the Edinburgh Fringe in 2022.There’s a special joy in seeing a comedian who is totally in control of his material, who keeps pushing the boundaries, who is smarter and quicker than anyone else in the room, who unapologetically believes that comedy is an art form and is doing his best to prove it.</p>','Vittorio Angelone Extra Show Added','Vittorio Angelone is an Italian-Irish comedian from Belfast. He has accelerated through the comedy ranks at an anxiety inducing rate and was nominated for Best Newcomer at the Edinburgh Fringe in 2022.There’s a special joy in seeing a comedian who is totally in control of his material, who keeps pushing the boundaries, who is smarter and quicker than anyone else in the room, who unapologetically believes that comedy is an art form and is doing his best to prove it.','publish','closed','closed','','vittorio-angelone-extra-show-added','','','2026-04-07 14:00:12','2026-04-07 14:00:12','',0,'http://localhost:8080/eventos/vittorio-angelone-extra-show-added/',0,'event','',0),(100585,0,'2026-09-26 17:44:59','2026-09-26 16:44:59','<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Artigos e notícias para a comunidade brasileira na Irlanda.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Blog','','inherit','closed','closed','','10-revision-v1','','','2026-09-26 17:44:59','2026-09-26 16:44:59','',10,'http://localhost:8080/?p=100585',0,'revision','',0),(101069,283039558,'2026-08-16 15:20:11','2026-08-16 14:20:11','<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Articles and news for the Brazilian community in Ireland, with practical information to help you live, work and settle in here.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n','Blog','','publish','closed','closed','','blog','','','2026-09-26 18:04:18','2026-09-26 17:04:18','',0,'http://localhost:8080/blog/',0,'page','',0),(101070,0,'2026-09-26 18:04:18','2026-09-26 17:04:18','<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Articles and news for the Brazilian community in Ireland, with practical information to help you live, work and settle in here.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n','Blog','','inherit','closed','closed','','101069-revision-v1','','','2026-09-26 18:04:18','2026-09-26 17:04:18','',101069,'http://localhost:8080/?p=101070',0,'revision','',0),(102920,0,'2026-09-27 10:30:52','2026-09-27 09:30:52','<p>Esta casa rural, caiada de branco e com telhado de colmo, aninha-se à sombra da montanha Keadeen, na estrada entre Donard e Rathdangan, no condado de Wicklow. Hoje parece um lugar improvável para um conflito, mas no inverno de 1799 a história foi outra: foi a partir desta casa que o famoso rebelde Michael Dwyer resistiu ao cerco das forças britânicas. Um dos seus companheiros, Samuel McAllister, atraiu o fogo sobre si e morreu, permitindo que Dwyer escapasse pelas montanhas cobertas de neve.</p><p>A casa foi depois destruída por um incêndio e ficou em ruínas durante quase 150 anos, até ser restaurada à sua forma original no século XX. Contém hoje objetos da época, tanto do dia a dia — como um espeto de assar e uma batedeira de manteiga — como de combate, incluindo picos mortais.</p>','Dwyer McAllister Cottage','Descrição alterada depois de a tradução ter sido escrita.','inherit','closed','closed','','20948-revision-v1','','','2026-09-27 10:30:52','2026-09-27 09:30:52','',20948,'http://localhost:8080/?p=102920',0,'revision','',0),(102921,0,'2026-09-27 10:30:53','2026-09-27 09:30:53','<p>Esta casa rural, caiada de branco e com telhado de colmo, aninha-se à sombra da montanha Keadeen, na estrada entre Donard e Rathdangan, no condado de Wicklow. Hoje parece um lugar improvável para um conflito, mas no inverno de 1799 a história foi outra: foi a partir desta casa que o famoso rebelde Michael Dwyer resistiu ao cerco das forças britânicas. Um dos seus companheiros, Samuel McAllister, atraiu o fogo sobre si e morreu, permitindo que Dwyer escapasse pelas montanhas cobertas de neve.</p><p>A casa foi depois destruída por um incêndio e ficou em ruínas durante quase 150 anos, até ser restaurada à sua forma original no século XX. Contém hoje objetos da época, tanto do dia a dia — como um espeto de assar e uma batedeira de manteiga — como de combate, incluindo picos mortais.</p>','Dwyer McAllister Cottage','Casa rural restaurada aos pés da montanha Keadeen, palco de um episódio da Rebelião de 1798 e hoje pequeno museu de época.','inherit','closed','closed','','20948-revision-v1','','','2026-09-27 10:30:53','2026-09-27 09:30:53','',20948,'http://localhost:8080/?p=102921',0,'revision','',0),(103058,0,'2026-09-27 10:35:32','2026-09-27 09:35:32','<p>Esta casa rural, caiada de branco e com telhado de colmo, aninha-se à sombra da montanha Keadeen, na estrada entre Donard e Rathdangan, no condado de Wicklow. Hoje parece um lugar improvável para um conflito, mas no inverno de 1799 a história foi outra: foi a partir desta casa que o famoso rebelde Michael Dwyer resistiu ao cerco das forças britânicas. Um dos seus companheiros, Samuel McAllister, atraiu o fogo sobre si e morreu, permitindo que Dwyer escapasse pelas montanhas cobertas de neve.</p><p>A casa foi depois destruída por um incêndio e ficou em ruínas durante quase 150 anos, até ser restaurada à sua forma original no século XX. Contém hoje objetos da época, tanto do dia a dia — como um espeto de assar e uma batedeira de manteiga — como de combate, incluindo picos mortais.</p>','Dwyer McAllister Cottage','Descrição alterada depois de a tradução ter sido escrita.','inherit','closed','closed','','20948-revision-v1','','','2026-09-27 10:35:32','2026-09-27 09:35:32','',20948,'http://localhost:8080/?p=103058',0,'revision','',0),(103059,0,'2026-09-27 10:35:33','2026-09-27 09:35:33','<p>Esta casa rural, caiada de branco e com telhado de colmo, aninha-se à sombra da montanha Keadeen, na estrada entre Donard e Rathdangan, no condado 